-- 새 학교 222곳 평가 요소 비중(CDS C7)·국제학생 재정지원(CDS H6·공식 장학금 페이지) — 2026-09 조사, 사용자 승인
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['class_rank','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://mailmissouri.sharepoint.com/:b:/s/IRQI-Website-Ogrp/EfpfiY0eArJGlaBY-aJbELsBLc5O0Ee56iU6zrLG0O7PCQ', demonstrated_interest=false, merit_intl='International Honors Scholarship, International Merit Scholarship, Global Black & Gold Scholarship (legacy); Honors College competitive awards', merit_intl_en='International Honors Scholarship, International Merit Scholarship, Global Black & Gold Scholarship (legacy); Honors College competitive awards', merit_note='국제학생은 지원서만 내면 International Honors Scholarship(연 $20,000)과 International Merit Scholarship(연 $10,000) 심사를 자동으로 받아요. 가을 입학은 12월 1일까지 모든 서류를 내야 장학금 심사 대상이 되고, SAT/ACT는 필수는 아니지만 내면 좋다고 안내해요. 부모가 Mizzou 졸업생이면 Global Black & Gold Scholarship도 받을 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='International first-year applicants are automatically reviewed for the International Honors Scholarship ($20,000/yr) and International Merit Scholarship ($10,000/yr); all materials must be in by December 1 for fall, and SAT/ACT is preferred but not required. Children of Mizzou alumni can also receive the Global Black & Gold Scholarship, and Honors College competitive awards require a separate application.', aid_source_url='https://admissions.missouri.edu/costs-aid/scholarships/international-student-scholarships/' where id=149;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','standardized_tests','essay']::text[], c7_source_url='https://ir.auburn.edu/common-data-set/2025/section-c.php', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=0, intl_aid_avg=null, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='Auburn의 공식 Common Data Set에는 국제학생(비거주 외국인)에게 학교 자체 장학금·그랜트가 제공되지 않는다고 적혀 있어요. 입학처 국제학생 페이지에는 신입생 장학금 신청 마감(2월 12일, AUSOM)이 안내되어 있지만 국제학생 자격은 따로 명시되어 있지 않으니 지원 전에 입학처에 확인하는 게 좋아요.', merit_note_en='Auburn''s official Common Data Set states that institutional scholarship and grant aid is not available to international (nonresident) undergraduates. The international admissions page lists the Feb 12 freshman scholarship application deadline (AUSOM), but does not state international eligibility, so confirm with admissions.', aid_source_url='https://ir.auburn.edu/common-data-set/2025/section-h.php' where id=150;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','class_rank','gpa','essay','character']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.chapman.edu/campus-services/institutional-research/_files/cds/cds_2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=182, intl_aid_avg=24489, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Merit scholarships (automatic review at admission); limited need-based aid', merit_intl_en='Merit scholarships (automatic review at admission); limited need-based aid', merit_note='국제학생도 성적 장학금(merit)과 need-based 장학금 대상이에요. 합격자는 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 merit 장학금 심사를 받고, 신입생은 연 최대 $40,000까지 받을 수 있어요. 국제학생 need-based 지원은 연 최대 $15,000으로 제한적이고, 학교는 국제학생에 대해 need-aware 방식이에요.', merit_note_en='International students are eligible for merit and need-based scholarships. All admitted students are automatically reviewed for merit awards (up to $40,000 per year for first-years) with no separate application. Need-based aid for internationals is limited (up to $15,000 per year), and Chapman describes itself as need-aware.', aid_source_url='https://www.chapman.edu/admission/undergraduate/how-to-apply/international-students/tuition-and-costs.aspx', need_blind_intl=false where id=151;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.creighton.edu/sites/default/files/CDS_2025-2026_C.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=75, intl_aid_avg=41313, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Creighton merit scholarships (automatic); Matteo Ricci, S.J. Awards; Next Generation Leaders Program (separate application)', merit_intl_en='Creighton merit scholarships (automatic); Matteo Ricci, S.J. Awards; Next Generation Leaders Program (separate application)', merit_note='국제학생도 입학 지원 시 merit 장학금을 자동으로 심사받고, 3월 1일 전에 지원하면 Matteo Ricci, S.J. Award도 자동 심사돼요(금액은 다양해요). 전액 장학금인 Next Generation Leaders Program은 GPA 3.8 이상이면 국제학생도 지원할 수 있는데 1월 10일까지 별도 지원서가 필요해요. 국제학생에게 니드 기반 재정지원은 없어요.', merit_note_en='International applicants are automatically considered for merit scholarships, and those who apply before March 1 are also automatically considered for Matteo Ricci, S.J. Awards (amounts vary). The full-tuition Next Generation Leaders Program is open to international students with a 3.8+ GPA via a separate application due January 10; Creighton does not offer need-based aid to international students.', aid_source_url='https://www.creighton.edu/cost-aid/types-aid/scholarships', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=152;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay','recommendations','volunteer_work','work_experience','demonstrated_interest']::text[], c7_source_url='https://eloncdn.blob.core.windows.net/eu3/sites/1807/2026/04/ElonCDS2025-2026Final.xlsx', demonstrated_interest=true, merit_intl='International Scholar Award; Presidential Scholarship (automatic); Elon Engagement Scholarship; Honors/Fellows/Scholars programs', merit_intl_en='International Scholar Award; Presidential Scholarship (automatic); Elon Engagement Scholarship; Honors/Fellows/Scholars programs', merit_note='국제학생도 여러 성적 장학금을 받을 수 있고, 미국 시민이 아닌 우수 학생에게 주는 International Scholar Award는 연 $5,000–$10,000이에요. Presidential Scholarship(연 $8,000–$12,000)은 입학 원서 심사 때 별도 지원 없이 자동으로 주고, Honors·Fellows 프로그램은 11월 10일까지 따로 지원해야 해요. 성적 장학금 심사를 원하면 SAT/ACT 점수를 내는 것을 선택할 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='International students are eligible for several merit scholarships, including the International Scholar Award ($5,000–$10,000 per year) for non-U.S. citizens with outstanding academic and extracurricular achievement. Presidential Scholarships ($8,000–$12,000 per year) are awarded automatically at admission review, while Honors and Fellows programs require a separate application by November 10. Internationals may submit test scores to be considered for merit scholarships.', aid_source_url='https://www.elon.edu/u/admissions/undergraduate/financial-aid/scholarships/merit-based-scholarships/' where id=153;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.slu.edu/provost/office-of-institutional-research/institutional-data/2122cds.php', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=151, intl_aid_avg=27187, intl_aid_year='2020-21', merit_intl='Vice Presidents'', University, Ignatian and Billiken scholarships (automatic); Presidential Scholarship (separate application)', merit_intl_en='Vice Presidents'', University, Ignatian and Billiken scholarships (automatic); Presidential Scholarship (separate application)', merit_note='국제학생도 입학 원서만으로 SLU의 merit 장학금(Vice Presidents'', University, Ignatian, Billiken 등)을 자동으로 심사받아요. 장학금 페이지에는 학기당 최대 $15,500~$19,500로 적혀 있고, GPA 2.0 이상·풀타임 등록 시 최대 10학기 갱신돼요. Presidential Scholarship과 Martin Luther King Jr. Scholarship은 따로 신청해야 해요.', merit_note_en='International applicants are automatically considered for SLU''s merit scholarships (Vice Presidents'', University, Ignatian, Billiken) with their admission application. The scholarship page lists awards of up to $15,500-$19,500 per semester, renewable for up to 10 semesters with full-time enrollment and a 2.0 GPA. The Presidential and Martin Luther King Jr. scholarships require separate applications.', aid_source_url='https://www.slu.edu/admission/international/frequently-asked-questions.php' where id=154;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://provost.uiowa.edu/sites/provost.uiowa.edu/files/2026-04/CDS_2526.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=161, intl_aid_avg=23085, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='National Scholars Award (automatic, nonresident first-years)', merit_intl_en='National Scholars Award (automatic, nonresident first-years)', merit_note='Iowa의 국제학생 장학금 안내 주소는 비거주자(nonresident) 신입생 장학금 페이지로 연결되며, National Scholars Award는 연 $2,000–$15,000을 최대 4년간 주는 장학금이에요. 2월 1일까지 지원서를 완료하면 별도 신청 없이 GPA·시험 점수 등을 바탕으로 자동 심사돼요. 공식 페이지에 국제학생 need-based 지원 안내는 없어요.', merit_note_en='Iowa''s international scholarship link leads to its first-year nonresident scholarship page; the National Scholars Award is $2,000–$15,000 per year for up to four years. Students who complete the application by February 1 are considered automatically based on GPA and test scores, with no separate application. The official page does not mention need-based aid for international students.', aid_source_url='https://admissions.uiowa.edu/cost-aid/first-year-non-resident-scholarships' where id=155;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.sandiego.edu/facts/documents/cds/cds_2025-26.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=63, intl_aid_avg=19191, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Merit scholarships (automatic consideration at admission)', merit_intl_en='Merit scholarships (automatic consideration at admission)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생도 입학처를 통해 merit scholarship을 받을 수 있고, 따로 신청하지 않아도 지원서로 자동 심사돼요. 금액은 공개되어 있지 않고 학생마다 다르며, 기준 GPA를 유지하면 매년 갱신돼요. 국제학생에게 need-based 재정지원은 제공하지 않아요.', merit_note_en='International first-year applicants are eligible for merit scholarships through the Office of Undergraduate Admission, considered automatically with the application. Amounts vary (not published) and are renewable with the required minimum GPA. USD does not offer need-based financial aid to international students.', aid_source_url='https://www.sandiego.edu/admission-and-aid/undergraduate/apply/international-applicants.php', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=156;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay','recommendations','demonstrated_interest']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.fairfield.edu/_files/documents/pdfs/4447623414_about_offices-and-departments_institutional-research_common-data-sheet-2025-26_09212026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=97, intl_aid_avg=56866, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='University Merit Scholarships (automatic)', merit_intl_en='University Merit Scholarships (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생도 국적과 관계없이 합격하면 별도 지원서 없이 merit scholarship 대상으로 자동 검토돼요. 공식 안내상 금액은 $10,000~$30,000 범위이고 등록금에만 쓸 수 있어요. 국제학생도 CSS Profile을 제출해 need-based 재정지원을 신청할 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='All admitted students regardless of citizenship are automatically considered for merit scholarships with no separate application; awards range from $10,000 to $30,000 and apply to tuition only. International students are encouraged to apply for need-based aid via the CSS Profile.', aid_source_url='https://www.fairfield.edu/admission-and-aid/scholarships-and-grants/merit-scholarships/index.html' where id=157;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay']::text[], c7_source_url='https://academics.lmu.edu/media/lmuacademics/strategicplanningacademiceffectiveness/officeofinstitutionalresearch/documents/CDS%202025-26_20260518.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=367, intl_aid_avg=4013, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='LMU Academic Scholarships for first-year students (automatic)', merit_intl_en='LMU Academic Scholarships for first-year students (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생도 LMU 1학년 학업 장학금(Academic Scholarships) 대상이고, 입학 지원만 하면 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 심사돼요. 장학금은 최대 4년(8학기) 동안 자동 갱신돼요. 공식 CDS 기준으로 국제학생에게는 성적 기반(non-need) 장학금만 있고, 필요 기반(need-based) 장학금은 표시돼 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='International first-year applicants are automatically considered for LMU Academic Scholarships with no separate application, renewable for up to 4 years (8 semesters). Per the CDS, only non-need-based institutional aid is offered to nonresidents; need-based aid is not indicated.', aid_source_url='https://financialaid.lmu.edu/international/' where id=158;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://ira.temple.edu/sites/ira/files/media/document/CDS%202025-26_Temple%20University_0.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=624, intl_aid_avg=17619, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International merit scholarships (automatic); #WhyUS Scholarship (separate application)', merit_intl_en='International merit scholarships (automatic); #WhyUS Scholarship (separate application)', merit_note='국제학생 1학년 지원자는 입학 지원서만으로 merit scholarship을 자동 심사받고, 금액은 연 최대 $20,000(최대 4년)이에요. 별도로 창의 과제를 제출하는 #WhyUS 장학금(연 $2,000~$10,000, 최대 4년)도 있어요. CDS상 국제학생에게는 need-based가 아닌 non-need-based 장학금만 제공돼요.', merit_note_en='International first-year applicants are automatically considered for merit scholarships of up to $20,000 per year for up to four years; no separate application is needed. The separate #WhyUS scholarship ($2,000-$10,000 per year, up to four years) requires a creative-prompt submission. Per the CDS, only non-need-based institutional aid is available to nonresidents.', aid_source_url='https://payingforcollege.temple.edu/what-financial-aid/financial-aid-offer/scholarships/international-student-scholarships' where id=159;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.unh.edu/institutional-research/sites/default/files/media/2026-09/CDS%202025-2026%20UNH%20Published%209.2.26.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=90, intl_aid_avg=39852, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Undergraduate Admission Merit Scholarships (automatic); International Engagement and Service Scholarship (IESS)', merit_intl_en='Undergraduate Admission Merit Scholarships (automatic); International Engagement and Service Scholarship (IESS)', merit_note='국제학생도 UNH의 merit scholarship 대상이며, 합격 시 별도 지원서 없이 자동으로 심사돼요. 이와 별도로 재정 필요가 있는 우수 국제학생을 위한 International Engagement and Service Scholarship(IESS)이 있는데, 등록금 일부를 지원하고 최대 8학기까지 갱신돼요. IESS는 GPA 3.1 이상 학생에게 봄 학기(보통 2월)에 이메일로 신청 안내가 와요.', merit_note_en='International students are eligible for UNH''s merit scholarships, which are awarded automatically upon admission with no separate application. Separately, the International Engagement and Service Scholarship (IESS) supports high-achieving international undergraduates with financial need, covers partial tuition, and is renewable for up to eight semesters; admitted/continuing international students with a 3.1+ GPA are invited by email to apply in the spring (usually February).', aid_source_url='https://www.unh.edu/admissions-aid/international-students' where id=160;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','standardized_tests','essay','state_residency']::text[], c7_source_url='https://irsa.utk.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/07/CDS_2025-26_All__-1.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=86, intl_aid_avg=9570, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='International Volunteer Scholarship (automatic); Global Ambassador Scholarship', merit_intl_en='International Volunteer Scholarship (automatic); Global Ambassador Scholarship', merit_note='미국 고등학교를 졸업하지 않는 국제학생은 5월 1일까지 지원하면 GPA 3.8 이상일 때 International Volunteer Scholarship(연 $3,000–$18,000, GPA와 SAT/ACT 기준) 심사를 자동으로 받아요. GPA 3.0 이상이면 초대받아 별도 신청서를 내는 Global Ambassador Scholarship(연 $10,000–$15,000)도 있어요. 두 장학금은 4년간 유지되지만 다른 교내 장학금과 겹쳐 받을 수 없는 경우가 있어요.', merit_note_en='First-year international students (not graduating from a U.S. high school) with a 3.8+ GPA who apply by May 1 are automatically considered for the International Volunteer Scholarship ($3,000-$18,000/yr, based on GPA plus SAT/ACT). Students with a 3.0+ GPA may be invited to submit a separate application for the Global Ambassador Scholarship ($10,000-$15,000/yr); both are renewable for four years but have stacking limits.', aid_source_url='https://onestop.utk.edu/scholarships-financial-aid/scholarships/international-volunteer-scholarship/' where id=161;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','standardized_tests','essay','recommendations','extracurricular','talent','character','religious_affiliation','volunteer_work','work_experience']::text[], c7_source_url='https://data.byu.edu/0000019d-e4b4-df27-a1df-eef579b00001/cds-2025-2026-pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=728, intl_aid_avg=5543, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='General freshman scholarships (Financial Aid Office)', merit_intl_en='General freshman scholarships (Financial Aid Office)', merit_note='국제학생도 BYU 재정지원처(Financial Aid Office)의 일반 신입생 장학금을 받을 자격이 있어요. 자동 심사가 아니라 별도 장학금 신청서를 내야 하고, 가을 학기 입학 신입생은 1월 2일까지 제출해야 해요.', merit_note_en='International students are eligible for BYU''s general scholarships offered through the Financial Aid Office. Consideration is not automatic: new freshmen starting in spring, summer, or fall must submit the scholarship application by January 2.', aid_source_url='https://enrollment.byu.edu/financial-aid/international-student-scholarships' where id=162;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.ir.iastate.edu/files/documents/cds/CDS-25-26.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=566, intl_aid_avg=13144, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Student Excellence Award (automatic); International Merit Scholarship (OneApp application)', merit_intl_en='International Student Excellence Award (automatic); International Merit Scholarship (OneApp application)', merit_note='합격한 국제 신입생은 고교 GPA(일부는 SAT/ACT 포함)에 따라 International Student Excellence Award를 자동으로 받으며, 연 $6,000~$14,000 수준이에요. 따로 OneApp에서 신청하는 International Merit Scholarship(연 $2,000~$10,000)도 있지만, Excellence Award와 중복 수혜는 안 돼요.', merit_note_en='Admitted international first-years are automatically awarded the International Student Excellence Award ($6,000-$14,000 per year) based on high school GPA and, for some tiers, SAT/ACT scores. A separate, competitive International Merit Scholarship ($2,000-$10,000 per year) requires a OneApp application and cannot be combined with the Excellence Award.', aid_source_url='https://www.iastate.edu/admission-and-aid/admissions/international-admissions/international-student-excellence-award' where id=163;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.ou.edu/content/dam/irr/docs/common-data-sets/norman-campus-only/2025-26-nc/IRR%20CDS-C.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=603, intl_aid_avg=16592, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Freshman International Scholarships (Award of Excellence, Distinguished Scholar, University Scholarship, Academic Achievement Award, Non-Resident Merit Award; automatic)', merit_intl_en='Freshman International Scholarships (Award of Excellence, Distinguished Scholar, University Scholarship, Academic Achievement Award, Non-Resident Merit Award; automatic)', merit_note='미국 밖 고등학교에 다니는 국제학생은 입학 지원서와 SAT/ACT 점수로 자동 심사되는 국제학생 장학금을 받을 수 있어요. SAT 1160 이상이면 연 $10,000, 1390 이상이면 연 $17,000(4년)이고, 시험 미제출자도 종합 심사로 장학금이 나올 수 있어요. 12월 15일까지 입학 지원해야 심사 대상이고, 점수는 4월 30일까지 갱신할 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='Admissible non-U.S. citizens attending high school outside the U.S. are automatically considered for Freshman International Scholarships based on their application and SAT/ACT scores, from $10,000/year (1160-1220 SAT) up to $17,000/year (1390+ SAT) for 4 years; test-optional applicants can also receive awards through holistic review. You must apply for admission by December 15, and updated scores are accepted through April 30.', aid_source_url='https://www.ou.edu/admissions/affordability/scholarships' where id=164;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://uoregon.sharepoint.com/:b:/s/UOInstitutionalResearchPublicMaterials/IQCLb9PtNAxlQJCsPE6Rb8vcAVNYDIH7gnTYVb6ekL74NGU?e=QOIWky', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=44, intl_aid_avg=15363, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='General University Scholarship Program (automatic); International Cultural Service Program (ICSP) Tuition Scholarship', merit_intl_en='General University Scholarship Program (automatic); International Cultural Service Program (ICSP) Tuition Scholarship', merit_note='국제학생도 1월 15일까지 지원하면 General University Scholarship Program 장학금에 자동으로 검토돼요. 별도 지원이 필요한 ICSP 장학금은 재정 필요·학업 성적·문화 발표 능력을 보고 주는 부분 등록금 장학금으로, 자기 나라를 소개하는 봉사 활동이 조건이에요. 재정 필요가 있는 국제학생에게는 연 $1,000–$4,500 근로장학(work-study)과 $1,000–$12,000 범위의 추가 장학금도 있어요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen who apply by January 15 are automatically considered for the General University Scholarship Program. The application-based ICSP partial-tuition scholarship considers financial need, merit, and ability to give cultural presentations. Internationals with financial need can also get work-study awards of $1,000–$4,500 per year and Global Engagement endowed scholarships of $1,000–$12,000.', aid_source_url='https://www.uoregon.edu/admissions/undergraduate/find-your-path/international/documents-and-scholarships/international-scholarships/' where id=165;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://myusf.usfca.edu/sites/default/files/users/ncain/CDS%202024-2025.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=371, intl_aid_avg=26650, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='University, Presidential, Provost, Hilltop, Ignatius, Dons and St. Francis scholarships (automatic)', merit_intl_en='University, Presidential, Provost, Hilltop, Ignatius, Dons and St. Francis scholarships (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생도 신입생 merit 장학금(University Scholarship 등)을 자동으로 심사받아요. 2026년 가을 입학 기준 연 $17,000~$37,000이고, USF가 계산한 핵심 과목 GPA로 정해지며 별도 신청은 필요 없어요. 국제학생은 need-based 재정지원 대상이 아니에요.', merit_note_en='International first-year students are automatically considered for merit scholarships (University Scholarship and others) with no separate application. For Fall 2026 awards range from $17,000 to $37,000 per year based on USF-calculated core GPA. International students are not eligible for need-based financial aid.', aid_source_url='https://www.usfca.edu/admission/undergraduate/international-cost-scholarship', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=166;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://uoia.asu.edu/sites/g/files/litvpz1436/files/2026-06/CDS%202025-26%20-%20ASU%20Campus%20Immersion.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=3344, intl_aid_avg=12660, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='New American University (NAMU) Scholarship', merit_intl_en='New American University (NAMU) Scholarship', merit_note='국제학생 신입생(F-1)도 성적이 우수하면 New American University Scholarship 심사 대상이 돼요. ASU는 합격 후 merit 장학금을 심사하며, 공식 페이지에 국제학생 금액은 따로 나와 있지 않아요. 국제학생은 연방·주 정부 재정 지원 대상이 아니에요.', merit_note_en='International first-year (F-1) students with high academic achievement may be considered for the New American University Scholarship. ASU considers admitted students for merit scholarships, and the official page does not list an amount for international students. International students do not qualify for federal or state financial aid.', aid_source_url='https://admission.asu.edu/cost-aid/international' where id=167;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://oiep.gmu.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/CDS-PDF-2025-2026_PDF_Template_Final_02_19.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=476, intl_aid_avg=13501, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Merit-based Scholarships for International Students (automatic consideration)', merit_intl_en='Merit-based Scholarships for International Students (automatic consideration)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생에게 소수의 merit-based scholarship을 주고, 별도 신청서 없이 합격 심사 때 자동으로 검토돼요. 금액은 공개되어 있지 않고, 성적을 유지하면 최대 4년까지 갱신돼요. 국제학생은 연방 재정지원 대상이 아니에요.', merit_note_en='Mason offers a limited number of merit-based scholarships to highly qualified international freshmen; all admitted applicants are considered automatically with no separate application. Amounts are not published; awards are renewable for up to four years with good academic standing. International students are not eligible for federal financial aid.', aid_source_url='https://www.gmu.edu/international/financial-aid' where id=168;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.luc.edu/media/lucedu/oie/CDS%202025-26%20-%20Loyola%20University%20Chicago%20-%20Final_af.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=229, intl_aid_avg=26906, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Merit scholarships (automatic) + special scholarships (separate application)', merit_intl_en='Merit scholarships (automatic) + special scholarships (separate application)', merit_note='국제학생도 입학 지원만 하면 merit scholarship 대상으로 자동 검토되고, 결과는 합격 통지서에 함께 나와요. 공식 장학금 안내에 따르면 merit scholarship은 연 $20,000~$34,000이고, 합격 후 포털에 올라오는 special scholarships($2,500~전액 등록금)는 별도 지원이 필요해요.', merit_note_en='International applicants are automatically considered for merit scholarships when they apply, with initial awards shown in the acceptance letter. Loyola''s scholarship page lists merit awards of $20,000–$34,000 per year, plus special scholarships ($2,500 to full tuition) that require separate applications posted on the admitted-student portal in early January.', aid_source_url='https://www.luc.edu/undergrad/international/' where id=169;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','class_rank','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://dox.utdallas.edu/report49426', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=311, intl_aid_avg=9427, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Academic Excellence Scholarship (AES, automatic by Dec 1); Eugene McDermott Scholars Program (separate application)', merit_intl_en='Academic Excellence Scholarship (AES, automatic by Dec 1); Eugene McDermott Scholars Program (separate application)', merit_note='국제학생도 Academic Excellence Scholarship(AES) 심사를 받을 수 있고, 12월 1일까지 지원서를 완성하면 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 검토돼요. AES를 받으면 거주 신분과 관계없이 텍사스 주민 학비(in-state tuition)가 적용돼요. 모든 주·국가 학생을 받는 Eugene McDermott Scholars Program은 따로 지원해야 해요.', merit_note_en='International applicants are considered for the Academic Excellence Scholarship (AES) automatically if their application is complete by December 1, and any level of AES award qualifies the recipient for in-state tuition regardless of residency. The Eugene McDermott Scholars Program, open to students from all states and countries, requires a separate application.', aid_source_url='https://enroll.utdallas.edu/affordability/freshman-scholarships/academic-excellence-scholarship/aes-for-prospective-freshmen/' where id=170;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','character']::text[], c7_source_url='https://livealbany.sharepoint.com/:x:/s/web_institutional-research/IQC8ITsQo289R620xCJvlQfrAU4D_yojgrsM8GhBMqu2kJY', intl_aid_count=297, intl_aid_avg=11234, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='University at Albany Global Excellence Scholarships', merit_intl_en='University at Albany Global Excellence Scholarships', merit_note='국제학생 신입생은 학업 성취 등을 바탕으로 입학 사정위원회가 선정하는 Global Excellence Scholarships를 받을 수 있고, 최대 연 $20,500(4년 최대 $82,000)이에요. GPA 2.5 이상과 풀타임 등록을 유지하면 갱신돼요. CDS상 국제학생에게는 need-based가 아닌 non-need-based 장학금만 제공돼요.', merit_note_en='Incoming international first-year students can receive University at Albany Global Excellence Scholarships, selected by the admissions committee based on academic achievement and other qualifications, up to $20,500 per year ($82,000 over four years). Awards renew with a 2.5+ GPA and continuous full-time enrollment. Per the CDS, only non-need-based institutional aid is available to nonresidents.', aid_source_url='https://www.albany.edu/international-admissions/apply-international-undergraduate-student' where id=171;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://uair.arizona.edu/sites/default/files/2026-06/CDS_PDF_2025-26_v02_RE-PRINT.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=1072, intl_aid_avg=14356, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Global Wildcat Scholarship', merit_intl_en='Global Wildcat Scholarship', merit_note='애리조나대는 국제학생에게 Global Wildcat Scholarship을 주는데, 2024년 가을 신입 국제학생의 82% 이상이 이 장학금을 받았다고 공식 페이지에 나와 있어요. 합격 후에는 Scholarship Universe라는 장학금 매칭 플랫폼을 쓸 수 있어요. 국제학생은 미국 연방 재정지원(Title IV) 대상이 아니에요.', merit_note_en='Arizona awards international students the Global Wildcat Scholarship; its official page says more than 82% of new international undergraduates in fall 2024 received one. Admitted students also get access to Scholarship Universe, a scholarship-matching platform. International students do not qualify for federal Title IV aid.', aid_source_url='https://international-admissions.arizona.edu/cost-scholarships/undergraduate' where id=172;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay']::text[], c7_source_url='https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LcfkO0vQyFI2JUUA9rgVqINRu6XkSagx/edit', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=97, intl_aid_avg=18607, intl_aid_year=null, merit_intl='International merit scholarship (automatic, up to $34,000/yr)', merit_intl_en='International merit scholarship (automatic, up to $34,000/yr)', merit_note='국제학생 대부분이 합격과 함께 international merit scholarship을 받고, 지원서와 필수 서류가 접수되면 자동으로 심사돼요. 금액은 연 최대 $34,000(학비에 적용)이고, 전액 학비 장학금은 없어요.', merit_note_en='Most international undergraduates receive an international merit scholarship on admission; all applicants are automatically considered once the application and required documents are received. Awards are worth up to $34,000 per year toward tuition, and Dayton does not offer full-tuition scholarships.', aid_source_url='https://udayton.edu/tuition-aid/international/undergraduate.php' where id=173;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.du.edu/sites/default/files/2026-05/DU_Common_Data_Set_2025_2026_v2.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=160, intl_aid_avg=51838, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='International merit scholarships (automatic)', merit_intl_en='International merit scholarships (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생은 지원서만 내면 별도 신청 없이 메리트 장학금 심사를 자동으로 받아요. 신입생 기준 연 $15,000~$40,000이고 대부분 갱신되지만, 학비 전액을 덮는 경우는 드물어요. 국제학생에게 니드 기반(need-based) 지원은 없고, 입학 심사는 need-aware예요.', merit_note_en='International first-year applicants are automatically considered for merit scholarships with no separate application; awards are $15,000 to $40,000 per year and most are renewable, though very few cover the full cost. DU offers no need-based aid to international students and is need-aware in admission.', aid_source_url='https://www.du.edu/admission-aid/undergraduate/international-applicants/tuition', need_blind_intl=false where id=174;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='http://oiraa.dw.sc.edu/cds/cds2025/cds_2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=142, intl_aid_avg=32670, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='학교 공식 CDS에 따르면 국제학생(nonresident)에게는 need-based가 아닌 성적 기반 기관 장학금만 제공돼요. 입학처 장학금 페이지는 12월 1일까지 지원한 신입생 전원을 merit 장학금에 자동 심사한다고 안내하지만, 국제학생 적용 여부는 명시하지 않으니 입학처에 확인하세요.', merit_note_en='Per the official CDS, only non-need-based institutional aid is available to international (nonresident) undergraduates. The admissions scholarship pages say all freshmen who apply by December 1 are automatically considered for merit packages, but do not state explicitly whether international students are included, so confirm with admissions.', aid_source_url='http://oiraa.dw.sc.edu/cds/cds2025/cds_2025-2026.pdf' where id=175;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','essay','extracurricular']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.pacific.edu/sites/default/files/users/user777/2025_26_CDS_Full_Form_.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=172, intl_aid_avg=44931, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='International Student Merit Scholarships (automatic); Powell Scholarship (separate application)', merit_intl_en='International Student Merit Scholarships (automatic); Powell Scholarship (separate application)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생도 성적 장학금(International Student Merit Scholarships) 대상이고, 입학 지원서만 내면 자동으로 심사돼요. 신입생 merit 장학금은 연 $10,000~$30,000 범위이고, Powell Scholarship($43,000)은 12월 1일까지 별도 지원서가 필요해요. 전액(full-ride·full-tuition) 장학금은 없어서 나머지 비용은 스스로 준비해야 해요.', merit_note_en='International first-year applicants are automatically considered for International Student Merit Scholarships; first-year merit awards range from $10,000 to $30,000 per year. The Powell Scholarship ($43,000) requires a separate application due Dec 1, and Pacific does not offer full-ride or full-tuition scholarships, so international students are expected to fund the rest themselves.', aid_source_url='https://www.pacific.edu/admission/international-students/international-students-faq' where id=176;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','class_rank','gpa','standardized_tests','essay','recommendations','talent','character']::text[], c7_source_url='https://miamioh.edu/analytics-institutional-research/_documents/cds/cds2024-25.xlsx', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=304, intl_aid_avg=16115, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Merit Scholarship (automatic); Presidential Fellows Program', merit_intl_en='International Merit Scholarship (automatic); Presidential Fellows Program', merit_note='국제학생은 미국식 GPA 2.50 이상이면 별도 신청 없이 International Merit Scholarship에 자동으로 검토되고, GPA에 따라 등록금의 최대 20%–50%를 받을 수 있어요. 12월 1일까지 지원하면 우선 검토되고, 장학금은 보장되지 않아요. Honors College 지원자 중 15명을 뽑는 Presidential Fellows Program은 등록금·기숙사·식비를 모두 지원해요.', merit_note_en='New international first-year students with a U.S.-equivalent GPA of 2.50+ are automatically considered for the International Merit Scholarship, worth up to 20%–50% of tuition depending on GPA; applying by December 1 gives priority and awards are not guaranteed. The highly competitive Presidential Fellows Program (15 Honors College students per year) covers tuition, fees, housing and food.', aid_source_url='https://miamioh.edu/onestop/financial-aid/funding-opportunities/scholarships/international-scholarships.html' where id=177;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.jefferson.edu/content/dam/academic/east-falls/institutional-research-and-planning/tju-common-data-set-2024-2025.xlsx', intl_aid_count=70, intl_aid_avg=20119, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Merit Scholarship (automatic)', merit_intl_en='International Merit Scholarship (automatic)', merit_note='모든 국제학생 지원자는 원서 심사 때 International Merit Scholarship을 자동으로 심사받아요. 금액은 $15,000~$26,000 범위로 안내되고, 조건은 합격 통지서에 함께 적혀 와요. 학교는 국제학생을 위한 재정지원이 제한적이라고 안내해요.', merit_note_en='All international applicants are automatically considered for an International Merit Scholarship when their application is reviewed; awards range from $15,000 to $26,000 and terms are stated in the acceptance letter. Jefferson notes that financial aid for foreign nationals is limited.', aid_source_url='https://www.jefferson.edu/admissions/undergraduate/first-year/international.html' where id=178;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.uvm.edu/d10-files/documents/2026-06/CDS_2025-2026_C.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=119, intl_aid_avg=39655, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Merit Scholarships (automatic, up to $30,000/yr)', merit_intl_en='International Merit Scholarships (automatic, up to $30,000/yr)', merit_note='국제학생도 연 최대 $30,000의 merit 장학금을 받을 수 있어요. 별도 신청 없이 입학 심사 때 자동으로 검토되며, 성적·SAT/ACT(제출 시)·활동·에세이·추천서를 종합적으로 봐요. 장학금 여부는 합격 통보 때 함께 알려줘요.', merit_note_en='International students are eligible for merit scholarships of up to $30,000 per year. They are considered automatically during admission review with no separate application, based on grades, SAT/ACT (if submitted), activities, essays, and recommendations. Awards are announced with the admission decision.', aid_source_url='https://www.uvm.edu/admissions/undergraduate/how-apply-international-students' where id=179;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['class_rank','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.csulb.edu/sites/default/files/2026/documents/CDS%202025%20-%202026%20%28PDF%29_0.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=0, intl_aid_avg=null, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='CSULB는 국제학생 전용 merit scholarship을 따로 안내하지 않고, Common Data Set에서도 국제학생에게 학교 자체 장학금·그랜트를 주지 않는다고 밝혀요. 국제학생 페이지는 일반 CSULB 장학금 사이트와 외부 Study California Scholarship, 교내 근로, 분할 납부를 안내해요.', merit_note_en='CSULB does not list a dedicated merit scholarship for international first-year students, and its Common Data Set states institutional scholarship/grant aid is not available to nonresidents. The international page points to the general CSULB scholarship site, the external Study California Scholarship, on-campus jobs and payment plans.', aid_source_url='https://www.csulb.edu/international/future-students/scholarships' where id=180;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.jmu.edu/pair/ir/common-data-set/cds-2025.docx', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=36, intl_aid_avg=5523, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='국제학생 입학 페이지가 일반 신입생 장학금 페이지(Madison Scholarships Hub 등)로 안내하지만, 국제학생이 어떤 merit scholarship을 받을 수 있는지는 공식적으로 명시돼 있지 않아요. 대부분의 JMU 장학금은 합격 후 Madison Scholarships Hub에서 General Application을 따로 작성해야 검토돼요.', merit_note_en='JMU''s international admissions page links to the general first-year scholarships page (Madison Scholarships Hub), but it does not explicitly state which merit scholarships international students are eligible for. Most JMU scholarships require completing the General Application in the Madison Scholarships Hub.', aid_source_url='https://www.jmu.edu/admissions/apply/scholarships/index.shtml' where id=181;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','class_rank','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zzaglVa3DeFriuYB0Aq-xlD8pyRM7XUc/view', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=87, intl_aid_avg=40470, intl_aid_year='2023-24', merit_intl='Merit-Based Academic Scholarships (automatic); John P. McNulty Scholarship (women in STEM, separate application)', merit_intl_en='Merit-Based Academic Scholarships (automatic); John P. McNulty Scholarship (women in STEM, separate application)', merit_note='국제학생(Hawk Hill 캠퍼스)도 Merit-Based Academic Scholarships 대상이고, 입학 지원서를 완성하면 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 심사돼요. 과학·수학 전공 여학생을 위한 John P. McNulty Scholarship(전액 또는 일부 학비)은 별도 지원과 인터뷰가 필요해요. 공식 CDS 기준 국제학생에게는 성적 기반(non-need) 장학금만 표시돼 있어요.', merit_note_en='International students at the Hawk Hill campus are automatically reviewed for Merit-Based Academic Scholarships when they submit a complete admission application. The John P. McNulty Scholarship (full or partial tuition for women in science and math majors) requires a separate application and interview. The CDS lists only non-need-based institutional aid for nonresidents.', aid_source_url='https://www.sju.edu/scholarships' where id=182;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://asir.sdsu.edu/Documents/CommonDataSets/CDS_2025-2026_updated%207-28.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=73, intl_aid_avg=29537, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Aztec Scholarships (separate application)', merit_intl_en='Aztec Scholarships (separate application)', merit_note='국제학생 전용 자동 merit 장학금은 공식 페이지에 없고, F-1 비자 국제학생도 약 800개 교내 장학금을 한 번에 신청하는 Aztec Scholarships 포털로 지원할 수 있어요. 입학 후 별도 신청이 필요하고, 신입생은 7월 말 Early Action 마감 전에 내는 게 좋아요. 금액은 장학금마다 달라요.', merit_note_en='SDSU''s official pages list no automatic merit award specifically for internationals, but F-1 international students may apply through the Aztec Scholarships portal, one application covering close to 800 university scholarships. It requires a separate application after admission, with an incoming-student early action deadline at the end of July; amounts vary by scholarship.', aid_source_url='https://sacd.sdsu.edu/financial-aid/scholarships' where id=183;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.sjsu.edu/irsa/docs/cds/20260113_CDS%202025%20FINAL.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=103, intl_aid_avg=9127, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='SJSU merit-based scholarships (Spartan Scholarships portal)', merit_intl_en='SJSU merit-based scholarships (Spartan Scholarships portal)', merit_note='국제학생은 SJSU 장학금 중 merit 기반 장학금만 받을 수 있어요. need-based 장학금은 재정지원(financial aid)에 속해서 국제학생은 받을 수 없어요. 공식 페이지에 금액이나 자동 심사 여부는 나와 있지 않고, 학과 장학금이나 외부 장학금도 찾아보라고 안내해요.', merit_note_en='International students are eligible only for SJSU''s merit-based scholarships; need-based scholarships are part of financial aid, which is unavailable to international students. The official page gives no amounts or automatic-award details and points students to departmental and outside scholarships.', aid_source_url='https://www.sjsu.edu/faso/types-of-aid/scholarships/international-students.php', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=184;
update public.schools set merit_intl='St. John''s University Academic Scholarships (automatic); application scholarships (e.g., Ozanam Scholars, Catholic Scholars)', merit_intl_en='St. John''s University Academic Scholarships (automatic); application scholarships (e.g., Ozanam Scholars, Catholic Scholars)', merit_note='국제 신입생도 merit scholarship 대상이고, 입학 지원서로 자동 심사되며 대부분 별도 신청이 필요 없어요. 학교는 2025년 가을 입학생에게 merit scholarship을 연 최대 $35,000까지 줬다고 안내해요. Ozanam Scholars 같은 별도 신청 장학금도 국제학생이 지원할 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='International first-time freshmen are eligible for merit scholarships, which are determined automatically from the admission application with no extra form for most awards; the Fall 2025 entering class received merit awards of up to $35,000 per year. Separate-application scholarships such as Ozanam Scholars are also open to international students.', aid_source_url='https://www.stjohns.edu/admission/scholarships' where id=185;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.uab.edu/institutionaleffectiveness/images/documents/cds/CDS-2025-26.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=189, intl_aid_avg=18850, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='UAB International Scholarship (automatic); Cambridge AICE/IB Scholarship', merit_intl_en='UAB International Scholarship (automatic); Cambridge AICE/IB Scholarship', merit_note='미국 밖 고등학교를 졸업하고 GPA 3.0/4.0 이상이면 합격 시 UAB International Scholarship(연 $7,500, 4년 갱신)을 자동으로 심사받아요. 기금 소진 전 선착순이고 8월 입학은 5월 1일까지 합격해야 대상이 되며, 정부 장학금 등 외부 지원을 받으면 받을 수 없어요. IB·AICE 디플로마 후보자 장학금 등 추가 장학금은 BSMART 신청서를 4월 1일까지 따로 내야 해요.', merit_note_en='Students graduating from a high school outside the U.S. with at least a 3.0/4.0 GPA are automatically considered upon admission for the UAB International Scholarship ($7,500 per year, renewable for four years), awarded first-come, first-served while funds last, and students must be admitted by May 1 for the August intake; students with government or other external support are ineligible. Additional scholarships (e.g., Cambridge AICE/IB, departmental) require the BSMART General Scholarship Application by April 1.', aid_source_url='https://www.uab.edu/admissions/cost/scholarships/international-students' where id=186;
update public.schools set c7_very_important='{}'::text[], c7_source_url='https://uh.edu/ir/reports/common-data-sets/cds-data/common_data_set_2025-2026_final.xlsx', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=684, intl_aid_avg=4355, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='University merit scholarships (e.g., Academic Excellence Scholarship) with scholarship priority deadline', merit_intl_en='University merit scholarships (e.g., Academic Excellence Scholarship) with scholarship priority deadline', merit_note='국제 신입생 지원 페이지에 장학금 우선 마감일(Fall 2027 기준 지원서 2026년 11월 2일, 추가 서류 11월 9일)이 따로 안내돼 있어요. 신입생 merit 장학금인 Academic Excellence Scholarship은 금액이 공개되지 않은 경쟁 장학금이고, 국제학생 전용 장학금은 대부분 입학 후 재학생용이에요.', merit_note_en='The international freshman admissions page lists a scholarship priority deadline (for Fall 2027: application by Nov. 2, 2026, supporting information by Nov. 9, 2026). The freshman merit award, the Academic Excellence Scholarship, is competitive with unpublished amounts, and most international-specific scholarships are for students already enrolled at UH.', aid_source_url='https://www.uh.edu/undergraduate-admissions/apply/international/international-freshman/' where id=187;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay']::text[], c7_source_url='https://umbc.box.com/s/zh0iavb1yvvxd9na0oh8ly2u1ygljgrk', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=318, intl_aid_avg=12292, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='UMBC general merit scholarships (automatic); Scholars Programs (separate application)', merit_intl_en='UMBC general merit scholarships (automatic); Scholars Programs (separate application)', merit_note='UMBC는 국제학생 신입생에게도 경쟁형 성적 장학금을 줘요. 일반 merit 장학금은 별도 신청 없이 입학 지원서로 자동 심사되고(11월 1일 Early Action 지원 권장), 공식 안내상 장학금 범위는 $1K~22K예요. 전공 관심 기반 Scholars Programs는 따로 지원서를 내야 해요.', merit_note_en='UMBC offers competitive merit scholarships to incoming international first-year students; general merit awards need no separate application and are reviewed automatically with a timely admission application (applying by the Nov 1 Early Action deadline is strongly encouraged). The official site lists a $1K-22K range for merit scholarships, and the Scholars Programs require a separate application.', aid_source_url='https://scholarships.umbc.edu/scholarship-faq/' where id=188;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','class_rank','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.scranton.edu/pir/institutional-research/institutional-research-reports/2025-2026-cds.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=14, intl_aid_avg=41135, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Merit scholarships (Presidential, Dean''s, Loyola, Faber) — automatic with admission application', merit_intl_en='Merit scholarships (Presidential, Dean''s, Loyola, Faber) — automatic with admission application', merit_note='학위 과정 국제학생도 성적 장학금 대상이고, 미국 학생과 같은 방식으로 심사받아요. 합격자는 별도 신청 없이 입학 원서로 성적 장학금(Presidential, Dean''s, Loyola, Faber)을 자동으로 검토받아요. 국제학생은 need-based 장학금은 받을 수 없어요.', merit_note_en='Degree-seeking international students are eligible for merit-based scholarships and are evaluated the same way as domestic students; all admitted applicants are automatically considered (Presidential, Dean''s, Loyola, Faber) with no separate application. International students are not eligible for need-based scholarships.', aid_source_url='https://www.scranton.edu/academics/IPS/international-students/Frequently%20Asked%20Questions.shtml' where id=189;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.calstatela.edu/sites/default/files/CDS2526_CalStateLA.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=8, intl_aid_avg=9042, intl_aid_year=null, merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='Cal State LA는 국제학생을 위한 입학 장학금(merit) 전용 기금이 없다고 안내해요. 입학 후 학업 성적이 좋으면 다른 재학생과 함께 교내 일반 장학금(General Scholarship Application)에 지원할 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='Cal State LA states it has no special funds to recruit international students, so there is no entering merit scholarship for them. Once enrolled and performing well academically, international students may compete for campus scholarships along with other students.', aid_source_url='https://www.calstatela.edu/financialaid/scholarship-faq' where id=190;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','demonstrated_interest']::text[], c7_source_url='https://oie.mercer.edu/www/mu-oie/research/upload/CDS-2024-2025_complete-2.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=60, intl_aid_avg=34375, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='University Merit Scholarships (automatic upon admission)', merit_intl_en='University Merit Scholarships (automatic upon admission)', merit_note='국제학생도 merit 장학금을 받을 수 있지만, 연방·주 정부 지원은 받을 수 없어요. 합격하면 모든 학생이 별도 신청 없이 merit 장학금 심사를 받고, 신입생 초기 장학금은 보통 연 $18,000–$27,000이며 4년간 갱신돼요(GPA 2.0 유지).', merit_note_en='International students are eligible for merit-based scholarships but not for state or federal aid. All admitted students are automatically evaluated for merit scholarships, which typically range from $18,000 to $27,000 per year for first-year students and are renewable for four years with a 2.0 GPA.', aid_source_url='https://undergrad.mercer.edu/international-admissions/' where id=191;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://aire.ku.edu/sites/aire/files/files/CDS/2025-2026/C.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=330, intl_aid_avg=12572, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='KU Excellence / Distinction / Achievement / Performance / Access scholarships (automatic, GPA-based)', merit_intl_en='KU Excellence / Distinction / Achievement / Performance / Access scholarships (automatic, GPA-based)', merit_note='국제학생도 고등학교 GPA만으로 자동 선발되는 4년 갱신형 장학금을 받을 수 있어요(GPA 3.25 이상, 연 $8,000~$16,000, 4년 최대 $64,000). 별도 장학금 지원서는 없지만 가을 학기 장학금을 받으려면 5월 1일까지 입학 지원을 마쳐야 해요. 공식 CDS상 국제학생 대상 need-based 교내 장학금은 없어요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen are automatically considered for renewable GPA-based scholarships (KU Excellence through KU Access, 3.25+ GPA) worth $8,000–$16,000 per year, up to $64,000 over four years; applying for admission by May 1 is required for fall scholarship consideration. KU''s CDS states institutional need-based aid is not available to international undergraduates.', aid_source_url='https://world.ku.edu/scholarships' where id=193;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay']::text[], c7_source_url='https://irads.uky.edu/sites/default/files/2026-07/university-of-kentucky-cds-2025-2026-flat.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=252, intl_aid_avg=25415, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Bluegrass Scholarship; William C. Parker Scholarship; International Ambassador Scholarship', merit_intl_en='Bluegrass Scholarship; William C. Parker Scholarship; International Ambassador Scholarship', merit_note='국제 신입생 전용 Bluegrass Scholarship은 GPA(또는 GPA+SAT) 기준으로 $6,500~$16,000이고, 12월 1일까지 지원을 마쳐야 해요. William C. Parker Scholarship은 GPA 3.0 이상 지원자를 종합 심사하며 별도 신청이 필요 없어요(우선 마감 12월 1일). International Ambassador Scholarship은 추가 자료를 내야 하고 우선 마감은 2월 15일이에요.', merit_note_en='The Bluegrass Scholarship for international freshmen ranges from $6,500 to $16,000 based on GPA (or GPA plus SAT), with a December 1 deadline. The William C. Parker Scholarship holistically reviews applicants with at least a 3.0 GPA with no additional application (priority deadline December 1), and the International Ambassador Scholarship requires supplementary materials (priority deadline February 15).', aid_source_url='https://international.uky.edu/apply/scholarships' where id=194;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.uml.edu/docs/CDS_2024-2025%20Final_tcm18-403507.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=120, intl_aid_avg=12606, intl_aid_year='2023-24', merit_intl='New-student merit-based scholarships (automatic with admission)', merit_intl_en='New-student merit-based scholarships (automatic with admission)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생도 일부 merit 장학금 대상이 될 수 있고, 합격 시점에 자격이 자동으로 결정돼 합격 통지와 함께 안내돼요. 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않아요. 입학 후에는 River Hawk Scholarship Portal로 교내 장학금에 별도 신청할 수 있어요(매년 2월 1일 마감).', merit_note_en='First-time, first-year international applicants may be considered for select new-student merit scholarships; eligibility is determined at admission and communicated with the acceptance letter, and no amounts are published. Current students can separately apply for endowed scholarships via the River Hawk Scholarship Portal (February 1 deadline). Per the CDS, only non-need-based institutional aid is available to nonresidents.', aid_source_url='https://www.uml.edu/isso/new-international-students/scholarship-opportunities.aspx' where id=195;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay','recommendations']::text[], c7_source_url='https://web.uri.edu/ir/wp-content/uploads/sites/276/CDS-PDF-2025-2026_fillablePDF.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=126, intl_aid_avg=26565, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='University and Presidential Merit Scholarships (automatic)', merit_intl_en='University and Presidential Merit Scholarships (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생도 모든 merit scholarship 심사 대상이고, 별도 신청서 없이 자동으로 심사돼요. University·Presidential Merit Scholarship은 4년 갱신형으로 연 $2,000부터 전액 등록금까지이며, 12월 1일까지 지원서를 완료하면 우선 심사를 받아요. 국제학생에게는 need-based 재정지원이 없어요.', merit_note_en='All applicants, including international students, are considered for URI merit scholarships with no separate application. University and Presidential Merit Scholarships are four-year renewable awards ranging from $2,000 to full tuition per year, with priority consideration for applications complete by December 1. No need-based financial aid is available to international students.', aid_source_url='https://web.uri.edu/admission/international/', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=196;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.ccny.cuny.edu/sites/default/files/2026-07/20260716_CDS_2025-2026_UPDATED.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, aid_source_url='https://www.ccny.cuny.edu/sites/default/files/2026-07/20260716_CDS_2025-2026_UPDATED.pdf' where id=197;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','geographical_residence','state_residency']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.fullerton.edu/data/_resources/pdfs/institutional-research/cds/CDS-2025-2026.xlsx', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=726, intl_aid_avg=4761, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='CSUF 공식 페이지에는 국제학생 신입생을 위한 입학 메리트 장학금이 따로 안내되어 있지 않아요. 입학 후 F-1 학부생(GPA 3.0 이상)이 신청할 수 있는 Minh Tâm Nguyen Scholarship, 재정 필요가 큰 학생을 위한 Abroova & Prabakar Scholarship 같은 재학생 장학금이 있고, 별도 신청이 필요해요.', merit_note_en='CSUF''s official pages do not list an entrance merit scholarship for international first-year students. Once enrolled, F-1 undergraduates can apply separately for scholarships such as the Minh Tâm Nguyen Scholarship (GPA 3.0+) and the need-focused Abroova & Prabakar Scholarship.', aid_source_url='https://international.fullerton.edu/international-students-and-scholars/scholarships/index.html' where id=198;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.duq.edu/documents/institutionalresearch/cds-2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=137, intl_aid_avg=17845, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Libermann Scholarship (automatic, merit-based)', merit_intl_en='Libermann Scholarship (automatic, merit-based)', merit_note='합격한 국제학생은 별도 신청 없이 merit 기반 Libermann Scholarship에 자동으로 심사돼요. 보통 연 $10,000~$30,000을 받고 4년간 갱신돼요. 전액 장학금과 (need-based) 재정 지원은 국제학생에게 제공되지 않아요.', merit_note_en='Admitted international students are automatically considered for the merit-based Libermann Scholarship with no separate application; awards are usually $10,000-$30,000 per year and renewable for four years. Full scholarships and financial aid are not available to international students.', aid_source_url='https://www.duq.edu/admission-and-aid/how-to-apply/international/costs-and-scholarships.php', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=199;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.k-state.edu/data/institutional-research/resources/common-data-set/CDS_2025_2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, merit_intl='Wildcat Nonresident Award', merit_intl_en='Wildcat Nonresident Award', merit_note='국제학생도 Wildcat Nonresident Award 대상이에요. 고등학교 GPA(가중·비가중 중 높은 쪽)로 비거주자 학비 일부를 깎아 주는데, 3.25 이상이면 받을 수 있고 3.90 이상이면 연 $19,101(주민 학비 수준까지 할인)이에요. SAT/ACT는 보지 않고, 매년 GPA 3.0 이상 등을 유지하면 4년까지 갱신돼요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen are eligible for the Wildcat Nonresident Award, a GPA-based discount on the nonresident portion of tuition (no SAT/ACT needed). It starts at a 3.25 GPA and reaches about $19,101/year (equal to in-state tuition) at 3.90+, renewable up to four years with a 3.0 K-State GPA.', aid_source_url='https://www.k-state.edu/sfa/scholarships-aid/scholarships/future-students/wildcat-nonresident/' where id=200;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://irdata.montclair.edu/institutionalresearch/CDS/CDS%202025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=168, intl_aid_avg=5077, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Presidential Scholarship (automatic); talent-based performing arts awards', merit_intl_en='Presidential Scholarship (automatic); talent-based performing arts awards', merit_note='국제 신입생도 성적 기준을 충족하면 별도 신청 없이 Presidential Scholarship을 자동으로 받을 수 있고, 최대 4년까지 갱신돼요. 일부 공연예술 전공은 오디션 결과에 따라 재능 장학금도 받을 수 있어요. 학생 비자로 공부하는 국제학생에게는 재정 필요 기반 장학금(need-based aid)을 주지 않아요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen who meet GPA criteria are automatically awarded the Presidential Scholarship, renewable for up to four years. Students admitted to select performing arts programs may receive talent-based awards based on audition. Need-based financial aid is not offered to students studying on an international visa.', aid_source_url='https://www.montclair.edu/admissions-aid/financial-aid/international-scholarships-and-aid' where id=201;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://institutionalresearch.oregonstate.edu/sites/institutionalresearch.oregonstate.edu/files/2026-06/CDS-2025-26_1.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=361, intl_aid_avg=8996, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Provost''s Scholarship for Excellence (automatic); regional awards; Honorary Scholarship for Leadership', merit_intl_en='Provost''s Scholarship for Excellence (automatic); regional awards; Honorary Scholarship for Leadership', merit_note='국제학생 신입생은 Provost''s Scholarship for Excellence(연 $6,000, 4년 총 $24,000, GPA 3.5 이상)를 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 심사받아요. 지역별 자동 장학금(연 $2,000~$16,000)은 공식 목록에 한국이 포함되어 있지 않아요. 리더십 장학금(Honorary Scholarship for Leadership, 1학년 1회 $2,000)은 따로 신청해야 해요.', merit_note_en='International first-year students with a 3.5+ GPA are automatically considered for the Provost''s Scholarship for Excellence ($6,000 per year, $24,000 total). Automatic regional awards ($2,000-$16,000 per year) are listed for specific regions that do not include South Korea. The Honorary Scholarship for Leadership ($2,000, first year only) requires a separate application.', aid_source_url='https://admissions.oregonstate.edu/international/prices-scholarships/scholarships-international-students/undergraduate-scholarships' where id=202;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','character']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.qu.edu/499cca/globalassets/global/media/qu/documents/about/institutional-research/cds_2023-2024_quinnipiac.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=115, intl_aid_avg=49862, intl_aid_year='2023-24', merit_intl='International Student Scholarship', merit_intl_en='International Student Scholarship', merit_note='Quinnipiac은 학업 성적이 우수한 국제학생에게 소규모 장학금(International Student Scholarship)을 줘요. 3월 1일까지 입학 지원서를 완료해야 하고, 나머지 비용에 대한 재정 보증서를 내야 해요. 공식 페이지에 금액은 ''다양함''으로만 나와 있어요.', merit_note_en='Quinnipiac offers a small pool of International Student Scholarship funds for international students with strong academic achievement. A complete admission application must be on file by March 1, and students must provide a statement of financial support for remaining costs. The official page lists the amount only as ''various amounts''.', aid_source_url='https://www.qu.edu/paying-for-college/browse-financial-aid/scholarships-grants/international-student-scholarship/' where id=203;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Merit-based scholarships (same as U.S. students; mostly automatic at admission)', merit_intl_en='Merit-based scholarships (same as U.S. students; mostly automatic at admission)', merit_note='국제학생도 미국 학생과 같은 merit-based scholarship을 받을 수 있고, 대부분 합격할 때 학업 성적을 보고 자동으로 줘요. 국제학생 안내 페이지에는 장학금 심사를 받으려면 SAT/ACT 점수를 내라고 적혀 있어요. 국제학생에게 need-based 재정지원은 없어요.', merit_note_en='International students can qualify for the same merit-based scholarships as U.S. students, and most are awarded automatically at admission based on the academic profile. The international applicant page says SAT or ACT scores must be submitted to be considered. No need-based financial aid is available to international students.', aid_source_url='https://www.shu.edu/undergraduate-admissions/international-and-esl-applicants.html', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=204;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://oira.ua.edu/d/sites/all/files/reports26/CDS%202025-26%20FINAL%209Dec2025.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=213, intl_aid_avg=33933, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Automatic merit scholarships (Crimson Legends to Presidential Elite) + competitive scholarships', merit_intl_en='Automatic merit scholarships (Crimson Legends to Presidential Elite) + competitive scholarships', merit_note='국제학생도 주 외 학생과 똑같은 자동 merit scholarship을 받을 수 있어요. GPA 3.50 이상과 SAT/ACT 점수에 따라 연 $6,000~$28,000(최상위 Presidential Elite는 등록금 전액 등)이고, 입학 지원서로 자동 검토되지만 공식 시험 점수를 꼭 제출해야 해요. 점수를 내지 않아도 경쟁형 장학금(UA Competitive Admissions Scholarship 등)은 검토 대상이에요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen receive the same automatic merit scholarships as out-of-state students: $6,000–$28,000 per year (Presidential Elite covers tuition and more) based on a 3.50+ GPA and SAT/ACT score, with no separate application, but official test scores are required. Students without test scores remain eligible for competitive scholarships.', aid_source_url='https://afford.ua.edu/scholarships/oos-international-freshman/' where id=205;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Merit-based scholarships for international students (10-70% off tuition, automatic); GHR Fellows Program (full tuition, business)', merit_intl_en='Merit-based scholarships for international students (10-70% off tuition, automatic); GHR Fellows Program (full tuition, business)', merit_note='비자로 공부하는 국제학생은 지원서를 완성하면 학비의 10~70%에 해당하는 성적 장학금을 받을 수 있고, 평균은 50~60%이며 합격 통지서에 함께 안내돼요. 장학금은 학비에만 적용되고 GPA 2.0 이상이면 최대 4년 갱신돼요. 전액 장학금(full-ride)은 없지만, 경영 전공 지원자 대상의 GHR Fellows Program(학비 전액)처럼 별도 경쟁 장학금도 국제학생에게 열려 있어요.', merit_note_en='International students on study visas are eligible for merit scholarships of 10-70% off tuition (average 50-60%) once they complete their application, announced in the admission letter and renewable for up to four years with a 2.0 GPA. There are no full-ride scholarships, but competitive programs such as the GHR Fellows Program (full tuition, business majors) are also open to internationals.', aid_source_url='https://www.stthomas.edu/admissions/international/undergraduate/merit-based-scholarships/' where id=206;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://irds.vcu.edu/media/decision-support/pdf/commondatasets/CommonDataSet2024-25.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=148, intl_aid_avg=11243, intl_aid_year=null, merit_intl='Out-of-state academic scholarships (automatic); university-level first-year scholarships (apply by Nov. 1)', merit_intl_en='Out-of-state academic scholarships (automatic); university-level first-year scholarships (apply by Nov. 1)', merit_note='국제학생도 out-of-state 학생으로 분류돼 GPA 3.0 이상이면 첫해 $10,000~$15,000의 4년 갱신형 학업 장학금을 받을 수 있고, 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 심사돼요. 11월 1일까지 지원을 마치면 대학 차원의 first-year scholarships도 추가로 심사받아요.', merit_note_en='International students count as out-of-state for VCU''s four-year academic scholarships: with a 3.0+ high school GPA they may receive $10,000-$15,000 in the first year, renewable for three more years, with automatic consideration and no separate application. Applying by Nov. 1 also brings consideration for university-level first-year scholarships.', aid_source_url='https://admissions.vcu.edu/cost-aid/scholarships-funding/out-of-state-scholarships/' where id=207;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.bradley.edu/wp-content/uploads/CDS_2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=83, intl_aid_avg=42201, intl_aid_year='2024-25', aid_source_url='https://www.bradley.edu/wp-content/uploads/CDS_2025-2026.pdf' where id=208;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://cdn.butler.edu/www/sites/3/2026/03/26111834/CDS_2025-2025_C.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, merit_intl='Academic Scholarship (automatic); Morton-Finney Scholars Award; Compass Center Scholarship', merit_intl_en='Academic Scholarship (automatic); Morton-Finney Scholars Award; Compass Center Scholarship', merit_note='국제학생도 Butler 장학금(학비용) 대상이고, Common App만 내면 Academic Scholarship(연 $20,000–$34,000) 심사를 자동으로 받아요. 11월 1일까지 지원해 Early Action이나 Early Decision으로 합격해야 최대 금액을 고려받을 수 있어요. Morton-Finney Scholars Award 같은 장학금은 11월 15일까지 별도 신청서를 내야 해요.', merit_note_en='International students can receive Butler gift aid (tuition only); the Academic Scholarship ($20,000-$34,000 for 2026-27) is automatic with the Common App, with maximum consideration for students who apply by November 1 and are admitted EA/ED. Other awards such as the Morton-Finney Scholars Award need a separate application by November 15.', aid_source_url='https://www.butler.edu/admission-aid/financial-aid-scholarships/international/' where id=209;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.ir.colostate.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/21/2026/03/CSU_CDS_FY2026_Access.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=295, intl_aid_avg=15607, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International undergraduate scholarships (automatic)', merit_intl_en='International undergraduate scholarships (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생은 합격하면 별도 신청 없이 장학금 심사를 자동으로 받고, 금액은 연 $2,000~$12,000이며 성적을 유지하면 최대 4년 갱신돼요. 12월 15일까지 지원하면 가장 높은 장학금 심사, 3월 15일까지는 일반 심사를 받아요. 지원 후 2~4주 안에 합격 여부와 장학금 액수를 함께 알려줘요.', merit_note_en='Admitted international first-year students are automatically considered for scholarships of $2,000 to $12,000 per year, renewable for up to four years with good academic standing; no separate application is needed. Apply by December 15 for highest scholarship consideration (March 15 for regular consideration); decisions and award amounts arrive 2-4 weeks after applying.', aid_source_url='https://thehub.colostate.edu/financial-aid/international-student-scholarships/' where id=210;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://irma.depaul.edu/cds/2025/2025CDS_C.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=509, intl_aid_avg=23186, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Global DePaul Scholarship (automatic, merit-based)', merit_intl_en='Global DePaul Scholarship (automatic, merit-based)', merit_note='모든 국제학생은 지원만 하면 별도 신청 없이 merit 기반 Global DePaul Scholarship에 자동으로 심사되고, 고교 GPA를 기준으로 $12,000~$32,000이 합격 통지서에 함께 안내돼요. 학업 요건을 유지하면 최대 4년간 갱신돼요. need-based 재정 지원은 FAFSA를 내는 미국 시민권자·영주권자 대상으로 안내돼 있어요.', merit_note_en='All international applicants are automatically considered for the merit-based Global DePaul Scholarship ($12,000-$32,000, based on high school GPA) with no separate application; the award is announced in the admission letter and renewable for up to four years in good standing. Need-based aid is described as being for U.S. citizens and permanent residents who file the FAFSA.', aid_source_url='https://www.depaul.edu/admission/international-admission/freshman' where id=211;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Academic Excellence Scholarships (automatic)', merit_intl_en='Academic Excellence Scholarships (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생도 입학 심사 과정에서 Monmouth의 academic excellence 장학금을 자동으로 심사받고, 별도 신청은 필요 없어요. 공식 페이지에 장학금 금액은 나와 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='Incoming international students are automatically considered for Monmouth''s academic excellence scholarships during the admission process, with no additional application needed. The official page does not list award amounts.', aid_source_url='https://www.monmouth.edu/international-students/undergraduate-admissions/' where id=212;
update public.schools set c7_very_important='{}'::text[], c7_source_url='https://iea.unl.edu/common-data-set-2025-2026/c-first-time-first-year-admission/basis-selection/', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=120, intl_aid_avg=10391, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Global Laureate, Global Ambassador and Global Delegate Scholarships (automatic)', merit_intl_en='Global Laureate, Global Ambassador and Global Delegate Scholarships (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생은 합격하면 별도 신청 없이 Global Scholarship(Global Laureate 연 $15,000, Global Ambassador 연 $10,000, Global Delegate 연 $4,000, 최대 4년) 심사를 자동으로 받아요. 받으려면 가을 입학 기준 5월 1일까지 예치금을 내고 영어 요건을 충족해야 해요. 유지하려면 누적 GPA 3.0 이상과 연 24학점 이수가 필요해요.', merit_note_en='All international admits are automatically evaluated for Global Scholarships: Global Laureate ($15,000/yr), Global Ambassador ($10,000/yr) and Global Delegate ($4,000/yr), renewable up to four years. Fall admits must pay the enrollment deposit by May 1 and meet the English requirement for unconditional admission. Renewal requires a 3.0 cumulative GPA and 24 credits per year.', aid_source_url='https://admissions.unl.edu/cost/scholarships/global-laureate-scholarship/' where id=213;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://ir.charlotte.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/871/2026/06/CDS-2025-26.xlsx', demonstrated_interest=true, merit_intl='NinerScholars merit scholarships (separate application)', merit_intl_en='NinerScholars merit scholarships (separate application)', merit_note='국제학생도 합격 후 NinerNET 계정을 만들면 NinerScholars 포털에서 merit 장학금에 지원할 수 있어요. 자동 심사가 아니라 직접 신청해야 하고, Honors College·교내 merit 장학금은 12월 1일, 신입생 전용 일부 장학금은 2월 15일이 마감이에요. need-based 장학금은 FAFSA가 필요해서 국제학생은 해당되지 않아요.', merit_note_en='International students can apply for merit scholarships in the NinerScholars portal once admitted and their NinerNET account is set up; there is no automatic merit process. Honors College and university-wide merit scholarships are due Dec. 1, and some freshman-only scholarships Feb. 15. Need-based scholarships require the FAFSA (U.S. citizens only).', aid_source_url='https://scholarships.charlotte.edu/apply/faqs-for-students/' where id=214;
update public.schools set merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='Hunter 공식 페이지에는 국제학생 신입생 전용 merit 장학금이 따로 안내되어 있지 않아요. 국제학생 사무소는 주로 외부 장학금 목록과 교내 장학금 통합 신청(Hunter College Scholarship Application)을 안내하고 있어요.', merit_note_en='Hunter''s official pages do not list a dedicated merit scholarship for international first-year students. The International Students Office mainly points to outside scholarship databases and the general Hunter College Scholarship Application for institutional awards.', aid_source_url='https://www.hunter.cuny.edu/students/academic-planning/international-students-office/grants/' where id=215;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Merit-based scholarships (automatic consideration)', merit_intl_en='Merit-based scholarships (automatic consideration)', merit_note='국제학생도 합격하면 merit-based scholarship 대상으로 자동 심사되고, 별도 신청은 필요 없어요. 금액은 공개되어 있지 않고, 학비 전액을 덮는 장학금은 없어요. 국제학생에게 need-based 재정지원은 제공하지 않아요.', merit_note_en='All admitted first-degree undergraduates, including international students, are automatically considered for merit-based scholarships with no separate application. Amounts are not published, and no scholarship covers the full cost for international students. Seattle U does not offer need-based financial aid to international students.', aid_source_url='https://www.seattleu.edu/admissions-aid/international-admissions/faqs/', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=216;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','talent']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.uc.edu/content/dam/refresh/provost-62/offices/ir/2025-2026ay/CDS%202025%202026%20Clifton%20Final%20%2006FEB26.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=958, intl_aid_avg=14548, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Outreach Award (automatic)', merit_intl_en='International Outreach Award (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생의 주요 장학금은 International Outreach Award로, 메인 캠퍼스 기준 연 $5,000~$15,000이며 별도 지원서 없이 입학 지원서로 자동 검토돼요. 최소 비가중 GPA 3.0이 필요하고, 장학금 검토를 보장받으려면 11월 1일까지 지원을 마쳐야 해요. 국제 학부생에게는 전액 장학금이나 need-based 장학금을 주지 않아요.', merit_note_en='The main scholarship for international students is the International Outreach Award, $5,000–$15,000 per year on the Uptown campus, automatically reviewed from the admission application (minimum 3.0 unweighted GPA; complete application by November 1 to guarantee consideration). UC does not offer full-tuition or need-based scholarships to international undergraduates.', aid_source_url='https://www.admissions.uc.edu/information/international/finance/scholarship.html' where id=217;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://louisville.widen.net/s/smcqrxtdmf/common-data-set-2024-2025-final', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=118, intl_aid_avg=10746, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Global Cardinal Scholarship (automatic)', merit_intl_en='Global Cardinal Scholarship (automatic)', merit_note='F-1 비자 국제 신입생은 고등학교 GPA(4.0 환산)에 따라 Global Cardinal Scholarship을 연 $5,000~$8,000 받을 수 있어요(3.25~3.49: $5,000, 3.5~3.74: $6,500, 3.75 이상: $8,000). 합격하면 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 적용돼요. 공식 CDS 기준으로 국제학생에게는 성적 기반(non-need) 장학금만 있어요.', merit_note_en='F-1 international first-time freshmen receive the Global Cardinal Scholarship of $5,000-$8,000 per year based on high school GPA on a 4.0 scale ($5,000 for 3.25-3.49, $6,500 for 3.5-3.74, $8,000 for 3.75+), applied automatically upon admission. Per the CDS, only non-need-based institutional aid is available to nonresidents.', aid_source_url='https://louisville.edu/cost-aid/undergraduate-scholarships-aid/international-scholarships-aid' where id=218;
update public.schools set c7_very_important='{}'::text[], c7_source_url='https://olemiss.box.com/s/6bzcp3bynrhjvncy710c5n4ia9206jd7', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=167, intl_aid_avg=28611, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Academic Excellence Scholarships (Mississippi Premier, Champion, Magnolia, Legacy; automatic); ACT/SAT scholarships', merit_intl_en='International Academic Excellence Scholarships (Mississippi Premier, Champion, Magnolia, Legacy; automatic); ACT/SAT scholarships', merit_note='해외 고등학교를 다닌 국제학생 신입생은 합격하면 GPA(미국 4.0 기준)에 따라 International Academic Excellence 장학금을 자동으로 받아요. 금액은 연 $5,000(GPA 3.25~3.49)부터 연 $28,893(GPA 3.9~4.0)까지이고 4년간 받을 수 있어요. SAT/ACT 점수가 높으면 대신 점수 기반 장학금을 받을 수도 있지만 둘을 합쳐 받을 수는 없어요.', merit_note_en='International first-year students who attended high school outside the U.S. are automatically considered for International Academic Excellence Scholarships once admitted, based on U.S.-scale GPA: from $5,000/year (3.25-3.49) up to $28,893/year (3.9-4.0), for four years. High SAT/ACT scorers may instead qualify for test-score scholarships, which cannot be stacked with the GPA-based award.', aid_source_url='https://olemiss.edu/global/international-students-oge/scholarships-international-students/' where id=219;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://uair.utah.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CDS_2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=776, intl_aid_avg=10340, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='유타대의 University merit scholarship은 정부 재원이 들어가서 학생 비자로 공부하는 국제학생은 받을 수 없어요. 대신 입학 후 재학생 대상인 International Student & Scholar Services(ISSS) Scholarship이나 단과대·기숙사 장학금, 외부 장학금 데이터베이스를 안내하고 있어요.', merit_note_en='Because University of Utah merit scholarships are partly or fully government-funded, international students on a visa are not eligible for them. The university instead points international students to options such as the ISSS Scholarship for currently enrolled international undergraduates, college/housing scholarships, and external scholarship databases.', aid_source_url='https://admissions.utah.edu/scholarships/' where id=220;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','class_rank','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.depts.ttu.edu/irim/CommonDataSets/TTU_CDS_2025-2026-4-30-26.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='국제학생 입학 페이지에 가을 입학 장학금 우선 마감일이 12월 1일로 안내돼 있고, 교내 일반 장학금은 입학 지원서로 함께 심사돼요. 다만 국제학생이 받을 수 있는 장학금 이름과 금액은 공식 페이지에 따로 나와 있지 않아요. 학교는 국제학생도 SAT를 내면 장학금 심사에 도움이 된다고 안내해요.', merit_note_en='Texas Tech''s international admissions page lists a December 1 priority scholarship deadline for summer/fall entry, and general scholarships are considered through the admission application. The official pages do not specify which named awards or amounts international first-years can receive; the CDS notes internationals are encouraged to submit the SAT for scholarship consideration.', aid_source_url='https://www.depts.ttu.edu/admissions/international/' where id=221;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://manoa.hawaii.edu/miro/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Common_Data_Set_2025-2026_v2.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=214, intl_aid_avg=8598, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='International Merit Award Scholarship (automatic)', merit_intl_en='International Merit Award Scholarship (automatic)', merit_note='F-1 비자가 필요한 국제학생 신입생 중 고교 누적 GPA 3.3 이상이면 합격 시 별도 신청 없이 International Merit Award Scholarship 심사를 받아요. 금액은 하와이 주민 학비의 150%로, 공식 페이지 기준 2023-24학년도에 연 약 $16,380였어요. 가을 입학은 6월 1일이 우선 마감이라 가능한 한 일찍 지원하는 게 유리해요.', merit_note_en='Admitted first-year students who need an F-1 visa and have a cumulative high school GPA of 3.3 or higher are automatically considered for the International Merit Award Scholarship, with no separate application. It equals 150% of the resident tuition rate (about $16,380 per year for 2023-24, per the page); the priority deadline for fall enrollment is June 1, so applying early helps.', aid_source_url='https://manoa.hawaii.edu/fas/types-of-aid/scholarships/academic-merit-scholarships/' where id=222;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://irda.wayne.edu/common-data-set/2025-2026-cds.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=287, intl_aid_avg=10539, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Warrior Award, Gold Award, Green Award (automatic merit consideration)', merit_intl_en='Warrior Award, Gold Award, Green Award (automatic merit consideration)', merit_note='국제 신입생도 모든 신입생과 같이 자동으로 merit 장학금 심사를 받고, Warrior Award·Gold Award·Green Award 대상이에요. 고교 GPA(선택적으로 SAT/ACT)로 정하고, Fall 2027 기준 우선 마감일은 2027년 2월 1일, 장학금 최종 마감은 4월 1일이에요. FAFSA 기반 need-based 지원은 미국 시민권자·자격 있는 비시민권자 대상이에요.', merit_note_en='International first-year students are automatically considered for merit scholarships and are eligible for the Warrior, Gold, and Green Awards, based on high school GPA and optional SAT/ACT. For Fall 2027 the scholarship priority deadline is February 1, 2027 (final April 1, 2027); FAFSA-based need-based funding is for U.S. citizens and eligible non-citizens.', aid_source_url='https://wayne.edu/scholarships/international' where id=223;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Academic merit scholarships (High School Achievement, Deans Award, Presidential Awards; automatic); #YouAreWelcomeHere Award', merit_intl_en='Academic merit scholarships (High School Achievement, Deans Award, Presidential Awards; automatic); #YouAreWelcomeHere Award', merit_note='국제학생 학부생도 성적·재능·운동 장학금 대상이고, 입학 지원서를 완성하면 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 장학금 심사를 받아요. 신입생 academic merit 장학금은 연 $15,000~$40,000 범위로 안내돼 있어요. 국제학생은 연방·주 정부 지원은 받을 수 없고, 매년 두 명에게 주는 #YouAreWelcomeHere Award도 있어요.', merit_note_en='Undergraduate international students are eligible for merit, talent and athletic scholarships and are reviewed automatically once their admission application is complete (no separate application). First-year academic merit awards (High School Achievement, Deans, Presidential) range from $15,000 to $40,000 per year; internationals cannot receive federal or state aid, and two #YouAreWelcomeHere Awards are offered to non-U.S. citizens each fall.', aid_source_url='https://www.adelphi.edu/one-stop/financial-aid/applying-for-aid/international-students/' where id=224;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/wzzswsxb26ml907zmuvip/CDS-2025-26-for-Georgia-State-University.xlsx?rlkey=50qwjhqh9l6nezm62uqg016cz&st=2uxjc0xz&dl=0', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=455, intl_aid_avg=3209, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Out-of-State Tuition Waiver Scholarship (automatic; covers the out-of-state portion of tuition)', merit_intl_en='Out-of-State Tuition Waiver Scholarship (automatic; covers the out-of-state portion of tuition)', merit_note='국제학생도 주 외(out-of-state) 학생으로 분류돼 성적 기반 등록금 면제 장학금 심사를 받을 수 있어요. 고교 GPA 3.6 이상이면 별도 신청 없이 검토돼 등록금 중 주 외 학생 추가분을 면제받을 수 있고, 11월 15일까지 지원하면 우선 검토되며 예산이 남아 있는 동안 선착순으로 줘요. 장학금을 유지하려면 풀타임 등록과 GPA 3.0 이상이 필요해요.', merit_note_en='International students are treated as out-of-state for this award: freshmen with a 3.6+ college-prep GPA are automatically reviewed for a merit waiver of the out-of-state portion of tuition, with priority for applications by November 15 and awards first-come, first-served while funds last. Renewal requires full-time enrollment and a 3.0 GSU GPA.', aid_source_url='https://admissions.gsu.edu/tuition/financial-aid/' where id=225;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','class_rank','gpa','essay','recommendations']::text[], c7_source_url='https://issuu.com/hofstra/docs/2025-2026_common_data_set_-_hofstra_university', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=148, intl_aid_avg=37522, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Partial merit scholarships (automatic)', merit_intl_en='Partial merit scholarships (automatic)', merit_note='Hofstra는 국제학생 신입생에게 원서 전체를 평가해 부분 merit 장학금을 주고, 따로 신청할 필요가 없어요. 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않아요. 국제학생에게 전액 장학금이나 need-based 재정지원은 제공하지 않아요.', merit_note_en='Hofstra awards partial merit scholarships to international undergraduates based on an overall review of the admission application, with no separate application; amounts are not published. It does not offer full-ride scholarships or need-based financial aid to international students.', aid_source_url='https://www.hofstra.edu/admission/scholarship-opportunities.html', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=226;
update public.schools set c7_very_important='{}'::text[], c7_source_url='https://ira.okstate.edu/site-files/documents/cds/cds2526.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=169, intl_aid_avg=10492, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Achievement Freshmen Scholarship (automatic, GPA/test-based tuition waiver)', merit_intl_en='International Achievement Freshmen Scholarship (automatic, GPA/test-based tuition waiver)', merit_note='국제학생도 입학 지원서만 완료하면 별도 신청 없이 장학금 심사를 자동으로 받아요. International Achievement Freshmen Scholarship은 GPA와 영어·SAT/ACT 점수 구간에 따라 연 최대 $15,000까지 주며, 점수 없이 GPA만으로 받는 구간도 있어요. 가을 입학은 2월 1일까지 서류를 모두 내야 장학금 심사가 보장돼요.', merit_note_en='International students are automatically considered for scholarships by completing the admission application; no separate scholarship application is required. The International Achievement Freshmen Scholarship awards up to $15,000 per year based on GPA and English/SAT/ACT score bands, with a GPA-only tier as well. For fall entry, all materials must be in by February 1 to ensure scholarship consideration.', aid_source_url='https://go.okstate.edu/scholarships-financial-aid/types-of-aid/scholarships-and-grants/international-scholarships' where id=227;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://sites.rowan.edu/academic-affairs/ida/_docs/rowan_university_cds.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=372, intl_aid_avg=14677, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Rowan University International Scholarship (merit, automatic)', merit_intl_en='Rowan University International Scholarship (merit, automatic)', merit_note='합격한 국제학생은 모두 Rowan University International Scholarship 대상으로 자동 심사되고, 별도 신청서는 없어요. 금액은 연 $1,000~$19,000이고, 우선 심사를 받으려면 3월 1일까지 지원서를 완료하는 게 좋아요. GPA 2.5 이상을 유지해야 해요.', merit_note_en='All admitted international students are automatically considered for the Rowan University International Scholarship, with no separate application. Awards range from $1,000 to $19,000 per year; complete the application by the March 1 priority deadline, and keep a minimum 2.5 GPA to renew.', aid_source_url='https://admissions.rowan.edu/admissions-process/international-requirements/index.html' where id=228;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','essay','recommendations']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.samford.edu/departments/files/Institutional_Effectiveness/2025-2026/Section-C-First-Time-First-Year-Freshman-Admission.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=44, intl_aid_avg=50813, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Samford merit scholarships (application via applicant portal)', merit_intl_en='Samford merit scholarships (application via applicant portal)', merit_note='국제학생도 Samford 장학금에 지원할 수 있고, 합격 후 지원자 포털에서 장학금 신청서를 제출해요(1차 마감 12월 1일, 2차 마감 2월 15일). 신입생 merit 장학금은 8학기 동안 보장돼요. CSS Profile로 재정 필요를 보여주면 국제학생도 need-based 지원을 받을 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='International applicants are invited to apply for Samford scholarships through the applicant status portal (first scholarship deadline December 1, second February 15); freshman merit awards are guaranteed for eight semesters. International applicants who demonstrate need via the CSS Profile may be eligible for need-based aid.', aid_source_url='https://www.samford.edu/admission/international-students' where id=229;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://osai.uark.edu/datasets/cds/cds25-26v4.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=184, intl_aid_avg=17917, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Academic freshman scholarships (e.g., Chancellor''s Scholarship) via scholarship application', merit_intl_en='Academic freshman scholarships (e.g., Chancellor''s Scholarship) via scholarship application', merit_note='대학 공식 안내에 따르면 대부분의 신입생 학업 장학금은 미국에서 공부할 수 있는 신분(학생 비자 등)의 외국인도 받을 수 있어요. 장학금 신청서를 작성하고 2월 1일 최종 마감까지 제출해야 심사받을 수 있어요. 비거주 학생용 New Arkansan NRTA가 국제학생에게도 적용되는지는 공식 페이지에 명시돼 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='The university states that most freshman academic scholarships are open to foreign nationals permitted to study in the U.S., in addition to citizens and residents. Students must complete a scholarship application by the February 1 final deadline. Whether the New Arkansan Non-Resident Tuition Award applies to international students is not stated on the official pages.', aid_source_url='https://scholarships.uark.edu/guide-to-academic-freshman-scholarships/nonresident-freshman-scholarships.php' where id=230;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://wpcdn.web.wsu.edu/wp-provost/uploads/sites/3285/2026/05/CDS_2025-2026-PDF_For-Website.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=216, intl_aid_avg=10094, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Academic Award (automatic tuition waiver)', merit_intl_en='International Academic Award (automatic tuition waiver)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생은 합격하면 GPA에 따라 International Academic Award 등록금 감면을 자동으로 받아요(GPA 3.60 이상 $4,000, 3.0~3.59 $2,000). GPA 3.0과 학점 요건을 지키면 갱신돼요. 그 밖의 교내 장학금은 WSU General Scholarship Application(1월 31일 우선 마감)으로 따로 신청해요.', merit_note_en='Admitted international first-year students are automatically awarded the International Academic Award tuition waiver based on GPA ($4,000 for 3.60+, $2,000 for 3.0-3.59), renewable with a 3.0 GPA and full-time credits. Other university scholarships require the WSU General Scholarship Application (priority date January 31).', aid_source_url='https://financialaid.wsu.edu/scholarships/' where id=231;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay','recommendations','state_residency']::text[], c7_source_url='https://ipar.ecu.edu/wp-content/pv-uploads/sites/130/CDS_2024-2025_Redacted.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=53, intl_aid_avg=19182, intl_aid_year='2023-24', aid_source_url='https://ipar.ecu.edu/wp-content/pv-uploads/sites/130/CDS_2024-2025_Redacted.pdf' where id=232;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','standardized_tests','recommendations']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.lsu.edu/data/common-data-set/2024/3_2425_admissions.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=87, intl_aid_avg=13540, intl_aid_year='2023-24', merit_intl='Traditional freshman merit scholarships (only for internationals who attended a U.S. high school or an American school abroad)', merit_intl_en='Traditional freshman merit scholarships (only for internationals who attended a U.S. high school or an American school abroad)', merit_note='LSU는 국제학생 전용 장학금은 없지만, 미국 고등학교나 해외의 미국계 학교를 다닌 국제 신입생은 일반 신입생 장학금 심사를 받을 수 있어요. 비거주자 merit scholarship은 연 $13,000–$23,000이고, 입학 지원서로 자동 심사돼요. Stamps·Chancellor''s Alumni 장학금은 12월 1일 우선 마감까지 지원해야 고려돼요.', merit_note_en='LSU has no scholarship program specifically for international students, but international freshmen who attended a U.S. high school or an American school abroad can be considered for regular freshman scholarships. Non-Louisiana merit awards range from $13,000 to $23,000 per year and are awarded from the admission application; Stamps and Chancellor''s Alumni awards require applying by the December 1 priority deadline.', aid_source_url='https://www.lsu.edu/financialaid/scholarships/incoming-students.php' where id=233;
update public.schools set merit_intl='OHIO Excellence Awards (merit-based portions, automatic)', merit_intl_en='OHIO Excellence Awards (merit-based portions, automatic)', merit_note='국제학생도 OHIO Excellence Awards 중 메리트 기반 장학금 심사를 받을 수 있어요(FAFSA가 필요한 OHIO Admission Promise Award는 제외). 입학 지원서가 곧 장학금 신청서라 따로 신청할 필요는 없지만, 가을 학기 입학생만 대상이고 11월 15일 얼리 액션 마감까지 서류를 모두 내야 전체 심사를 받아요. 성적을 유지하면 최대 4년 갱신돼요.', merit_note_en='International students can be considered for the merit-based portions of the OHIO Excellence Awards (not the OHIO Admission Promise Award, which requires the FAFSA). The admission application serves as the scholarship application, but awards are for fall starters only and a complete application by the November 15 early action deadline is needed for full consideration; awards are renewable for up to four years.', aid_source_url='https://www.ohio.edu/admissions/tuition/international-scholarships' where id=234;
update public.schools set merit_intl='President''s Excellence Award, Trustee Scholarship, College Scholarship, Conley Award (automatic merit)', merit_intl_en='President''s Excellence Award, Trustee Scholarship, College Scholarship, Conley Award (automatic merit)', merit_note='국제 신입생도 입학 심사 과정에서 별도 신청 없이 merit 장학금(President''s Excellence Award, Trustee Scholarship, College Scholarship, Conley Award)을 자동으로 심사받아요. 금액은 $6,000~$20,000이고 요구 GPA를 유지하면 4년간 갱신되며, 선착순으로 한정돼 있어 일찍 지원하는 게 유리해요.', merit_note_en='International first-years are automatically considered for merit scholarships (President''s Excellence Award, Trustee Scholarship, College Scholarship, Conley Award) during admission review, with no separate application. Awards range from $6,000 to $20,000, renew for four years with the required GPA, and are limited and first-come, first-served.', aid_source_url='https://www.sacredheart.edu/admissions--aid/international-admissions/undergraduate-international-admissions/international-student-scholarship-opportunities/' where id=235;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.umb.edu/media/umassboston/editor-uploads/institutional-research-assessment-planning/CDS-PDF-23-24.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, merit_intl='UMass Boston merit scholarship (automatic, up to $10,000/year)', merit_intl_en='UMass Boston merit scholarship (automatic, up to $10,000/year)', merit_note='신입생은 입학 지원서로 merit 장학금을 자동 심사받고, GPA 3.3 이상인 국제학생은 연 최대 $10,000 장학금 대상이 될 수 있어요. 파트너십 프로그램으로 입학하는 학생은 받을 수 없고, 국제학생은 연방 근로장학(Work-Study) 대상이 아니에요.', merit_note_en='Incoming first-year students are automatically considered for merit scholarships based on their admission application; international students with a 3.3+ GPA are considered for up to $10,000 per year. These awards are not available to students entering through partnership programs, and international students do not qualify for Federal Work-Study.', aid_source_url='https://www.umb.edu/financial-aid/undergraduate-financial-aid/international-undergraduate-students/' where id=236;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','essay']::text[], c7_source_url='https://it.stthom.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/CDS_2022-2023.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=83, intl_aid_avg=15524, intl_aid_year='2022-23', aid_source_url='https://it.stthom.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/CDS_2022-2023.pdf' where id=237;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.belmont.edu/irsa/_files/data-sets/cds-2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=68, intl_aid_avg=25368, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Academic merit scholarships (automatic)', merit_intl_en='Academic merit scholarships (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생도 학업 merit 장학금(연 $8,000~$25,000)을 받을 수 있고, 입학 원서가 곧 장학금 신청이라 따로 신청할 필요가 없어요. 학과·음악·미술·운동 장학금도 있어요. Belmont는 국제학생에게 need-based 재정지원을 주지 않아요.', merit_note_en='International first-year students can receive academic merit scholarships of $8,000-$25,000 per year; the admission application serves as the scholarship application. Departmental, music, art and athletic scholarships also exist. Belmont does not offer need-based financial assistance to international students.', aid_source_url='https://www.belmont.edu/admissions/international/tuition-aid.html', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=238;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.ir.msstate.edu/cdsets.php', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=293, intl_aid_avg=4702, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Freshman Academic Scholarships for International Students (automatic, GPA-based); competitive scholarships via General Scholarship Application', merit_intl_en='Freshman Academic Scholarships for International Students (automatic, GPA-based); competitive scholarships via General Scholarship Application', merit_note='국제학생도 9~11학년 GPA 3.30 이상이면 합격 때 academic scholarship을 자동으로 받아요. 학교가 국제학생용으로 연결한 표 기준 금액은 GPA에 따라 연 $12,000~$19,000이고, 최대 4년 갱신돼요. 추가 competitive 장학금은 합격 후 General Scholarship Application을 내야 하고 우선 마감은 12월 1일이에요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen with a 9th-11th grade GPA of 3.30+ are automatically awarded academic scholarships at admission; the chart MSU links for international students lists $12,000-$19,000 per year by GPA, renewable up to four years. Competitive scholarships require the General Scholarship Application after admission (December 1 priority date). Students with active agent contracts are ineligible.', aid_source_url='https://www.sfa.msstate.edu/scholarships/international-scholarships' where id=240;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Merit-based scholarships for new international students (limited, automatic)', merit_intl_en='Merit-based scholarships for new international students (limited, automatic)', merit_note='UNCG는 새로 입학하는 국제학생에게 소수의 1년짜리 성적 장학금을 주고, 성적에 따라 1년 더 연장될 수 있어요. 별도 신청은 필요 없고, 가을 학기 입학생은 3월과 6월에 결과를 알려줘요. 이 외의 재정 지원은 미국 시민권자가 아니면 받을 수 없다고 공식적으로 안내하고 있어요.', merit_note_en='UNCG offers a limited number of one-year merit scholarships to new international students, renewable for one more year based on merit, with no separate application; fall entrants are notified in March and June. The university states that additional financial aid is not available for non-U.S. citizens.', aid_source_url='https://admissions.uncg.edu/admissions/international-admissions/' where id=242;
update public.schools set intl_aid_count=1075, intl_aid_avg=5928, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='UNT Excellence Scholarship / UNT Achievement Scholarship (automatic) + competitive scholarship tuition waiver', merit_intl_en='UNT Excellence Scholarship / UNT Achievement Scholarship (automatic) + competitive scholarship tuition waiver', merit_note='3월 1일까지 합격한 신입생은 별도 신청 없이 UNT Excellence Scholarship(석차·비가중 GPA 기준, 연 $2,000~$12,000, 최대 4년)을 자동 심사받아요. 국제학생이 이 장학금이나 UNT Achievement Scholarship을 받으면 in-state와 out-of-state 등록금 차액을 면제하는 competitive scholarship waiver도 받을 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='First-time freshmen admitted by March 1 are automatically considered for the UNT Excellence Scholarship ($2,000-$12,000 per year based on class rank and unweighted GPA, renewable up to 4 years) with no separate application. International students who receive an Excellence or Achievement Scholarship may also qualify for a competitive scholarship waiver covering the difference between in-state and out-of-state tuition.', aid_source_url='https://financialaid.unt.edu/unt-excellence-scholarships.html' where id=243;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.xavier.edu/institutional-research/reports-and-documents/cds_2023-2024-1-legacy-final-12-sep-2024.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=49, intl_aid_avg=35297, intl_aid_year='2022-23', merit_intl='Xavier Merit Scholarships (automatic); Xavier Competitive Scholarships', merit_intl_en='Xavier Merit Scholarships (automatic); Xavier Competitive Scholarships', merit_note='국제학생을 포함한 모든 합격생은 별도 신청 없이 연 $23,000~$30,000의 merit scholarship을 자동으로 심사받고, 4년간 갱신돼요. 전공·봉사·예술 재능 등에 따른 Competitive Scholarship은 가을 입학 기준 12월 1일까지 지원해야 심사받을 수 있어요. Xavier는 재정 필요 기반(need-based) 교내 장학금을 주지 않아요.', merit_note_en='Every admitted student, including internationals, is automatically considered for a merit scholarship of $23,000-$30,000 per year, renewable for four years, with no separate application. Additional Competitive Scholarships (by major, service, artistic talent, etc.) require applying by the December 1 deadline for fall entry. Xavier does not award institutional need-based scholarships.', aid_source_url='https://www.xavier.edu/international-admission/scholarships/index', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=244;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://prpa.illinoisstate.edu/downloads/CDS_2025-2026_ILSTU_FINAL2.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=102, intl_aid_avg=16221, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Admissions Scholarship (automatic)', merit_intl_en='International Admissions Scholarship (automatic)', merit_note='국제 신입생은 GPA 3.0 이상이고 영어 능력 기준을 충족하면 International Admissions Scholarship 대상이 돼요. 별도 신청서 없이 입학 지원만 하면 되고, 합격할 때 결과를 알려줘요. 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않고, 조건을 유지하면 최대 3년 더 갱신돼요.', merit_note_en='New international undergraduates with a 3.0+ GPA who meet English proficiency requirements are considered for the International Admissions Scholarship with no separate application; winners are notified at admission. The official page does not list an amount, and the award is renewable for up to three more years.', aid_source_url='https://illinoisstate.edu/admissions/international/undergraduate-scholarship/' where id=245;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://crimsoncatalog.iu.edu/launch-task/all/common-data-set-cds?terms=cds', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=117, intl_aid_avg=12369, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Admission-based scholarship for international students (automatic); Honors College scholarships', merit_intl_en='Admission-based scholarship for international students (automatic); Honors College scholarships', merit_note='국제학생 신입생은 IU Indianapolis에 지원하면 별도 신청 없이 입학 기반 장학금(admission-based scholarship) 심사를 받는데, 국제학생은 5월 1일까지 지원해야 해요. 금액은 공식 페이지에 나와 있지 않고, 풀타임 등록이 필요해요. Honors College 장학금은 12월 15일까지 입학 지원 후 3월 1일까지 Honors College 지원서를 따로 내야 해요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen who apply by May 1 are automatically considered for an admission-based scholarship with no extra application; amounts are not published and full-time enrollment is required. The competitive Honors College scholarships require applying for admission by December 15 and submitting a separate Honors College application by March 1.', aid_source_url='https://indianapolis.iu.edu/cost-aid/scholarships/apply/iu-indianapolis/' where id=246;
update public.schools set merit_intl='New York Tech academic scholarships (automatic review at admission)', merit_intl_en='New York Tech academic scholarships (automatic review at admission)', merit_note='국제학생은 연방·주 정부 지원은 못 받지만, 학비 일부를 덮는 학교 academic 장학금 대상이에요. 지원서와 서류를 내면 별도 신청 없이 입학과 동시에 장학금 심사를 받고, 신입생은 시험 점수 없이도 고려돼요. 장학금은 입학 시점에만 주어지고, 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='International students are not eligible for federal or state aid, but New York Tech offers academic scholarships that may cover partial tuition. Applications are automatically reviewed for scholarships with no separate form (freshmen do not need test scores), and awards are made only at admission; amounts are not listed on that page.', aid_source_url='https://www.nyit.edu/admissions/international/student-aid/' where id=247;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.ncat.edu/provost/ospie/cds_2024-2025_-final-20251201.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='NC A&T는 국제학생 전용 장학금이 없고, 국제학생은 그랜트·융자·니드 기반 재정지원을 받을 수 없다고 안내해요. 미국 시민권 제한이 없는 학과별 장학금은 고려될 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='NC A&T states it has no scholarships specifically for international students, and grants, loans and need-based aid are not available to them. International students may be considered for departmental awards that are not restricted to U.S. citizens.', aid_source_url='https://www.ncat.edu/admissions/financial-aid/types-of-aid/scholarships/international-student-scholarships.php', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=248;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://dataden.unr.edu/Resources/CDS/CDS_2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, merit_intl='OISS Scholarship; college and department scholarships (GUS application)', merit_intl_en='OISS Scholarship; college and department scholarships (GUS application)', merit_note='국제학생(F-1/J-1)도 장학금을 받을 수 있어요. 국제학생처(OISS) 장학금은 연 $300–$5,000이고, 단과대·학과 장학금과 함께 MyNEVADA의 장학금 신청서(GUS)를 내야 하며 2월 1일까지 내면 우선 검토돼요. 1년 이상 다닌 국제학생은 별도 양식(Institutional Methodology)을 내면 need-based 장학금·보조금 심사를 받을 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='International (F-1/J-1) students are eligible for scholarships: the OISS Scholarship ($300–$5,000 per year) and college/department scholarships, which require the annual GUS scholarship application in MyNEVADA (priority by February 1). International students who have completed one year of study can submit an Institutional Methodology form to be considered for need-based scholarships and grants.', aid_source_url='https://www.unr.edu/oiss/scholarships' where id=249;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.uncw.edu/media/pdf/irp/cds-2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=39, intl_aid_avg=3600, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Incoming Undergraduate Degree-Seeking International Student Scholarship (automatic)', merit_intl_en='Incoming Undergraduate Degree-Seeking International Student Scholarship (automatic)', merit_note='F-1 비자가 필요한 국제학생 신입생은 Incoming Undergraduate Degree-Seeking International Student Scholarship(연 $2,000~$5,000, 갱신 가능)을 원서만으로 자동 심사받아요. 합격 후에는 University Scholarship Application으로 다른 교내 장학금에도 지원할 수 있고, 우선 마감은 3월 1일이에요.', merit_note_en='International first-year students needing F-1 sponsorship are automatically considered, based on their UNCW application, for the renewable Incoming Undergraduate Degree-Seeking International Student Scholarship ($2,000-$5,000 per year). Admitted students can also use the University Scholarship Application (priority deadline March 1).', aid_source_url='https://www.uncw.edu/seahawk-life/support-success/international/students-scholars/resources/financial-resources' where id=250;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.bsu.edu/-/media/www/departmentalcontent/oirds/files/common-data-set/cds-2025-26-final.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=189, intl_aid_avg=19716, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Global Achievement / Global Distinction / Global Presidential Scholarships; #YouAreWelcomeHere Scholarship', merit_intl_en='Global Achievement / Global Distinction / Global Presidential Scholarships; #YouAreWelcomeHere Scholarship', merit_note='국제학생 신입생은 Global Achievement(연 $12,000)·Global Distinction(연 $14,000)·Global Presidential(연 $16,000) 장학금을 최대 8학기 받을 수 있고, 비거주자 등록금에 적용돼요. 국제 교류에 관심을 보인 신입생 2명에게 주는 #YouAreWelcomeHere Scholarship(연 $14,000)도 있어요. 장학금을 받으려면 Ball State 영어 기준을 충족해야 해요.', merit_note_en='International first-year students can receive the Global Achievement ($12,000/yr), Global Distinction ($14,000/yr), or Global Presidential ($16,000/yr) Scholarship for up to eight semesters, applied to nonresident tuition. There is also the #YouAreWelcomeHere Scholarship ($14,000/yr, two awards) for incoming students who promote intercultural exchange. Recipients must meet Ball State''s English proficiency requirements.', aid_source_url='https://www.bsu.edu/admissions/financial-aid-and-scholarships/types/scholarships' where id=251;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','class_rank','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.utsa.edu/ir/docs/resources/commonDataSet/CDS_2024-2025.xlsx', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=340, intl_aid_avg=6646, intl_aid_year='2023-24', merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='UTSA는 국제학생 전용 merit scholarship을 따로 안내하지 않고, 합격 후 UT San Antonio Scholarship Hub에서 일반 장학금에 직접 지원하도록 안내해요. 국제학생용 need-based International Student Grant가 있는데, 별도 신청서와 재정 상황 설명서를 내야 하고 예산이 한정돼 있어요.', merit_note_en='UTSA does not list a dedicated merit scholarship for international first-year students; admitted students can apply for scholarships through the UT San Antonio Scholarship Hub. International students may apply for the need-based International Student Grant (separate application with a statement of need; limited funds).', aid_source_url='https://onestop.utsa.edu/financialaid/apply/financial-aid-for-international-students/' where id=252;
update public.schools set merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='UND 국제학생 입학 페이지는 일부 장학금이 국제학생에게도 열려 있다고만 안내하고, One-Stop Student Services에 문의하거나 Scholarship Central에서 찾아보라고 해요. 신입생 자동 장학금(최대 4년 $14,000)이 국제학생에게도 적용되는지는 공식적으로 명시돼 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='UND''s international admissions page says only that some scholarships are available to international students and directs them to One-Stop Student Services and the Scholarship Central database. It does not state whether the automatic freshman scholarships (up to $14,000 over four years) apply to international students.', aid_source_url='https://und.edu/admissions/international/index.html' where id=253;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.wcupa.edu/deputy-provost/institutionalResearch/documents/CDS_2025-2026%20Final.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=27, intl_aid_avg=10293, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='International (F-1) admissions scholarship ($4,000/year, automatic review); non-FAFSA first-year merit scholarships', merit_intl_en='International (F-1) admissions scholarship ($4,000/year, automatic review); non-FAFSA first-year merit scholarships', merit_note='F-1 비자 국제학생에게는 소수의 입학처 장학금(연 $4,000)이 있고, GPA 3.0 이상이면서 영어·시험 점수가 최소 기준보다 크게 높으면 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 심사돼요. FAFSA가 필요 없는 1학년 성적 장학금도 있는데, 1월 15일까지 합격해야 심사 대상이 돼요. 학교는 국제 신입생에게 전액·부분 학비 장학금은 줄 수 없다고 안내해요.', merit_note_en='A limited number of $4,000/year admissions scholarships go to F-1 international students, automatically reviewed for those with a 3.0+ GPA and English/test scores well above the minimum, renewable with a 3.0 GPA. Some non-FAFSA first-year merit scholarships are also available to applicants admitted by January 15; WCU states it cannot offer full or partial tuition scholarships to incoming international students.', aid_source_url='https://www.wcupa.edu/_admissions/SCH_ADM/international.aspx' where id=254;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://dataoffice.wvu.edu/files/d/d0809710-b583-4b08-8214-e297d97326d5/cds-2024-2025-wvu-final.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=200, intl_aid_avg=21636, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Climb Higher Scholarship (automatic first-time freshman merit); Global Affairs International Merit Scholarship (separate application)', merit_intl_en='Climb Higher Scholarship (automatic first-time freshman merit); Global Affairs International Merit Scholarship (separate application)', merit_note='WVU는 지원서를 내면 GPA(최고 단계는 SAT/ACT 포함) 기준으로 Climb Higher Scholarship을 자동 심사하고, 국제학생도 신입생 장학금 대상이에요(out-of-state 기준 연 $10,000~$18,000). 신입생 장학금 자격이 있는 F-1/J-1 국제학생은 Global Affairs International Merit Scholarship(연 $4,000~$8,000, 소수 선발)에 따로 신청할 수 있고, 우선 마감은 4월 중순이에요.', merit_note_en='WVU automatically reviews applications for Climb Higher merit scholarships based on GPA (the top level also uses SAT/ACT), and international students are considered for first-time freshman scholarships (out-of-state amounts are $10,000-$18,000 per year). F-1/J-1 freshmen who qualify for a first-time freshman scholarship can separately apply for the Global Affairs International Merit Scholarship ($4,000-$8,000 per year, limited awards) by the mid-April priority deadline.', aid_source_url='https://isss.wvu.edu/students-services/scholarships/global' where id=255;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Florida Tech International Scholarship (automatic)', merit_intl_en='Florida Tech International Scholarship (automatic)', merit_note='모든 국제학생 지원자는 합격 시 Florida Tech International Scholarship을 자동으로 심사받아요. 고등학교 성적을 바탕으로 정해지는 등록금 일부 장학금이고, 조건을 충족하면 최대 9학기까지 갱신돼요. 외국 국적 지원자에게는 전액 등록금 merit scholarship은 주지 않아요.', merit_note_en='All international first-year applicants are automatically considered for the Florida Tech International Scholarship at the time of admission, based on high school academic performance. It is a partial-tuition award renewable for up to 9 semesters if renewal requirements are met; Florida Tech does not offer full-tuition merit scholarships to foreign national applicants.', aid_source_url='https://www.fit.edu/admission/scholarships--aid/university-scholarships-and-grants/' where id=256;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www-s3-live.kent.edu/s3fs-root/s3fs-public/file/KC%20CDS_2025-2026-Final_web_0.docx?VersionId=0L32UpfYVjihIi_WVglv.yNf81PIcqPD', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=551, intl_aid_avg=10799, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Global Scholarship (automatic); Honors Scholarship', merit_intl_en='Global Scholarship (automatic); Honors Scholarship', merit_note='켄트 캠퍼스에 입학하는 F-1 국제 신입생은 합격하면 Global Scholarship 심사를 자동으로 받아요. 금액은 GPA에 따라 연 $4,300–$12,000이고, Honors College에 합격하면 $15,000에 Honors Scholarship $2,000이 더해져요. 가을 입학은 7월 1일까지 합격해야 하고, 국제학생 장학금은 학비 일부만 지원하는 부분 장학금이에요.', merit_note_en='Incoming F-1 international first-years at the Kent campus are automatically considered for the Global Scholarship on admission: $4,300-$12,000 per year by GPA, or $15,000 plus a $2,000 Honors Scholarship if admitted to the Honors College. Students must be admitted by July 1 for fall, and international scholarships are partial and do not cover full costs.', aid_source_url='https://www.kent.edu/admissions/international-students-scholarship-resources' where id=257;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://it.unlv.edu/sites/default/files/assets/ir/UNLV_common_dataset_2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=195, intl_aid_avg=20632, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='UNLV Signature (academic); UNLV Opportunity (need-based)', merit_intl_en='UNLV Signature (academic); UNLV Opportunity (need-based)', merit_note='국제학생도 합격 시 주는 학업 장학금 UNLV Signature와 성적·재정 필요를 함께 보는 UNLV Opportunity 대상이에요. 따로 장학금 신청서는 없지만 우선 마감일까지 합격하고 FAFSA 또는 Institutional Aid Application을 우선 마감일까지 내야 하며, 가을 학기 입학생만 해당돼요. 금액은 공식 페이지에 ''변동(Varies)''으로만 나와 있어요.', merit_note_en='International undergraduates are eligible for the UNLV Signature academic scholarship and the need-based UNLV Opportunity scholarship, both offered at admission with no separate scholarship application. Students must be admitted by the priority deadline, submit the Institutional Aid Application (or FAFSA) by the priority deadline, and start in fall; amounts are listed only as ''varies''.', aid_source_url='https://www.unlv.edu/finaid/scholarships' where id=258;
update public.schools set merit_intl='International Amigo Scholarship (non-resident tuition waiver)', merit_intl_en='International Amigo Scholarship (non-resident tuition waiver)', merit_note='International Amigo Scholarship에 선발되면 비거주자(out-of-state) 학비 부분을 면제받아요(연 $15,000 이상 가치). 신입생은 고교 GPA 3.5 이상, 또는 ACT 26/SAT 1240 이상과 GPA 3.0 이상이 기준이고, 인원이 한정돼 있어 가을 학기는 2월 15일 우선 마감 전에 서류를 모두 내는 게 좋아요. 매 학기 15학점·GPA 3.0을 유지하면 최대 4년 갱신돼요.', merit_note_en='The International Amigo Scholarship waives the non-resident portion of tuition (worth more than $15,000 per year) for selected international students. Freshman criteria are a 3.5 GPA equivalent, or ACT 26 / SAT 1240 with a 3.0 GPA; awards are limited, so submit everything before the Feb. 15 fall priority deadline. It renews for up to four years with 15 new credits and a 3.0 GPA each semester.', aid_source_url='https://geo.unm.edu/admission/undergraduate/scholarships/amigo.html' where id=259;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.unf.edu/ir/common-data-set/2025.html', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=146, intl_aid_avg=2556, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Non-Florida Resident Merit-Based Waivers (First Coast, Atlantic, Sunshine; automatic)', merit_intl_en='Non-Florida Resident Merit-Based Waivers (First Coast, Atlantic, Sunshine; automatic)', merit_note='국제학생도 비거주자 학비 일부를 깎아 주는 Non-Florida Resident Merit-Based Waiver 대상이에요. GPA와 시험 점수에 따라 Sunshine(연 약 $6,000, GPA 3.5·SAT 1160)부터 First Coast(연 약 $14,000, GPA 3.9·SAT 1300)까지 있고, 별도 신청 없이 1월 15일까지 지원·합격하면 우선 심사돼요. FAFSA가 필요한 장학금은 국제학생이 받을 수 없어요.', merit_note_en='International students may receive Non-Florida Resident Merit-Based Waivers that partially waive out-of-state tuition, from Sunshine (about $6,000/year; 3.5 GPA, 1160 SAT) to First Coast (about $14,000/year; 3.9 GPA, 1300 SAT). No separate application is needed, with priority for students admitted by January 15; F-1 students cannot receive scholarships that require the FAFSA.', aid_source_url='https://www.unf.edu/scholarships/programs.html' where id=260;
update public.schools set merit_intl='International Competitive Scholarship (in-state tuition rate; separate application)', merit_intl_en='International Competitive Scholarship (in-state tuition rate; separate application)', merit_note='국제학생(F-1 신입생)은 International Competitive Scholarship에 따로 신청하면 주 외 등록금 대신 주 내(in-state) 등록금을 내고, 학기마다 $100를 받을 수 있어요. 신입생은 GPA 3.50 이상과 영어 점수(TOEFL 68, IELTS 6.0, Duolingo 95 등) 기준이 있고, I-20를 받은 뒤 가을 학기는 5월 1일–7월 15일에 신청하며 장학금이 소진되면 일찍 마감돼요. 학교의 다른 신입생 성적 장학금은 대부분 미국 시민·영주권자만 받을 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='New F-1 degree-seeking students can apply separately for the International Competitive Scholarship, which lets them pay in-state instead of out-of-state tuition plus a $100 stipend each semester. Freshmen need a 3.50+ GPA and qualifying English scores (e.g., TOEFL 68, IELTS 6.0, Duolingo 95); the fall application runs May 1–July 15 after receiving the I-20 and closes early when awards run out. Most other NMSU freshman merit scholarships require U.S. citizenship or permanent residency.', aid_source_url='https://isss.nmsu.edu/new-students/scholarships.html' where id=261;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','class_rank','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.sdstate.edu/sites/default/files/file-archive/2022-12/South%20Dakota%20State%20University%20-%20Common%20Data%20Set%20%282021-2022%29.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=118, intl_aid_avg=5368, intl_aid_year='2020-21', merit_intl='Jackrabbit Guarantee Scholarship Program (automatic minimum award); other SDSU scholarships via incoming student scholarship application', merit_intl_en='Jackrabbit Guarantee Scholarship Program (automatic minimum award); other SDSU scholarships via incoming student scholarship application', merit_note='학교 국제학생 재정지원 페이지에 따르면 국제학생도 Jackrabbit Guarantee를 포함한 SDSU 장학금을 받을 수 있어요. Jackrabbit Guarantee는 고교 GPA(또는 GPA+ACT/SAT)에 따라 신청 없이 최소 $1,000~$4,000를 보장하고, 다른 장학금은 10월 1일에 열리는 신입생 장학금 신청서를 12월 1일 우선 마감까지 내야 해요.', merit_note_en='SDSU''s financial assistance page for international students says they may qualify for SDSU scholarships, including the Jackrabbit Guarantee. The Jackrabbit Guarantee awards a minimum of $1,000-$4,000 based on high school GPA (or GPA plus ACT/SAT) with no application; other scholarships require the incoming-student scholarship application (opens Oct. 1, priority Dec. 1).', aid_source_url='https://www.sdstate.edu/office-financial-aid-scholarships/financial-assistance-international-students' where id=264;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.uwyo.edu/oia/_files/cds/cds2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=70, intl_aid_avg=12338, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Brown and Gold Commitment (automatic, GPA-based)', merit_intl_en='International Brown and Gold Commitment (automatic, GPA-based)', merit_note='국제 신입생은 GPA에 따라 International Brown and Gold Commitment를 연 $5,000(GPA 3.0~3.39) 또는 $8,000(GPA 3.4~4.0) 받을 수 있어요. 입학 지원서·성적표·영어 점수·재정 증명서(UW Confidential Financial Statement)를 내면 심사되고, 매년 WyoScholarships 일반 신청서를 작성해야 계속 받을 수 있어요. 라라미·캐스퍼 캠퍼스 학위 과정 학생만 대상이에요.', merit_note_en='First-time international students receive the International Brown and Gold Commitment of $5,000 (GPA 3.0-3.39) or $8,000 (GPA 3.4-4.0) per year, based on the admission application, transcripts, English scores and the UW Confidential Financial Statement. Continued funding requires completing the WyoScholarships general application each year; only degree-seeking students at the Laramie or Casper campuses are eligible.', aid_source_url='https://www.uwyo.edu/sfa/scholarships/international/brown-and-gold-commitment.html' where id=266;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://aurora.edu/documents/about/cds-2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=41, intl_aid_avg=14152, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='First-Year International Merit Scholarships (Award 1-4, automatic); Connection Award', merit_intl_en='First-Year International Merit Scholarships (Award 1-4, automatic); Connection Award', merit_note='국제학생 신입생은 별도 신청 없이 합격 후 First-Year International Merit Scholarship을 자동으로 안내받아요. 2026-27학년도 기준 금액은 연 $13,000~$19,000이고, 풀타임 학생은 Connection Award(기숙사 거주 $1,500)도 추가로 받을 수 있어요. 장학금은 예산 범위 내에서 지급되니 일찍 지원하는 게 좋아요.', merit_note_en='International first-year students are automatically considered for First-Year International Merit Scholarships (no special application), notified soon after acceptance; 2026-27 amounts range from $13,000 to $19,000 per year. Full-time students can also stack the Connection Award ($1,500 for residents); awards depend on available funds, so apply early.', aid_source_url='https://aurora.edu/admission/financialaid/types-of-aid/international-scholarships.html' where id=267;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.cmich.edu/docs/default-source/academic-affairs-division/academic-administration/academic-planning-analysis/reports-(public)/common-data-sets/cds-2024-2025.pdf?sfvrsn=b0421437_16', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=27, intl_aid_avg=16805, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='International President''s Award, International Scholar Award, International Opportunity Award (automatic); Centralis Scholarship (competitive)', merit_intl_en='International President''s Award, International Scholar Award, International Opportunity Award (automatic); Centralis Scholarship (competitive)', merit_note='국제학생은 지원만 하면 별도 신청서나 에세이 없이 merit scholarship을 자동으로 심사받고, 자격이 되는 가장 높은 장학금 하나를 받아요. GPA 3.3 이상은 International President''s Award(미국 거주자 등록금 적용, 연 약 $9,144 절감), 3.0~3.29는 International Scholar Award(연 $4,000), 2.8~2.9는 International Opportunity Award(연 $1,000)예요. 최대 전액까지 가능한 경쟁형 Centralis Scholarship에도 도전할 수 있고, 본국 정부 후원 학생은 대상이 아니에요.', merit_note_en='International applicants are automatically considered for merit scholarships with no separate application or essay and receive the highest award they qualify for: International President''s Award (GPA 3.3+, U.S. resident tuition rate, saving about $9,144/year), International Scholar Award (GPA 3.0-3.29, $4,000/year), or International Opportunity Award (GPA 2.8-2.9, $1,000/year). International seniors may also compete for the Centralis Scholarship (up to full tuition, fees, room and board); students sponsored by their home country are not eligible.', aid_source_url='https://www.cmich.edu/international-admissions/undergraduate/cost-scholarships' where id=268;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Merit scholarships for international students (automatic, up to 50% of tuition)', merit_intl_en='Merit scholarships for international students (automatic, up to 50% of tuition)', merit_note='모든 지원자는 merit scholarship 심사를 자동으로 받고, 국제학생 merit scholarship은 학비의 최대 50%까지 지원해요. 학교는 financial aid(need-based)는 미국 시민권자와 영주권자만 받을 수 있다고 안내해요.', merit_note_en='All applicants are automatically considered for institutional merit aid, and Suffolk''s merit scholarships for international students cover up to 50 percent of tuition. Financial aid is available only to U.S. citizens and permanent residents.', aid_source_url='https://www.suffolk.edu/undergraduate-admission/information-for/international-students' where id=269;
update public.schools set intl_aid_count=373, intl_aid_avg=10216, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='UTEP Excellence Scholarship; Presidential Scholarship (application)', merit_intl_en='UTEP Excellence Scholarship; Presidential Scholarship (application)', merit_note='국제학생도 UTEP Excellence Scholarship에 지원할 수 있어요(11학년 기준 상위 25% 학생 대상). 자동 심사가 아니라 10월 1일부터 1월 31일까지 별도 신청서(경험·짧은 에세이)를 내야 하고, 금액은 연 $2,000~$8,000이며 최대 4년 갱신돼요. 상위 최대 10명은 기숙사 포함 전체 학비를 주는 Presidential Scholarship에 선발돼요.', merit_note_en='International students may apply for the UTEP Excellence Scholarship, aimed at students in the top 25% of their junior class; it requires a separate application (experiences and short essays) open October 1 to January 31, and awards $2,000 to $8,000 per year, renewable for up to four years. Up to ten top applicants receive the Presidential Scholarship covering full cost of attendance including on-campus housing.', aid_source_url='https://www.utep.edu/scholarships/' where id=270;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Flagship Scholars Commitment Program (automatic admissions-based scholarships, e.g., Flagship Match Commitment, Flagship Leaders Commitment)', merit_intl_en='Flagship Scholars Commitment Program (automatic admissions-based scholarships, e.g., Flagship Match Commitment, Flagship Leaders Commitment)', merit_note='국제학생도 합격 시 고교 GPA와 과목 난이도를 바탕으로 입학 장학금(Flagship Scholars Commitment Program)을 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 받을 수 있어요. 2026-27 기준 안내된 연간 금액은 Flagship Leaders Commitment $9,000~$12,000, Flagship Match Commitment $16,200이고, 12월 1일까지 지원을 마쳐야 최대 금액을 받을 수 있어요(최소 GPA 2.5, Early Action이면 $3,000 추가 가능).', merit_note_en='Admitted international students are automatically considered for admissions-based Flagship Scholars Commitment scholarships based on high school GPA and course rigor, with no separate application. For 2026-27 the published annual amounts are $9,000-$12,000 (Flagship Leaders Commitment) and $16,200 (Flagship Match Commitment); apply by December 1 for maximum consideration (minimum 2.5 GPA; Early Action applicants may get an extra $3,000).', aid_source_url='https://umaine.edu/admissions/cost-aid/merit-scholarships/international-scholarships-26-27/' where id=271;
update public.schools set merit_intl='BG Success Scholarship; Freshman Academic Scholarship (automatic)', merit_intl_en='BG Success Scholarship; Freshman Academic Scholarship (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생은 입학 지원서만 내면 별도 신청 없이 장학금을 자동 심사받아요. GPA 3.0 이상이면 BG Success Scholarship 연 $4,000(4년 갱신)을 받을 수 있고, GPA와 SAT/ACT 또는 TOEFL/IELTS 점수에 따라 Freshman Academic Scholarship 연 $1,000~$8,000이 추가로 나와요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen are automatically considered for scholarships when they submit a complete admission application, with no separate application. The BG Success Scholarship gives $4,000 per year (renewable for four years) with a 3.0+ GPA, and the Freshman Academic Scholarship adds $1,000-$8,000 per year based on GPA and SAT/ACT or TOEFL/IELTS scores.', aid_source_url='https://www.bgsu.edu/admissions/international/tuition-and-scholarships.html' where id=272;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay','recommendations','character']::text[], c7_source_url='https://calbaptist.edu/about/leadership/provost/educational-effectiveness/institutional-research/pdfs/CDS-PDF-2025-2026%20-%20All.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=36, intl_aid_avg=15145, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Trustees, Presidents, Deans and Directors Scholarships (guaranteed by GPA); departmental scholarships', merit_intl_en='Trustees, Presidents, Deans and Directors Scholarships (guaranteed by GPA); departmental scholarships', merit_note='국제학생도 받을 수 있고, 새로 입학한 학부 국제학생은 100% 학교 장학금을 받는다고 안내해요. 신입생은 미국식 가중 GPA에 따라 Trustees($18,000, 4.0 이상)부터 Directors($14,000, 2.95–3.29)까지 학업 장학금이 영어 요건 충족 시 보장되고, GPA 2.0 이상 유지하면 갱신돼요. 공학·저널리즘 등 학과 장학금도 따로 있어요.', merit_note_en='International students are eligible, and CBU states that 100% of new traditional undergraduate international students receive institutional aid. Freshman academic scholarships from Trustees ($18,000, 4.0+ GPA) to Directors ($14,000, 2.95–3.29 GPA) are guaranteed based on weighted U.S.-equivalent GPA once the language requirement is met, renewable with a 2.0 GPA. Departmental scholarships (e.g., engineering, journalism) are also available.', aid_source_url='https://calbaptist.edu/admissions-aid/international/finances/scholarships.php' where id=273;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Sam Walton Scholarship (business majors; preference for non-U.S. applicants)', merit_intl_en='Sam Walton Scholarship (business majors; preference for non-U.S. applicants)', merit_note='국제학생을 명시한 장학금은 경영 전공자용 Sam Walton Scholarship(연 $3,000, 미국 외 국가 출신 우대)으로, 3월 15일까지 따로 신청해야 해요. Academic Achievement Scholarship 등 일반 학업 장학금이 국제학생에게 적용되는지는 공식 페이지에 명시되어 있지 않아요. 국제학생은 연방 재정지원을 받을 수 없고, 학교 지원금은 실제 학비를 넘지 않아요.', merit_note_en='The only scholarship explicitly aimed at international students is the Sam Walton Scholarship ($3,000 per year, business majors, preference for applicants from outside the U.S.), which requires an application by March 15. The official pages do not state whether general academic scholarships (e.g., Academic Achievement Scholarship) apply to international students. Federal aid is not available, and university aid cannot exceed actual tuition.', aid_source_url='https://www.harding.edu/admissions/cost/index' where id=274;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://in.nau.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/129/2026/04/CDS-2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=129, intl_aid_avg=9320, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International student scholarships (automatic consideration)', merit_intl_en='International student scholarships (automatic consideration)', merit_note='NAU는 국제학생 장학금을 제공하며, 국제학생 지원서를 완료하면 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 장학금 심사를 받아요. 공식 국제학생 페이지에 장학금 이름이나 금액은 따로 나와 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='NAU offers international student scholarships, and applicants are automatically considered once they submit a complete NAU international application. The official international page does not list scholarship names or amounts.', aid_source_url='https://nau.edu/admissions/international/' where id=275;
update public.schools set merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='재정지원 사무실은 국제학생에게 financial aid를 주지 않고, 장학금은 학부 입학처를 통해 받을 수 있을 수도 있다고만 안내해요. 일반 merit scholarship(연 $15,000~$33,000, 지원 시 자동 심사)이 국제학생에게도 똑같이 적용되는지는 공식 페이지에 명시되어 있지 않으니 입학처에 확인하세요.', merit_note_en='The Financial Aid Office does not award financial aid to international students; it says scholarships may be available to them through the Office of Undergraduate Admissions. The official pages do not state whether the general automatic merit scholarship ($15,000-$33,000 per year) applies to international applicants, so confirm with admissions.', aid_source_url='https://www.newhaven.edu/admissions/financial-aid/international.php', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=276;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://files.wmich.edu/s3fs-public/2026-02/wmu_cds_2025-26.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, merit_intl='Global Education Undergraduate Merit Scholarship (automatic)', merit_intl_en='Global Education Undergraduate Merit Scholarship (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생 전용 Global Education Undergraduate Merit Scholarship이 있고, 최대 연 $10,000을 등록금에 쓸 수 있어요(최대 8학기). 별도 장학금 지원서 없이 입학 서류를 모두 내면 자동 검토되지만, 최소 GPA 3.0이 필요하고 예산이 소진될 때까지 순차적으로 주기 때문에 일찍 지원하는 게 좋아요.', merit_note_en='WMU offers the Global Education Undergraduate Merit Scholarship for international students, up to $10,000 per year toward tuition for up to eight semesters. No separate application is needed once the admission file is complete, but a minimum 3.0 GPA is required and awards are made on a rolling basis while funds last.', aid_source_url='https://wmich.edu/international/funding' where id=277;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['religious_affiliation']::text[], c7_source_url='https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/13ocFsVE6A7KA6AQ4O-uM1oDmCvs508AyGjRf4Rxa-aA/edit?usp=sharing', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=210, intl_aid_avg=24492, intl_aid_year='2023-24', merit_intl='Freshman Academic Scholarship (President''s/Provost''s/Dean''s/Eagle''s/Founder''s Grant, automatic); International Student Aid Grant', merit_intl_en='Freshman Academic Scholarship (President''s/Provost''s/Dean''s/Eagle''s/Founder''s Grant, automatic); International Student Aid Grant', merit_note='국제학생도 Freshman Academic Scholarship 대상이고, 합격 시 GPA(시험 점수는 선택) 기준으로 별도 신청 없이 연 $14,500~$24,500이 자동으로 주어져요(2026-27 기준). F-1 비자 신입생은 별도 신청서를 내면 International Student Aid Grant(연 $500~$2,000)도 받을 수 있는데, 성적·리더십으로 뽑고 재정 필요가 있으면 우대해요.', merit_note_en='International undergraduates are eligible for the Freshman Academic Scholarship, awarded automatically upon admission based on unweighted GPA (tests optional) at $14,500-$24,500 per year for 2026-27. New F-1 students can also apply separately for the International Student Aid Grant ($500-$2,000 per year), based on academics and leadership with preference for financial need.', aid_source_url='https://www.biola.edu/financial-aid/scholarships-and-aid/international' where id=278;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['class_rank','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://docs.gato.txst.edu/743980/CDS-2024-2025%20from%20richard.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=638, intl_aid_avg=20584, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Freshman Assured Scholarships (SAT/ACT-based, automatic); Texas State Merit Scholarships (test-optional review); competitive scholarships via BOSS', merit_intl_en='Freshman Assured Scholarships (SAT/ACT-based, automatic); Texas State Merit Scholarships (test-optional review); competitive scholarships via BOSS', merit_note='국제학생도 SAT/ACT 점수와 석차 등 입학 서류에 따라 Freshman Assured Scholarship(연 $4,000~$12,000, 4년)을 보장받을 수 있고, 시험 점수 없이 지원해 석차 상위 35%면 Merit Scholarship 심사도 받아요. 연 $1,000 이상 장학금을 받으면 비거주자 등록금 대신 in-state 등록금을 낼 수 있는 waiver 대상이 될 수 있어요. 학과 등 competitive 장학금은 BOSS에서 3월 1일까지 따로 신청해요.', merit_note_en='International students are guaranteed Freshman Assured Scholarships ($4,000-$12,000 per year for four years) if their SAT/ACT scores and class rank qualify, and test-optional applicants in the top 35% of their class are reviewed for Texas State Merit Scholarships. Receiving at least $1,000 in such scholarships can qualify a nonresident for a competitive scholarship waiver to pay in-state tuition; competitive scholarships need a separate BOSS application by March 1.', aid_source_url='https://onestop.txst.edu/financial-aid/scholarships/freshman.html' where id=279;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Hawk International Scholarship (automatic); Hartt performing arts and Hartford Art School artistic merit scholarships', merit_intl_en='Hawk International Scholarship (automatic); Hartt performing arts and Hartford Art School artistic merit scholarships', merit_note='F-1 비자로 입학하는 정규 학부 국제학생은 merit scholarship을 자동으로 심사받아요. Hawk International Scholarship은 등록금 일부를 주는 장학금으로 $16,000~$31,000 범위이고, 음악·무용·연극(Hartt)이나 미술(Hartford Art School) 지원자는 오디션·포트폴리오로 최대 전액 등록금 장학금을 받을 수 있어요. F-1 학생에게는 need-based 재정지원이 없어요.', merit_note_en='Full-time undergraduates attending on an F-1 visa are automatically considered for merit-based scholarships. The Hawk International Scholarship is a partial-tuition award ranging from $16,000 to $31,000, and Hartt School (music, dance, theatre) and Hartford Art School applicants can be considered for talent awards up to full tuition via audition or portfolio. The University of Hartford offers no need-based financial aid to F-1 students.', aid_source_url='https://www.hartford.edu/admission/international/application-process/default.aspx', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=280;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Provost, Dean''s and Trustees Scholarships, Pathway and Horizon Awards (automatic merit)', merit_intl_en='Provost, Dean''s and Trustees Scholarships, Pathway and Horizon Awards (automatic merit)', merit_note='첫 학사 학위를 받으려는 합격생은 국제학생을 포함해 모두 academic scholarship을 받고, 별도 신청 없이 입학 지원으로 자동 심사돼요. 금액은 Horizon Award 연 최대 $12,000부터 Provost Scholarship 연 최대 $20,000까지예요. 대부분의 학과 장학금도 국제학생이 신청할 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='All admitted first-bachelor''s-degree students, including internationals, receive an academic scholarship and are considered automatically with no extra application. Awards range from up to $12,000 per year (Horizon Award) to up to $20,000 per year (Provost Scholarship), and international students may apply for most departmental scholarships.', aid_source_url='https://uindy.edu/admissions-international-students/scholarships-grants-for-international-students' where id=281;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Undergraduate international student academic (merit) scholarships', merit_intl_en='Undergraduate international student academic (merit) scholarships', merit_note='F-1·J-1 비자로 처음 입학하는 국제학생 신입생에게 경쟁 방식의 메리트 장학금을 주며, 입학 지원서 정보로 심사해서 따로 신청할 필요는 없어요. 고교 GPA+SAT/ACT 또는 GPA만으로 심사받을 수 있고, 우선 심사를 받으려면 12월 1일까지 지원해야 해요. 최대 3년 추가 갱신되지만 금액은 공식 페이지에 나와 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='The University of Memphis awards competitive merit scholarships to newly admitted first-time international students on F-1 or J-1 visas, based on the admission application (no separate application), using either GPA plus SAT/ACT or GPA alone. Apply by December 1 for priority consideration; awards renew for up to three more years, but amounts are not published on the page.', aid_source_url='https://www.memphis.edu/scholarships/international_students/index.php' where id=282;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://uwm.edu/institutional-research/wp-content/uploads/sites/268/2025/07/2024-2025-CDS-Public.xlsx', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=159, intl_aid_avg=3743, intl_aid_year=null, merit_intl='International undergraduate merit scholarship (automatic upon admission)', merit_intl_en='International undergraduate merit scholarship (automatic upon admission)', merit_note='새로 합격한 국제 학부생은 별도 신청 없이 합격과 동시에 merit 기반 장학금 심사를 받고, 연 최대 $6,000(학기당 $3,000)까지 받을 수 있으며 최대 4년 갱신돼요. 예산이 소진될 때까지 매월 선정하므로 가을 학기는 5월 1일까지 합격해 있어야 충분히 고려돼요.', merit_note_en='Newly admitted international bachelor''s students are automatically considered for a merit scholarship upon admission (no separate application), worth up to $6,000 per year ($3,000 per semester) and renewable for up to four years. Awards are made monthly until funds run out, so be admitted by May 1 for fall to ensure full consideration.', aid_source_url='https://uwm.edu/cie/international-admissions/cost-scholarships/' where id=283;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.usu.edu/oda/files/common-data-sets/CDS2025-26.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=1564, intl_aid_avg=15299, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Afton B. Tew International Student Scholarship (automatic); Kim Nam Kyun Scholarship (Korean students, after admission)', merit_intl_en='Afton B. Tew International Student Scholarship (automatic); Kim Nam Kyun Scholarship (Korean students, after admission)', merit_note='GPA 3.85 이상인 국제학생 신입생은 Afton B. Tew 장학금(연 $1,000)을 자동으로 심사받아요. 한국 국제학생 대상인 Kim Nam Kyun Scholarship(연 최대 $2,000)은 합격 후 별도로 신청하는데(3월 13일 마감), 재정 필요를 보여줘야 해요. 그 밖의 USU General Scholarships도 별도 지원서로 신청할 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen with an evaluated GPA of 3.85+ are automatically considered for the Afton B. Tew International Student Scholarship ($1,000/year). Admitted Korean international students who show financial need can apply separately for the Kim Nam Kyun Scholarship (up to $2,000/year, March 13 deadline), and USU General Scholarships use a separate application.', aid_source_url='https://www.usu.edu/admissions/international/undergraduate-costs' where id=284;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.wichita.edu/services/planning_and_analysis/documents/WSU_2025_2026_CDS_OPAweb.xlsx', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=118, intl_aid_avg=8358, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Global Select Scholarship (automatic, 36% tuition discount)', merit_intl_en='Global Select Scholarship (automatic, 36% tuition discount)', merit_note='국제학생은 GPA 3.0 이상이면 합격 시 Global Select Scholarship(등록금 36% 할인, 연 약 $5,500)을 자동으로 받고, 원서의 장학금 질문 하나에만 답하면 돼요. 이 장학금은 프로그램이 끝날 때까지 자동 갱신돼요. 다른 학부 장학금은 1년 다닌 뒤 신청할 수 있고, 재정 필요 기반 장학금은 없다고 안내해요.', merit_note_en='International students (non-immigrant visa status) with a 3.0+ GPA automatically receive the Global Select Scholarship at admission — a 36% tuition discount (about $5,500 per year) that renews automatically; you only answer one scholarship question on the application. Other undergraduate scholarships require one year of attendance first, and the international page states there are no scholarships based on financial need.', aid_source_url='https://wichita.edu/GlobalSelect' where id=285;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.boisestate.edu/ie/data-and-reporting/common-data-set-2025-26/', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=86, intl_aid_avg=6360, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Ridgeline, Summit and Global Scholarships (automatic)', merit_intl_en='Ridgeline, Summit and Global Scholarships (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생 지원자는 merit 장학금(Ridgeline·Summit·Global Scholarship)을 자동으로 심사받아요. 누적 GPA에 따라 연 $5,000~$17,000이고, 2027년 가을 입학은 2026년 12월 15일까지 지원해야 심사 대상이 돼요.', merit_note_en='International applicants are automatically considered for merit scholarships (Ridgeline, Summit and Global Scholarships) totaling $5,000-$17,000 per year based on cumulative GPA. For Fall 2027 the scholarship deadline is December 15, 2026.', aid_source_url='https://www.boisestate.edu/global-international/cost-and-scholarships/undergraduate-scholarships/' where id=286;
update public.schools set merit_intl='International Academic Excellence Scholarship (automatic)', merit_intl_en='International Academic Excellence Scholarship (automatic)', merit_note='새로 합격한 국제학생 신입생·편입생은 별도 신청 없이 International Academic Excellence Scholarship 심사를 자동으로 받아요. 등록금 일부를 연 약 $3,000부터 지원하며(등록금에 따라 달라짐), 학사 학위 취득 때까지 최대 5년간 갱신돼요.', merit_note_en='All newly admitted international first-year and transfer undergraduates are automatically considered for the International Academic Excellence Scholarship. It covers part of tuition starting at about $3,000 per year (varies with tuition) and is renewable for up to five years or until a bachelor''s degree is earned.', aid_source_url='https://www.unomaha.edu/international-at-uno/student-support/scholarships-and-funding.php' where id=287;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Merit-based scholarships (Royce L. Money Chancellor''s, John C. Stevens, A.B. Barret, Dean''s, University Awards; automatic) + Wildcat Housing Grant', merit_intl_en='Merit-based scholarships (Royce L. Money Chancellor''s, John C. Stevens, A.B. Barret, Dean''s, University Awards; automatic) + Wildcat Housing Grant', merit_note='국제학생도 합격하면 지원서를 바탕으로 merit-based scholarship 대상으로 자동 심사되고, 공식 표 기준 금액은 연 $15,000~$23,000이며 기준 GPA를 유지하면 4년간 갱신돼요. 기숙사 거주 의무 학생은 Wildcat Housing Grant(연 $3,000, 최대 2년)도 받을 수 있어요. 시험 없이 지원해도 심사되지만 Presidential Scholarship은 시험 점수가 있어야 해요.', merit_note_en='Admitted international undergraduates are automatically considered for merit-based scholarships based on the admission application; the official award table lists $15,000-$23,000 per year, renewable for four years with the required GPA. Students required to live on campus also get the Wildcat Housing Grant ($3,000 per year for up to two years). Test-optional applicants are considered, but the Presidential Scholarship requires a test score.', aid_source_url='https://acu.edu/admissions-aid/international/tuition-and-financial-aid/' where id=288;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.montana.edu/data/common-data-set/cds25.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=61, intl_aid_avg=6849, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Undergraduate Merit-Based Scholarship (automatic); MSU Presidential Scholarship (separate application)', merit_intl_en='International Undergraduate Merit-Based Scholarship (automatic); MSU Presidential Scholarship (separate application)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생은 정식 합격 시 GPA(2.5 이상)만으로 International Undergraduate Merit-Based Scholarship을 자동 검토받고, 금액은 연 $5,000~$12,000이에요. 합격 순서대로 주기 때문에 일찍 지원하는 게 좋아요. 최고 장학금인 Presidential Scholarship은 12월 초 마감으로 별도 지원해야 해요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen offered full admission are automatically considered for the International Undergraduate Merit-Based Scholarship based on GPA (2.5+), worth $5,000–$12,000 per year and awarded in order of admission, so applying early helps. The Presidential Scholarship requires a separate application with an early-December deadline.', aid_source_url='https://www.montana.edu/international/admissions/INTL_UG_Scholarships.html' where id=289;
update public.schools set merit_intl='International Freshman Merit Scholarship; Housing Scholarship', merit_intl_en='International Freshman Merit Scholarship; Housing Scholarship', merit_note='GPA 3.5 이상(NIU 기준)이고 가족이 학비를 전액 부담하는 국제 신입생은 International Freshman Merit Scholarship을 연 $5,000~$9,000 받을 수 있고 갱신도 돼요. 합격 후 MyScholarships에서 따로 신청해야 해요. GPA 2.75 이상이면 Neptune Hall에 사는 조건으로 연 $2,000 Housing Scholarship도 신청할 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='Admitted international freshmen with a 3.5+ GPA (NIU calculation) who are fully family-sponsored can receive the renewable International Freshman Merit Scholarship of $5,000-$9,000 per year, applied for after admission through MyScholarships. A $2,000/year Housing Scholarship (GPA 2.75+, must live in Neptune Hall) is also available.', aid_source_url='https://www.niu.edu/international_admissions/paying-for-college/scholarships.shtml' where id=290;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.oakland.edu/media/Oakland/Assets/OIRA/files/Publications/CDS_2024-2025.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=127, intl_aid_avg=5851, intl_aid_year='2023-24', merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='Oakland University 공식 장학금 페이지에 따르면 국제학생(F-1/J-1)은 별도 표시된 경우를 빼고 OU 교내 merit 장학금 대상이 아니에요. 캐나다·멕시코 시민만 in-state 등록금을 내게 해주는 Non-Resident Award를 받을 수 있어서, 한국 국적 학생에게 해당하는 신입생 merit 장학금은 공식 페이지에 없어요.', merit_note_en='Oakland University''s official scholarship page states that international students are not eligible for OU scholarships except where noted; the only noted exception is the Non-Resident Award (in-state tuition) for citizens of Canada and Mexico. No first-year merit scholarship for other international students (e.g., Korean citizens) is listed.', aid_source_url='https://www.oakland.edu/futurestudents/scholarships-cost-aid/' where id=291;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.usm.edu/institutional-research/commondatasets2025-26final.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=432, intl_aid_avg=14475, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Freshman Honors College Admission and Scholarship; USM undergraduate and Foundation scholarships', merit_intl_en='Freshman Honors College Admission and Scholarship; USM undergraduate and Foundation scholarships', merit_note='USM 국제학생처(ISSS)의 비용·재정지원 페이지는 국제학생에게 학부 장학금, USM Foundation 장학금, Honors College 장학금을 안내해요. Honors College에 합격한 신입생은 4년간 연 $3,000를 받아요. 각 장학금의 국제학생 자격이나 자동 심사 여부는 공식 페이지에 자세히 나와 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='USM''s International Student and Scholar Services cost/aid page points international students to undergraduate scholarships, USM Foundation scholarships, and the Honors College scholarship; first-year applicants admitted to the Honors College receive $3,000 per year for four years. The official pages do not detail international eligibility or automatic consideration for each award.', aid_source_url='https://www.usm.edu/isss/costsfinancial-aid.php' where id=292;
update public.schools set c7_very_important='{}'::text[], c7_source_url='https://my.uiw.edu/ir/_docs/cds-24-25.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=150, intl_aid_avg=28829, intl_aid_year='2023-24', merit_intl='International academic scholarships (automatic, based on high school GPA)', merit_intl_en='International academic scholarships (automatic, based on high school GPA)', merit_note='국제 신입생도 지원서로 academic scholarship 심사를 자동으로 받고, 고등학교 GPA에 따라 연 $9,000–$22,000이에요(2026년 가을 입학 기준). 가톨릭 고등학교 졸업생은 연 $2,000을 자동으로 더 받아요.', merit_note_en='International first-time freshmen are automatically considered for academic scholarships with their application, ranging from $9,000 to $22,000 per year based on high school GPA (effective Fall 2026). Graduates of Catholic high schools automatically receive an additional $2,000 per year.', aid_source_url='https://www.uiw.edu/admissions/internationaladmissions/scholarships.html' where id=293;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Kean freshman merit scholarships (automatic), e.g. William Livingston, Kean Honors, Trustee Honors, Presidential Honors, Academic Merit Honors, World-Class', merit_intl_en='Kean freshman merit scholarships (automatic), e.g. William Livingston, Kean Honors, Trustee Honors, Presidential Honors, Academic Merit Honors, World-Class', merit_note='국제학생 지원자도 Kean의 신입생 메리트 장학금 대상이고, 입학 지원서로 자동 심사해서 따로 신청할 필요가 없어요. 등급별로 $500부터 뉴저지 주민 학비 전액까지 있고(예: Kean Honors 최대 $20,000), 최고 장학금인 William Livingston은 2월 1일까지, 나머지는 5월 30일까지 지원을 마쳐야 해요. 성적(누적 GPA 3.0)과 풀타임 등록을 유지하면 최대 4년 갱신돼요.', merit_note_en='International applicants are automatically considered for Kean''s freshman merit scholarships with no separate application; the six levels range from $500 to full in-state tuition (e.g., Kean Honors up to $20,000). Complete the application by February 1 for priority William Livingston consideration and by May 30 for other merit awards; awards renew for up to four years with full-time enrollment and a 3.0 GPA.', aid_source_url='https://www.kean.edu/offices/office-scholarship-services/merit-scholarships' where id=294;
update public.schools set merit_intl='International Merit Scholarships (automatic): Blue, Gold, Elite', merit_intl_en='International Merit Scholarships (automatic): Blue, Gold, Elite', merit_note='새로 입학하는 국제학생은 지원만 하면 별도 신청 없이 International Merit Scholarship 심사를 받아요. 학부생은 GPA 3.0 초과 Blue $5,000/년, 3.5 초과 Gold $7,000/년, 3.75 초과 Elite $9,000/년이에요. 전공·활동별로 in-state 학비만 내게 해 주는 Creative Arts·STEM Community Outreach 장학금도 있어요.', merit_note_en='New degree-seeking international students are automatically considered for International Merit Scholarships with no separate application: Blue ($5,000/yr, GPA above 3.0), Gold ($7,000/yr, above 3.5), and Elite ($9,000/yr, above 3.75). Some programs (Creative Arts, STEM Community Outreach) also let recipients pay in-state tuition.', aid_source_url='https://www.etsu.edu/international/scholarships/default.php' where id=295;
update public.schools set merit_intl='International Diversity Scholarship (out-of-state fee waiver; separate application)', merit_intl_en='International Diversity Scholarship (out-of-state fee waiver; separate application)', merit_note='Georgia Southern은 국제학생 학부생용 장학금을 제한적으로 운영해요. 대표적인 International Diversity Scholarship은 out-of-state 학비를 면제해 주는 방식으로, 가을 입학 F-1 신입생이 합격 후 별도 장학금 지원서를 내야 하고 성적·재정 필요·학교 기여도를 함께 봐요. 전공 학과의 성적 장학금에도 지원할 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='Georgia Southern offers limited scholarships specifically for international undergraduates. The main one, the International Diversity Scholarship, waives the out-of-state fee for selected fall-entry F-1 freshmen who submit a separate scholarship application after admission, considering academics, financial need and commitment. Students may also apply for academic scholarships offered by their college or department.', aid_source_url='https://www.georgiasouthern.edu/admissions-aid/international-students' where id=296;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.odu.edu/sites/default/files/2026/documents/cds-2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=10, intl_aid_avg=16000, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='International Student Scholarship (ISS) merit scholarship', merit_intl_en='International Student Scholarship (ISS) merit scholarship', merit_note='국제학생(비이민 비자)은 International Student Scholarship(ISS)에 지원할 수 있고, 연 최대 $16,000을 최대 4년 받을 수 있어요. 미국식 GPA 3.25 이상이 필요하고, 가을 입학은 4월 15일까지 지원하며 학업 목표를 담은 1쪽 에세이를 따로 내야 해요. 유지하려면 풀타임 등록과 GPA 3.25 이상이 필요해요.', merit_note_en='Newly admitted international students in valid non-immigrant visa status can receive the ISS merit scholarship of up to $16,000 per year, renewable for up to four years. It requires a 3.25+ U.S.-equivalent GPA, applying by April 15 for fall, and a one-page essay on academic intent and goals; renewal requires full-time enrollment and a 3.25 GPA.', aid_source_url='https://www.odu.edu/admission/international/iss-scholarship' where id=297;
update public.schools set merit_intl='International Undergraduate Academic Merit Scholarships (automatic): Presidential Excellence, Excellence, Trustees, Presidential, Provost', merit_intl_en='International Undergraduate Academic Merit Scholarships (automatic): Presidential Excellence, Excellence, Trustees, Presidential, Provost', merit_note='국제학생 신입생은 지원 서류가 모두 접수되면 별도 신청 없이 merit 장학금 심사를 자동으로 받아요. 신입생 장학금은 Presidential Excellence(연 $10,000)부터 Provost(연 $4,000)까지 5단계이고, 성적과 학교생활이 양호하면 매년 갱신돼요.', merit_note_en='International first-year applicants are automatically considered for merit scholarships once all application materials are received, with no separate form. First-year awards range from the Presidential Excellence Scholarship ($10,000/yr) to the Provost Scholarship ($4,000/yr) and renew yearly with satisfactory academic standing.', aid_source_url='https://mercy.edu/admissions-aid/international-admissions/international-undergraduate-academic-merit-scholarships' where id=299;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://campus.kennesaw.edu/offices-services/data-strategy/institutional-research/publications/common-data-set/cds-2025-2026.php', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=0, intl_aid_avg=null, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='Kennesaw State는 국제학생 전용 merit scholarship을 안내하지 않고, Common Data Set에서도 국제학생에게 학교 자체 장학금·그랜트를 주지 않는다고 밝혀요. 학비와 생활비는 스스로 마련할 계획을 세워야 해요.', merit_note_en='Kennesaw State does not list a merit scholarship for international first-year students, and its Common Data Set states that institutional scholarship/grant aid is not available to undergraduate nonresidents. Plan to fund costs independently.', aid_source_url='https://campus.kennesaw.edu/offices-services/data-strategy/institutional-research/publications/common-data-set/cds-2025-2026.php' where id=300;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','class_rank','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://getdata.louisiana.edu/sites/instres/files/UL_CDS_2023-2024.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=68, intl_aid_avg=26053, intl_aid_year='2022-23', merit_intl='Fleur-de-Lis Scholarship (full non-resident fee exemption)', merit_intl_en='Fleur-de-Lis Scholarship (full non-resident fee exemption)', merit_note='국제 신입생은 GPA 2.5 이상(미국 기준 환산)과 ACT 20 또는 SAT 1030 이상 등 조건을 채우고 정규 합격하면 Fleur-de-Lis Scholarship으로 비거주자 추가 학비를 전액 면제받아요(학기당 약 $6,864, 최대 8학기). 가을 학기는 6월 20일, 봄 학기는 12월 16일까지 지원해야 대상이 돼요.', merit_note_en='International first-time freshmen who are regularly admitted with a 2.5+ GPA (U.S. scale) and an ACT 20 or SAT 1030 receive the Fleur-de-Lis Scholarship, a full non-resident fee exemption (estimated $6,864 per semester for up to 8 semesters). Students must apply by June 20 for fall or December 16 for spring.', aid_source_url='https://louisiana.edu/scholarship/international' where id=302;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay','recommendations','extracurricular']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.spelman.edu/about/institutional-research/common-data-set/cds-c.html', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=10, intl_aid_avg=48041, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Merit-based scholarships for incoming first-year students (limited, competitive; no separate application stated)', merit_intl_en='Merit-based scholarships for incoming first-year students (limited, competitive; no separate application stated)', merit_note='Spelman은 국제학생에게 merit 장학금 외의 재정지원(need-based aid)은 제공하지 않는다고 공식 페이지에 밝히고 있어요. 입학처가 지원서의 GPA, (제출 시) 시험 점수, 봉사·리더십을 보고 소수의 신입생에게 merit 장학금을 경쟁 선발로 줘요. 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='Spelman''s official international page says merit-based scholarships are the only aid available to international students; it does not offer other financial aid to them. The Office of Admissions awards a limited number of competitive merit scholarships to incoming first-years based on the application (GPA, test scores if submitted, community service, leadership); amounts are not published there.', aid_source_url='https://www.spelman.edu/admissions/applying-to-spelman/international-students.html' where id=303;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay']::text[], c7_source_url='https://wp.stolaf.edu/iea/files/2026/01/StOlaf_CDS_2025-26.xlsx-CDS-C.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, merit_intl='International scholarships (automatic consideration) and St. Olaf merit scholarships; need-based International Student Grant', merit_intl_en='International scholarships (automatic consideration) and St. Olaf merit scholarships; need-based International Student Grant', merit_note='학위 과정 국제학생은 국제학생 장학금을 자동으로 심사받고, 국제학생 장학금은 $5,000~$81,000 범위였어요. 국제학생 지원은 주로 재정 필요(need) 기반이며, CSS Profile 또는 International Student Application for Financial Assistance를 내면 need-based International Student Grant를 받을 수 있어요. UWC 출신이 아니면 need-based grant와 merit scholarship을 합쳐 최대 등록금 100%까지 받을 수 있지만, 기숙사·식비 약 $20,000은 지원으로 채워지지 않아요.', merit_note_en='Degree-seeking international students are automatically considered for international scholarships, which have ranged from $5,000 to $81,000, and may also apply for merit scholarships. Most aid for internationals is need-based (International Student Grant, via the CSS Profile or St. Olaf''s International Student Application for Financial Assistance). Non-UWC international students can receive up to 100% of tuition in need-based grants plus merit scholarships, but about $20,000 in room and board is not covered by aid.', aid_source_url='https://wp.stolaf.edu/international-applications/financial-aid/', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=304;
update public.schools set c7_very_important='{}'::text[], c7_source_url='https://hope.edu/offices/data-assessment-accreditation/institutional-research/data-resources/common-data-sets/2025-2026-common-data-set.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=60, intl_aid_avg=29481, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='International Student Scholarship (automatic merit, up to $30,000)', merit_intl_en='International Student Scholarship (automatic merit, up to $30,000)', merit_note='국제학생은 지원하면 최대 $30,000의 merit scholarship 심사를 자동으로 받고, 결과는 합격할 때 함께 알려줘요. 고교 과목 수준, 성적, 에세이, 활동과 리더십을 보고 금액을 정하며, SAT/ACT 점수가 있으면 더 높게 고려될 수 있어요. 학교는 장학금을 받아도 가족이 보통 연 $30,000–$35,000을 부담할 수 있어야 한다고 안내해요.', merit_note_en='International degree-seeking applicants are automatically considered for a merit scholarship of up to $30,000, announced with the admission offer and renewable for four years; amounts reflect course quality, grades, personal statement, and activities/leadership, and SAT/ACT scores may earn higher consideration. Hope notes families generally must be able to pay $30,000-$35,000 per year.', aid_source_url='https://hope.edu/admissions/international-students.html' where id=305;
update public.schools set merit_intl='International freshman merit scholarship + out-of-state grant', merit_intl_en='International freshman merit scholarship + out-of-state grant', merit_note='국제학생 신입생에게는 $12,000~$18,000 메리트 장학금과 $4,000 out-of-state grant가 있어요. 지원하면 입학처가 장학금을 알려주므로 따로 신청할 필요는 없고, SAT/ACT 점수를 내면 추가 장학금을 받을 수 있으며 국내 학생과 같은 학업 장학금도 받을 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='International first-year students can receive a merit-based scholarship of $12,000 to $18,000 plus a $4,000 out-of-state grant; the admission office notifies applicants of awards after they apply, with no separate application. Submitting SAT/ACT scores can qualify students for additional scholarships, and internationals can receive the same academic scholarships as domestic students.', aid_source_url='https://andersonuniversity.edu/admission/international-students/' where id=306;
update public.schools set merit_intl='University merit scholarships (consideration by Nov. 15 application deadline)', merit_intl_en='University merit scholarships (consideration by Nov. 15 application deadline)', merit_note='국제학생 지원 안내 페이지에 따르면, 가을 입학 신입생은 11월 15일까지 지원하고 11월 30일까지 추가 서류를 내야 대부분의 대학 장학금 심사를 보장받아요. Chancellor''s Scholarship(Honors College 입학) 등 일부는 별도 절차가 필요하고, 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='Appalachian State''s international applicant page says fall first-year applicants should apply by Nov. 15 and submit all supplemental materials by Nov. 30 to guarantee consideration for most university scholarships. Some awards (e.g., the Chancellor''s Scholarship via the Honors College) require extra steps; amounts are not listed on that page.', aid_source_url='https://admissions.appstate.edu/how-apply/international-students' where id=307;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Bentley academic (merit) scholarships (automatic for all admission applicants)', merit_intl_en='Bentley academic (merit) scholarships (automatic for all admission applicants)', merit_note='Bentley는 가을 입학 신입생 지원자 전원을 academic 장학금 대상으로 자동 심사하고 별도 신청은 없어요(국제학생만 따로 언급하지는 않아요). 공식 안내상 성적 장학금은 연 $10,000부터 전액 학비까지이고, 합격 통보 때 함께 알려줘요.', merit_note_en='Bentley automatically considers all first-year (fall) applicants for academic scholarships with no separate application; the page does not single out international students. Officially, merit scholarships range from $10,000 to full tuition and are announced at the time of admission.', aid_source_url='https://www.bentley.edu/offices/financial-assistance/merit-based-scholarships' where id=308;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','interview','talent']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.berklee.edu/sites/default/files/2026-02/CDS_2025-2026.pdf?fv=b45dCYjY', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=2568, intl_aid_avg=1255, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Merit-based scholarships through the admissions and audition process', merit_intl_en='Merit-based scholarships through the admissions and audition process', merit_note='국제학생도 입학 심사와 오디션 과정을 통해 성적·재능 기반(merit) 장학금을 받을 수 있어요. 신입 국제학생은 학교의 재정 필요 기반(need-based) 장학금 대상이 아니에요. 2학기를 마친 뒤 Thrive Scholarship을 받고 싶으면 CSS Profile을 내는 것을 권장해요.', merit_note_en='International students are eligible for merit-based scholarships awarded through the admissions and audition process. Entering international students are not considered for need-based institutional aid; those who want to be considered for the Thrive Scholarship after their second semester are encouraged to submit the CSS Profile.', aid_source_url='https://www.berklee.edu/financial-aid-international-student-financial-assistance' where id=309;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Renewable academic scholarships (considered with application)', merit_intl_en='Renewable academic scholarships (considered with application)', merit_note='국제학생도 원서를 내면 갱신 가능한 학업 장학금(연 $5,000~$40,000)을 따로 신청 없이 심사받아요. 다만 학교는 merit·운동 장학금을 소수의 국제학생에게만 준다고 안내해요. 국제학생용 need-based 지원 대신 미국 시민 공동 대출인이 있으면 쓸 수 있는 민간 학자금 대출이 안내돼 있어요.', merit_note_en='International applicants are considered for renewable academic scholarships of $5,000-$40,000 per year when they apply, with no separate application, though Bryant notes it awards merit or athletic scholarships to a limited number of international applicants. No need-based aid is described for internationals; private loans with a U.S.-citizen co-borrower are mentioned.', aid_source_url='https://www.bryant.edu/undergraduate/undergraduate-admission/applying-bryant/international-students' where id=310;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://ir.baruch.cuny.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2025/07/CDS-2024-2025-FINAL-Jun-12.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, aid_source_url='https://ir.baruch.cuny.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2025/07/CDS-2024-2025-FINAL-Jun-12.pdf' where id=311;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.jjay.cuny.edu/sites/default/files/2024-02/CDS2023_2024.WORK-FILE.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, aid_source_url='https://www.jjay.cuny.edu/sites/default/files/2024-02/CDS2023_2024.WORK-FILE.pdf' where id=313;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://content-calpoly-edu.s3.amazonaws.com/ir/1/images/CDS-PDF-2025-2026_final_web_0.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=39, intl_aid_avg=31628, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='Cal Poly 국제학생 등록금 안내 페이지는 국제학생에게 재정지원(financial aid)을 제공하지 않는다고 밝히고 있어요. 그래서 학비와 생활비를 본인이나 후원자가 낼 수 있다는 재정 증명이 입학 등록에 중요해요.', merit_note_en='Cal Poly''s international tuition page states that it does not provide financial aid to international students, so applicants must show they (or a sponsor) can pay all educational expenses.', aid_source_url='https://www.calpoly.edu/admissions/international-student/tuition-and-fees', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=316;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.cpp.edu/data/documents/common-data-sets/cds2025.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=0, intl_aid_avg=null, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='학교의 공식 Common Data Set에 따르면 학위 과정 국제학생(비거주 외국인) 학부생에게는 교내 장학금이나 그랜트가 제공되지 않아요. 국제학생 입학 페이지에도 국제학생용 장학금 안내는 없어요.', merit_note_en='According to Cal Poly Pomona''s official Common Data Set, institutional scholarship and grant aid is not available to undergraduate degree-seeking nonresidents (international students). The international admissions pages do not list any scholarships for international students.', aid_source_url='https://www.cpp.edu/data/documents/common-data-sets/cds2025.pdf' where id=317;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.csuchico.edu/ir/_assets/documents/cds-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, merit_intl='International Student Excellence Scholarship (non-resident tuition fee waiver, application)', merit_intl_en='International Student Excellence Scholarship (non-resident tuition fee waiver, application)', merit_note='새로 입학하는 F-1 국제학생 학부생은 International Student Excellence Scholarship(비거주자 학비 감면)에 지원할 수 있고, 금액은 $2,000~$11,000이며 경쟁 선발이에요. 자동 심사가 아니라 4월 1일까지 별도 신청해야 하고, 재정 필요도 증명해야 하며, 첫 1년만 지원되고 갱신되지 않아요. 입학 후에는 Wildcat Scholarships(1~2월 신청)에도 지원할 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='New F-1 international undergraduates can apply for the competitive International Student Excellence Scholarship, a non-resident tuition fee waiver of $2,000 to $11,000; it requires a separate application by April 1 and demonstrated financial need, and covers only the first year (not renewable). Students can also apply for Wildcat Scholarships (application open January to mid-February).', aid_source_url='https://www.csuchico.edu/isss/documents-procedures/scholarships-grants.shtml' where id=318;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.csusm.edu/ipa/cds-files/cds-doc/cds_2025-2026.xlsx', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=144, intl_aid_avg=10415, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='CSUSM 공식 안내에 따르면 국제학생은 대부분의 재정지원 대상이 아니에요. 대신 CSU 제도에 따라 국제학생용 부분 학비 면제(tuition waiver)가 있는데, 입학 후 1년(최소 한 학기 이상 재학)이 지나야 신청할 수 있고 5월에 신청해요. 신입생 입학 시점에 받는 국제학생 성적 장학금은 안내돼 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='CSUSM states that international students are not eligible for most forms of financial aid. The CSU system offers a limited number of partial tuition waivers for international students, which CSUSM students can apply for (May deadline) only after their first year in residence. No merit scholarship for incoming international freshmen is listed.', aid_source_url='https://www.csusm.edu/global/intstudents/finaid.html' where id=320;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://calvin.edu/documents/common-data-set.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=478, intl_aid_avg=29234, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Knight Promise merit scholarships (Trustee''s, President''s, Provost''s, Dean''s, Faculty''s); $2,000 International Grant; Named Scholarships', merit_intl_en='Knight Promise merit scholarships (Trustee''s, President''s, Provost''s, Dean''s, Faculty''s); $2,000 International Grant; Named Scholarships', merit_note='국제학생도 Knight Promise를 통해 성적 장학금(Trustee''s $20,000부터 Faculty''s $10,000–$12,000까지, GPA 기준)과 $2,000 International Grant를 받을 수 있고, 최대 5년까지 갱신돼요. 합격 후 신청서 하나만 내면 Named Scholarships에도 자동으로 검토돼요. 국제학생 입학 심사는 need-blind이고, 재정 서류는 장학금 심사와 비자용으로만 써요.', merit_note_en='International students receive the Knight Promise, which includes GPA-based merit scholarships (from Trustee''s $20,000 down to Faculty''s $10,000–$12,000) plus a $2,000 Out-of-State or International Grant, renewable up to five years. Admitted students submit one application to be automatically considered for Named Scholarships. Calvin states it is need-blind for admission; financial documents are used only for aid and visa purposes.', aid_source_url='https://calvin.edu/admissions/international/process', need_blind_intl=true where id=321;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','recommendations','character']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.cedarville.edu/-/media/Files/PDF/Institutional-Research/Common-Data-Set/Freshman-Admission.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=97, intl_aid_avg=24977, intl_aid_year='2023-24', merit_intl='Academic scholarships incl. President''s Scholar Awards (automatic)', merit_intl_en='Academic scholarships incl. President''s Scholar Awards (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생도 지원하면 학업 장학금(President''s Scholar Awards 등)을 자동으로 심사받고, 갱신 조건을 채우면 매년 이어져요. 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않아요. 부족한 학비 일부를 돕는 국제학생용 need-based 장학금도 있어요.', merit_note_en='International applicants are automatically considered for academic scholarships (including President''s Scholar Awards), renewable annually if criteria are met; amounts are not listed on the international page. Cedarville also offers an international need-based scholarship to cover a portion of unmet need.', aid_source_url='https://www.cedarville.edu/admissions/international-students/financial-aid' where id=322;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.coastal.edu/media/2024siteassets/contentassets/documents/iraa/datareportsampdashboards/externalandpublicresources/cdsf25.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=78, intl_aid_avg=27105, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='University Merit Awards (automatic)', merit_intl_en='University Merit Awards (automatic)', merit_note='국제학생을 포함한 모든 지원자는 우선 지원 마감일까지 지원하면 별도 신청 없이 merit award 심사를 자동으로 받아요. 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않고, Coastal Educational Foundation 장학금은 따로 신청해야 해요(1차 12월 15일, 2차 3월 15일 마감).', merit_note_en='All applicants, including international students, are automatically considered for university merit awards if they apply by the published priority deadlines. The official page does not list amounts; Coastal Educational Foundation scholarships require a separate application (deadlines December 15 and March 15).', aid_source_url='https://www.coastal.edu/admissions/international/costsandscholarships/' where id=323;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://charleston.edu/institutional-research/files/documents/common-data/freshmen-admission.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=63, intl_aid_avg=14662, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='International Ambassador Scholarship ($10,000/yr, automatic); Departmental and Honors College scholarships', merit_intl_en='International Ambassador Scholarship ($10,000/yr, automatic); Departmental and Honors College scholarships', merit_note='합격한 국제학생(F-1 예정)은 별도 신청 없이 International Ambassador Scholarship(연 $10,000, 최대 4년 갱신) 대상으로 자동 심사돼요. 학과 장학금은 11월 1일부터 따로 신청해야 하고, Honors College에 11월 1일까지 지원하면 Honors 장학금도 자동 심사돼요. 국제학생에게 need-based 재정지원은 없어요.', merit_note_en='Admitted international students (intended F-1) are automatically considered for the International Ambassador Scholarship ($10,000 per year, renewable up to four years) with no separate application. Departmental scholarships need a separate application (opens Nov. 1), and Honors College applicants who apply by the Nov. 1 priority deadline are auto-considered for Honors scholarships. The College cannot offer need-based aid to international students.', aid_source_url='https://charleston.edu/admission/apply/international/international-partnerships.php', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=324;
update public.schools set c7_very_important='{}'::text[], c7_source_url='https://about.colum.edu/effectiveness/columbia_college_chicago_common_dataset_2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=178, intl_aid_avg=10942, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Columbia Excellence Award (automatic); Faculty Recognition Award (talent, separate application)', merit_intl_en='Columbia Excellence Award (automatic); Faculty Recognition Award (talent, separate application)', merit_note='국제학생은 별도 신청 없이 Columbia Excellence Award를 자동으로 검토받고, 누적 GPA에 따라 $8,500(3.0~3.29)·$10,500(3.3~3.74)·$12,500(3.75 이상)을 받아요(갱신 가능). 재능 기반 Faculty Recognition Award는 포트폴리오·오디션 등으로 따로 지원해야 해요.', merit_note_en='International students are automatically considered for the renewable Columbia Excellence Award with no separate application: $8,500 (GPA 3.0–3.29), $10,500 (3.3–3.74) or $12,500 (3.75+). The talent-based Faculty Recognition Award requires a separate application.', aid_source_url='https://www.colum.edu/admissions/requirements/international/undergraduate' where id=325;
update public.schools set merit_intl='International Chairman''s Award; International Discovery Award (automatic)', merit_intl_en='International Chairman''s Award; International Discovery Award (automatic)', merit_note='엘름허스트는 국제학생 전용 merit scholarship을 주고, 별도 신청서 없이 입학 지원서로 자동 심사해요. International Chairman''s Award는 최대 $20,000, International Discovery Award는 학업 성적에 따라 $1,000~$5,000이에요. 국제학생 FAQ에는 merit 장학금이 연 $5,000~$22,000 범위라고 나와 있고, 등록금 지원용 international student grant도 있어요.', merit_note_en='Elmhurst offers merit scholarships specifically for international students, decided from the admission application with no separate scholarship application: the International Chairman''s Award (up to $20,000) and the International Discovery Award ($1,000-$5,000, based on academic merit). The international FAQ describes merit awards ranging from $5,000 to $22,000 per year, and the university also awards international student grants toward tuition.', aid_source_url='https://www.elmhurst.edu/admission/international-students/admission-requirements/first-year/' where id=328;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://erau.edu/-/media/files/university/institutional-research/common-data-set/cds-2023-2024-db.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=419, intl_aid_avg=8185, intl_aid_year='2022-23', merit_intl='Embry-Riddle Scholarship (requires international scholarship application and official SAT/ACT)', merit_intl_en='Embry-Riddle Scholarship (requires international scholarship application and official SAT/ACT)', merit_note='국제 신입생도 Embry-Riddle Scholarship을 받을 수 있지만, 입학 지원과 별도로 international scholarship application을 내야 해요. 학업 성적과 재정 필요를 함께 보고 결정하며, 공식 SAT 또는 ACT 점수가 있어야 심사받을 수 있어요. 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen can be considered for the Embry-Riddle Scholarship if they apply for admission and submit a separate international scholarship application; decisions are based on academic merit and demonstrated financial need. An official SAT or ACT score is required for consideration, and no amounts are published.', aid_source_url='https://erau.edu/admissions/financial-aid/types-of-aid/scholarships/international-scholarships-and-financial-aid' where id=329;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://erau.edu/-/media/files/university/institutional-research/common-data-set/cds-2022-2023-pc.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, merit_intl='Embry-Riddle Scholarship (international scholarship application)', merit_intl_en='Embry-Riddle Scholarship (international scholarship application)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생도 Embry-Riddle Scholarship 심사를 받을 수 있지만, 입학 지원과 함께 별도의 국제학생 장학금 신청서를 내야 해요. 학업 성적과 재정 필요를 함께 보고, 공식 SAT 또는 ACT 점수가 있어야 심사 대상이 되며 점수가 좋으면 금액이 커질 수 있어요. 금액은 공식 페이지에 나와 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='International first-year applicants can be considered for the Embry-Riddle Scholarship by submitting a separate international scholarship application along with the admission application. Decisions are based on academic merit and demonstrated financial need, and an official SAT or ACT score is required; amounts are not published but ''can be significant'' with strong scores.', aid_source_url='https://erau.edu/admissions/financial-aid/types-of-aid/scholarships/international-scholarships-and-financial-aid' where id=330;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Emerson merit scholarships (automatic for admitted students)', merit_intl_en='Emerson merit scholarships (automatic for admitted students)', merit_note='국제학생을 포함한 모든 합격자는 별도 신청 없이 Emerson merit 장학금에 자동으로 심사되고, 결과는 합격 통지와 함께 알려줘요. 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않고, 국제학생 안내 페이지는 need-based 대신 merit 장학금·외부 장학금·사설 대출을 재원으로 안내해요.', merit_note_en='All admitted students, including international students, are automatically considered for Emerson merit scholarships with no separate application, and decisions come with the admission offer. Amounts are not published there, and the international aid page points to merit awards, outside scholarships, and private loans rather than need-based aid.', aid_source_url='https://emerson.edu/admission-aid/undergraduate-admission/undergraduate-financial-aid/financial-aid-for-international-students/' where id=331;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.fgcu.edu/planning/institutionalresearch/files/cds-2024-2025-ada.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=179, intl_aid_avg=10330, intl_aid_year='2023-24', merit_intl='Florida Linkage Institute out-of-state tuition waivers (select countries only)', merit_intl_en='Florida Linkage Institute out-of-state tuition waivers (select countries only)', merit_note='FGCU의 신입생 성적 장학금은 미국 시민이나 연방 학자금 기준의 자격 있는 비시민권자만 받을 수 있어서, 일반 국제학생은 대상이 아니에요. 국제학생은 국적에 따라 Florida Linkage Institute 주 외 등록금 면제를 신청할 수 있지만, 대상 국가(브라질·캐나다·일본·프랑스·멕시코 등)에 한국은 없어요.', merit_note_en='FGCU''s freshman merit scholarships require U.S. citizenship or eligible non-citizen status under federal student aid rules, so typical international students are not eligible. International students can apply for Florida Linkage Institute out-of-state tuition waivers based on nationality, but the listed countries/regions (e.g., Brazil, Canada, Japan, France, Mexico) do not include Korea.', aid_source_url='https://www.fgcu.edu/academics/global-engagement-office/international-students/scholarships' where id=333;
update public.schools set intl_aid_count=66, intl_aid_avg=6656, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Presidential Out-of-State Tuition Waiver (competitive application)', merit_intl_en='Presidential Out-of-State Tuition Waiver (competitive application)', merit_note='F-1 국제학생은 경쟁 선발인 Presidential Out-of-State Tuition Waiver(주외 학비 면제)에 따로 신청할 수 있어요. 재정 필요, 에세이, 봉사활동을 보고 뽑으며 인원이 적어 보장되지 않아요. 신청 기간은 10월 1일~12월 15일, 4월 1일~7월 1일이에요.', merit_note_en='F-1 international students may apply separately for the competitive Presidential Out-of-State Tuition Waiver, judged on financial need, essay quality and community service; waivers are limited and not guaranteed. Applications open Oct 1-Dec 15 and Apr 1-Jul 1.', aid_source_url='https://www.ggc.edu/admission-aid/international-student-and-scholar-services/international-student-admission-requirements' where id=334;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.gvsu.edu/cms4/asset/EFAB4AD2-A926-8D16-A5685AB71E0C7DC3/cds_2025-2026.xlsx', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=222, intl_aid_avg=9304, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='GVSU International Scholarship (automatic, Michigan tuition rate) + International Merit Scholarship ($2,500/yr, application by Feb 15)', merit_intl_en='GVSU International Scholarship (automatic, Michigan tuition rate) + International Merit Scholarship ($2,500/yr, application by Feb 15)', merit_note='합격한 국제학생(F-1 등) 학부생은 모두 GVSU International Scholarship을 자동으로 받아 미시간 주민 등록금을 내요(연 약 $6,700 상당, 4년 자동 갱신). 추가로 International Merit Scholarship(연 $2,500, 4년 갱신)은 가을 입학생 대상이며 2월 15일까지 별도 장학금 신청서를 내야 하고 위원회가 심사해요.', merit_note_en='All admitted international undergraduates on eligible visas (including F-1) automatically receive the GVSU International Scholarship, which lets them pay the Michigan tuition rate (worth about $6,700 per year, renewable for four years). The International Merit Scholarship ($2,500/yr, renewable for four years) is for fall entrants, requires a separate scholarship application by February 15, and is decided by committee.', aid_source_url='https://www.gvsu.edu/admissions/international-scholarships-and-assistantships-24' where id=335;
update public.schools set merit_intl=null, merit_intl_en=null, merit_note='Hampton 재정지원 사무실은 국제학생이 받을 수 있는 재정지원이 제한적이라고 안내하고, 외부 장학금 사이트를 소개해요. 입학처 merit scholarship(연 $10,000~$25,000)은 국제학생 대상 여부가 명시되어 있지 않고 FAFSA 제출을 요구하니, 지원 전에 입학처에 꼭 확인하세요.', merit_note_en='Hampton''s financial aid office says financial aid opportunities for international students are limited and points to external scholarship websites. The Office of Admission merit scholarship ($10,000-$25,000 per year) does not state whether international students are eligible and requires the FAFSA, so confirm with admissions before relying on it.', aid_source_url='https://home.hamptonu.edu/financialaid/international-students/' where id=336;
update public.schools set merit_intl='University merit scholarships (reviewed with admission; SAT/ACT required)', merit_intl_en='University merit scholarships (reviewed with admission; SAT/ACT required)', merit_note='국제학생도 다른 지원자와 똑같이 대학 merit scholarship 대상이고, 입학 심사와 동시에 자동으로 검토돼요. 다만 장학금 검토를 받으려면 SAT 또는 ACT 점수를 꼭 제출해야 해요.', merit_note_en='International students have the same access to High Point''s university merit scholarships as all applicants and are reviewed for them at the same time as admission, but SAT or ACT scores must be submitted to be considered.', aid_source_url='https://www.highpoint.edu/admissions/faqinternational/' where id=337;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://ithacaedu.sharepoint.com/sites/AIRPublicDocuments/Shared%20Documents/Common%20Data%20Set/Ithaca_College_CDS_2025-26.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=96, intl_aid_avg=53020, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='Ithaca College Scholarship (automatic); Presidential Scholarship (full tuition and fees, separate application)', merit_intl_en='Ithaca College Scholarship (automatic); Presidential Scholarship (full tuition and fees, separate application)', merit_note='국제학생도 장학금·그랜트 등 Ithaca College 자체 재정 지원을 받을 수 있고, 모든 신입생은 Ithaca College Scholarship에 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 심사돼요. 학비·수수료 전액인 Presidential Scholarship은 따로 지원해야 하며, 국제학생은 11월 1일까지 Ithaca College Financial Aid Application도 내야 해요. 국제학생은 IC Connect에서 재정 지원 신청서를 제출하거나 포기 의사를 밝혀야 입학 심사가 진행돼요.', merit_note_en='International undergraduates may receive Ithaca College institutional aid, including scholarships and grants, and all incoming students are automatically considered for the Ithaca College Scholarship. The full-tuition-and-fees Presidential Scholarship requires a separate application, and international citizens must also submit the Ithaca College Financial Aid Application by November 1; internationals must apply for or waive financial aid in IC Connect before their admission file is reviewed.', aid_source_url='https://www.ithaca.edu/tuition-financial-aid/undergraduate-financial-aid/types-financial-aid/scholarships/ithaca-scholarships-new-students' where id=338;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','character']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.loyola.edu/_media/department/institutional-research/documents/cds/CDS_2025-2026-PDF_FINAL_20260715.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=79, intl_aid_avg=54967, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Presidential, Dean''s and Loyola Scholarships (automatic merit)', merit_intl_en='Presidential, Dean''s and Loyola Scholarships (automatic merit)', merit_note='국제학생도 merit scholarship 대상이고, 입학 지원만 하면 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 심사돼요. 2027-28학년도 기준 Loyola Scholarship 연 $37,000부터 Presidential Scholarship 연 $45,000까지예요. 국제학생에게 need-based aid도 제한적으로 주지만 need-aware 심사이고 CSS Profile을 내야 하며, 필요 금액을 100% 채워준다고 보장하지 않아요.', merit_note_en='International students are automatically considered for merit scholarships with the admission application, ranging from $37,000 (Loyola Scholarship) to $45,000 (Presidential Scholarship) per year for 2027-28. Limited need-based aid is available to internationals through a need-aware review requiring the CSS Profile, and Loyola does not guarantee meeting 100% of need.', aid_source_url='https://www.loyola.edu/department/financial-aid/undergraduate/process/international.html', need_blind_intl=false, meets_full_need_intl=false where id=341;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.marist.edu/documents/d/guest/commondataset-ir', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=102, intl_aid_avg=24009, intl_aid_year='2022-23', merit_intl='Marist merit scholarships (automatic with admission application)', merit_intl_en='Marist merit scholarships (automatic with admission application)', merit_note='Marist는 입학 지원서를 낸 모든 학생을 메리트 장학금 대상으로 자동 심사하고, 선정되면 따로 알려줘요(국제학생 자격이 따로 명시되진 않았지만, 공식 통계상 국제학생도 학교 장학금을 받고 있어요). 국제학생이 니드 기반 학교 지원을 받으려면 CSS Profile(코드 2400)을 내야 하고, 얼리 디시전 I·얼리 액션은 11월 15일, 나머지는 2월 15일이 우선 마감이에요. 학교는 전액 장학금은 줄 수 없다고 밝히고 있어요.', merit_note_en='Every student who applies for admission is automatically considered for Marist merit scholarships, and recipients are notified directly (international eligibility is not stated explicitly, though the CDS reports need- and non-need-based aid to nonresidents). International applicants seeking need-based institutional aid must file the CSS Profile (code 2400) by November 15 (ED I/EA) or February 15 (ED II/RD); Marist states it cannot provide full scholarships.', aid_source_url='https://www.marist.edu/financial-aid/freshman/apply-for-aid' where id=342;
update public.schools set merit_intl='MCPHS merit award program (automatic review at acceptance)', merit_intl_en='MCPHS merit award program (automatic review at acceptance)', merit_note='MCPHS의 국제학생 재정 지원 페이지에 따르면, 신입생 지원자는 별도 신청 없이 합격 시점에 merit 장학금 심사를 자동으로 받아요. 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않고, 연방 need-based 지원은 영주권자 등 자격 있는 비시민권자만 받을 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='MCPHS''s international financial aid page says all first-year applicants are automatically reviewed for merit awards at the time of acceptance, with no separate application. Amounts are not listed, and federal need-based aid is limited to permanent residents and other eligible non-citizens.', aid_source_url='https://www.mcphs.edu/admission-and-aid/cost-and-aid/international-aid' where id=343;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Merrimack merit scholarship (automatic)', merit_intl_en='Merrimack merit scholarship (automatic)', merit_note='Merrimack은 국제학생을 merit 장학금 대상으로 자동 심사하고, 이전 학업 성적을 기준으로 합격 통지에 금액을 함께 알려줘요. 재정지원(financial aid)은 미국 시민권자·영주권자만 받을 수 있어요. 공식 페이지에 국제학생 장학금 금액은 나와 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='Merrimack automatically considers international students for a merit scholarship based on prior academic achievement, included in the offer of admission. Financial aid is only for U.S. citizen or permanent resident applicants, and the official page does not list international award amounts.', aid_source_url='https://www.merrimack.edu/admission/undergraduate/international/', meets_full_need_intl=false where id=344;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://iepr.mtsu.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/CDS_2025-2026.pdf', intl_aid_count=296, intl_aid_avg=15064, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Merit Scholarships: Global Scholar, International Achievement, International Access', merit_intl_en='International Merit Scholarships: Global Scholar, International Achievement, International Access', merit_note='F-1 신입생은 GPA·시험 점수에 따라 Global Scholar(연 $16,000), International Achievement(연 $12,000), International Access(연 $6,000) 성적 장학금을 받을 수 있고, 매년 갱신돼요. 가을 입학 우선 마감은 6월 1일이고, 예산이 소진될 때까지 선착순으로 줘요. 이 밖에 기금·학과 장학금도 있어요.', merit_note_en='F-1 first-year students can receive International Merit Scholarships based on GPA and test scores: Global Scholar ($16,000/yr), International Achievement ($12,000/yr) and International Access ($6,000/yr), renewable annually. The priority deadline is June 1 for fall, and funds are distributed first-come, first-served until exhausted; endowed and departmental scholarships are also available.', aid_source_url='https://intered.mtsu.edu/funding/' where id=345;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.mnsu.edu/globalassets/student-success-analytics-and-integrated-planning/cds/cds2022.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=973, intl_aid_avg=7542, intl_aid_year='2022-23', merit_intl='International Maverick Scholarship (automatic); Global Maverick Access Scholarship (targeted regions)', merit_intl_en='International Maverick Scholarship (automatic); Global Maverick Access Scholarship (targeted regions)', merit_note='새로 입학하는 국제학생 학부생은 모두 International Maverick Scholarship을 자동으로 받아요(학비 할인 형태). 2학년부터 유지하려면 F-1/J-1 신분 유지, 학기 GPA 2.5 또는 누적 GPA 3.0, 매 학기 12학점 이수가 필요해요. 특정 지역 출신 신입생 20명에게 주는 Global Maverick Access Scholarship은 따로 신청해야 해요.', merit_note_en='All new international undergraduates are automatically awarded the International Maverick Scholarship (a tuition reduction), renewable with valid F-1/J-1 status, a 2.5 term or 3.0 cumulative GPA, and 12 completed credits each semester. The Global Maverick Access Scholarship (20 awards for first-year F-1 students from targeted regions) requires an application.', aid_source_url='https://www.mnsu.edu/paying-for-college/scholarships/international-student-scholarships/' where id=346;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Quest Whole Leader Scholarship (automatic at admission; full-tuition Quest by nomination + essay); International Quest Whole Person Scholarship', merit_intl_en='Quest Whole Leader Scholarship (automatic at admission; full-tuition Quest by nomination + essay); International Quest Whole Person Scholarship', merit_note='합격하면 Quest Whole Leader Scholarship이 자동으로 주어지고(금액은 최대 전액 학비까지 다양), 추천(nomination)을 받고 Quest Essay를 내면 15명에게 주는 전액 학비 Quest Scholarship에도 도전할 수 있어요. 미국 밖 출신 Quest 수혜자는 International Quest Whole Person Scholarship도 받을 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='Admitted students are automatically awarded a Quest Whole Leader Scholarship (amounts vary, up to full tuition), and with a nomination plus a Quest Essay can compete for one of 15 full-tuition Quest Scholarships. Quest recipients from outside the U.S. are also eligible for the International Quest Whole Person Scholarship.', aid_source_url='https://oru.edu/tuition-and-financial-aid/undergraduate/scholarships-and-grants/index.php' where id=348;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','character','religious_affiliation']::text[], c7_source_url='https://drive.google.com/file/d/1AF3_j6XgtYk4R4BqztlNZ6zonQEIyiAf/view', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=34, intl_aid_avg=38531, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='International Merit Scholarship (GPA + TOEFL/IELTS based)', merit_intl_en='International Merit Scholarship (GPA + TOEFL/IELTS based)', merit_note='국제학생은 GPA와 TOEFL/IELTS 점수를 기준으로 International Merit Scholarship을 받을 수 있어요. 그 밖에 merit 장학금, 활동(involvement) 장학금, endowed 장학금에도 지원할 수 있고, 자세한 금액과 절차는 국제학생 입학 담당자에게 확인해야 해요.', merit_note_en='International students are eligible for an International Merit Scholarship based on GPA and TOEFL/IELTS scores, and may also qualify for other merit-based, involvement and endowed scholarships. Amounts for the international award are not published; students are directed to contact the international admissions counselor.', aid_source_url='https://www.pointloma.edu/undergraduate/admissions/how-apply' where id=349;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','essay']::text[], c7_source_url='https://academic-affairs.providence.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/14/2022/04/cds-2021-22.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=71, intl_aid_avg=61285, intl_aid_year=null, merit_intl='Academic Tuition Scholarships (automatic, avg. ~$25,000/year); Fine Arts Tuition Scholarship', merit_intl_en='Academic Tuition Scholarships (automatic, avg. ~$25,000/year); Fine Arts Tuition Scholarship', merit_note='국제학생도 입학 지원 시 Academic Tuition Scholarships에 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 심사되고, 평균 금액은 연 약 $25,000이며 합격생의 약 30%가 받아요. 국제학생에게 제한된 need-based 지원도 있지만(CSS Profile 필요), 성적·필요 기반 지원을 합쳐도 학비(tuition)를 넘지 않고 기숙사·식비는 스스로 부담해야 해요. 국제학생 입학은 재정 상황을 고려하는 need-aware 방식이에요.', merit_note_en='International applicants are automatically considered for Academic Tuition Scholarships (average about $25,000 per year, awarded to roughly 30% of admits). Limited need-based aid is available to internationals via the CSS Profile, but combined aid never exceeds tuition and students must cover housing and food; international admission is need-aware.', aid_source_url='https://admission.providence.edu/international-applicants-2/cost-financial-aid/', need_blind_intl=false where id=350;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Rider merit scholarships (automatic with admission)', merit_intl_en='Rider merit scholarships (automatic with admission)', merit_note='Rider는 국제학생 학부생에게도 다양한 merit 장학금을 주고, 합격하면 대부분 별도 신청 없이 자동으로 심사돼요. 국제학생에게 need-based 재정지원은 없어요. 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='Rider offers merit scholarships to international undergraduate students, and admitted students are automatically considered for most admission-based merit awards without a separate application. Need-based assistance is not available to international students; award amounts are not published on the pages reviewed.', aid_source_url='https://www.rider.edu/admissions/international/faqs' where id=351;
update public.schools set merit_intl='RWU International Merit Scholarship (automatic)', merit_intl_en='RWU International Merit Scholarship (automatic)', merit_note='RWU International Scholarship은 국제학생 전용 merit scholarship으로, 합격한 국제학생에게 등록금·기숙사·식비의 최대 50% 규모 장학금이 보장돼요. 매년 갱신되고 별도 신청서는 필요 없어요.', merit_note_en='The RWU International Scholarship is a merit scholarship for international students: accepted international applicants are guaranteed an award valued at up to 50% of tuition, housing and food. It is annual and renewable, and no separate application is needed.', aid_source_url='https://www.rwu.edu/admission/international-students' where id=352;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Undergraduate academic merit scholarships ($1,000-$4,000/yr)', merit_intl_en='Undergraduate academic merit scholarships ($1,000-$4,000/yr)', merit_note='국제학생 FAQ에 따르면 자격이 되는 학부생에게 학업 성적 기준으로 연 $1,000–$4,000의 장학금을 줘요. 다만 같은 페이지의 대학원생 서류 안내에는 국제학생 장학금이 없다는 문장도 있어서, 지원 전에 입학처에 직접 확인하는 게 좋아요.', merit_note_en='Saint Xavier''s international admission FAQ says eligible undergraduates receive academic merit scholarships of $1,000 to $4,000 per year. However, the same page''s graduate document checklist states the university does not have scholarships for international students, so confirm with admissions before relying on it.', aid_source_url='https://www.sxu.edu/admission/international/index.html' where id=353;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.shsu.edu/offices-departments/data-analytics-decision-support/fall-2025-cds-final.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=59, intl_aid_avg=17724, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Competitive scholarships via Scholarships4Kats (application)', merit_intl_en='Competitive scholarships via Scholarships4Kats (application)', merit_note='국제학생 합격자 체크리스트에도 Scholarships4Kats 장학금 신청서를 우선 마감일(11월 1일)까지 내라고 안내돼 있어요. 자동 심사가 아니라 신청서를 내야 하고 경쟁 선발이며, 국제학생 전용 장학금이나 금액은 공식 페이지에 따로 나와 있지 않아요. 텍사스 비거주 학생이 $1,000 이상 경쟁 장학금을 받으면 비거주자 학비 감면(주민 학비 적용)을 받을 수 있다고 안내돼 있어요.', merit_note_en='SHSU''s accepted-international-student checklist tells students to complete the Scholarships4Kats application by the priority date (November 1); scholarships are competitive and require the application, and no international-specific awards or amounts are published. Non-Texas residents selected for a single competitive SHSU scholarship of at least $1,000 may receive a non-resident tuition waiver for the same period.', aid_source_url='https://www.shsu.edu/cost-aid/types-of-aid/scholarships.php' where id=354;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.siena.edu/files/resources/oie-common-data-set-2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, merit_intl='Siena Guarantee (at least $57,000 over four years) and merit-based scholarships', merit_intl_en='Siena Guarantee (at least $57,000 over four years) and merit-based scholarships', merit_note='국제학생도 합격하고 재정 지원 양식(financial aid form)을 내면 Siena Guarantee로 4년간 최소 $57,000(연 최소 $14,250, merit 장학금 포함)을 받을 수 있어요. merit 장학금은 고교 성적(SAT/ACT는 선택)으로 정하고, 같은 양식으로 need-based 추가 지원도 심사받을 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='International students who are admitted and submit Siena''s financial aid form are eligible for the Siena Guarantee of at least $57,000 over four years (at least $14,250 per year, including merit scholarships). Merit awards are based on high school average (SAT/ACT optional), and the same form is used to review additional need-based aid.', aid_source_url='https://www.siena.edu/offices/admissions/international-students/tuition-and-fees/' where id=355;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Merit-based scholarships (academic, athletic, music, theater and film; same academic criteria as U.S. students)', merit_intl_en='Merit-based scholarships (academic, athletic, music, theater and film; same academic criteria as U.S. students)', merit_note='국제학생도 학업·운동·음악·연극·영화 분야 merit 장학금을 받을 수 있고, 학업 장학금 기준은 미국 학생과 같아요. 니드 기반이거나 FAFSA가 필요한 장학금은 국제학생이 받을 수 없어요. 국제학생 전용 endowed 장학금은 한 학기 이상 재학한 뒤에만 신청할 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='International students can qualify for merit-based scholarships (academic, athletic, music, theater and film), with academic scholarships using the same criteria as for U.S. citizens. Need-based or FAFSA-based scholarships are not available to international students, and endowed scholarships for internationals are only open after at least one semester at SEU.', aid_source_url='https://seu.edu/admission/international/' where id=356;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Merit-based scholarships and residency grant (no international-specific awards)', merit_intl_en='Merit-based scholarships and residency grant (no international-specific awards)', merit_note='국제학생도 merit 장학금·장학 그랜트를 받을 수 있고, 공식 페이지 기준 평균 연 $19,000, 자격을 갖추면 최대 $25,000예요. 풀타임·학업 양호 시 최대 4년 갱신되며, 전액 장학금이나 국제학생 전용 장학금은 없어요. 국제학생은 need-based 정부 재정지원(FAFSA) 대상이 아니에요.', merit_note_en='International students can receive merit-based scholarships and grants averaging $19,000 per year and up to $25,000 for qualified students, renewable for up to four years with full-time good standing. There are no full-tuition or international-specific scholarships, and internationals are not eligible for need-based government aid (FAFSA).', aid_source_url='https://www.stevenson.edu/admissions-aid/getting-started/international-students/' where id=358;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','class_rank']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.tarleton.edu/institutional-data-analytics/wp-content/uploads/sites/397/2025/05/C.-First-Time-First-Year-Admission.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=480, intl_aid_avg=5888, intl_aid_year=null, aid_source_url='https://www.tarleton.edu/institutional-data-analytics/wp-content/uploads/sites/397/2025/05/H.-Financial-Aid.pdf' where id=359;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Presidential Scholarship (automatic at admission)', merit_intl_en='Presidential Scholarship (automatic at admission)', merit_note='미국 시민이 아닌 학생도 합격 때 Presidential Scholarship 대상으로 자동 심사되고, 금액은 연 $10,000~$18,000이에요. 비가중 GPA와 과목 난이도, 리더십·봉사 경험을 보고, 기준 GPA를 유지하면 매년 갱신돼요. 학과 장학금은 대부분 별도 신청이 필요하고, need-based grant는 FAFSA 제출이 조건이에요.', merit_note_en='U.S. citizens and non-citizens are automatically considered at admission for the Presidential Scholarship ($10,000-$18,000 per year), based on unweighted GPA, course rigor and leadership or community service; it is renewable with a minimum GPA. Most departmental scholarships need a separate application, and the need-based grant requires the FAFSA.', aid_source_url='https://www.ut.edu/admissions/financial-aid/scholarships-and-grants' where id=360;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.towson.edu/ir/documents/cds_c_2526.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=53, intl_aid_avg=15746, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='International Student Scholarship (automatic consideration); You Are Welcome Here (YAWH) Scholarship (separate application)', merit_intl_en='International Student Scholarship (automatic consideration); You Are Welcome Here (YAWH) Scholarship (separate application)', merit_note='F/J 비자 신입생은 입학 지원서만으로 International Student Scholarship을 자동 검토받고, 금액은 경우마다 달라요(예산이 한정돼 2월 1일까지 서류 완료 권장). 가을 신입생 대상 You Are Welcome Here Scholarship은 등록금의 약 절반 수준이며 2월 1일까지 별도 YAWH 신청서를 내야 해요. 국제학생은 주정부(MHEC) 지원과 일부 TU 입학 장학금 대상이 아니에요.', merit_note_en='International (F/J) freshmen are automatically considered for the International Student Scholarship through the admission application (amounts vary; complete file by February 1 recommended). The You Are Welcome Here (YAWH) Scholarship covers roughly half of tuition for select fall freshmen and requires a separate YAWH application by February 1; internationals are not eligible for MHEC state aid or certain TU admission scholarships.', aid_source_url='https://www.towson.edu/admissions/financialaid/programs/scholarships/international.html' where id=361;
update public.schools set merit_intl='Freshman Distinguished/Merit/Honor Global Scholar (automatic); President''s Leadership Council and Leaders of Tomorrow scholarships (application)', merit_intl_en='Freshman Distinguished/Merit/Honor Global Scholar (automatic); President''s Leadership Council and Leaders of Tomorrow scholarships (application)', merit_note='국제 신입생은 GPA 또는 SAT/ACT 기준으로 Freshman Global Scholar 장학금을 연 $2,000~$4,000(Honor/Merit/Distinguished) 받을 수 있고 별도 신청이 필요 없어요. 리더십 활동이 있으면 신청서를 내서 President''s Leadership Council(연 $11,375)이나 Leaders of Tomorrow(연 $8,250)에 도전할 수 있는데, 가을 학기 우선 마감은 5월 1일이고 Global Scholar와 중복 수혜는 안 돼요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen receive Freshman Global Scholar awards of $2,000-$4,000 per year (Honor/Merit/Distinguished) based on GPA or SAT/ACT with no application required. Students with leadership involvement can apply for the President''s Leadership Council ($11,375/year) or Leaders of Tomorrow ($8,250/year) scholarships (fall priority deadline May 1), which cannot be combined with the Global Scholar awards.', aid_source_url='https://www.uco.edu/students/oga/future-students/scholarships.PHP' where id=362;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://ung.edu/institutional-effectiveness-research-administration/_uploads/files/common-data-sets/cds-2025-2026.xlsx', demonstrated_interest=false, merit_intl='International Student Scholarship (tuition reduction; apply after admission); foundation-funded scholarships via ScholarshipUniverse', merit_intl_en='International Student Scholarship (tuition reduction; apply after admission); foundation-funded scholarships via ScholarshipUniverse', merit_note='F-1 국제학생 학부생은 합격 후 International Student Scholarship에 신청할 수 있고, 등록금이 줄어 학기당 약 $3,500를 아낄 수 있어요. 신청 방법은 합격 후 안내돼요. 그 밖에 재단 장학금도 ScholarshipUniverse에서 따로 신청할 수 있어요.', merit_note_en='Admitted undergraduate F-1 students can apply for the International Student Scholarship, which reduces UNG tuition for roughly $3,500 in savings per semester; application details are sent after admission. International students are also eligible for foundation-funded scholarships through ScholarshipUniverse (separate application).', aid_source_url='https://ung.edu/landing/international-students.php' where id=363;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.utc.edu/sites/default/files/2026-09/cds-2025-2026.pdf', demonstrated_interest=false, intl_aid_count=15, intl_aid_avg=1269, intl_aid_year='2025-26', aid_source_url='https://www.utc.edu/sites/default/files/2026-09/cds-2025-2026.pdf' where id=364;
update public.schools set c7_very_important='{}'::text[], c7_source_url='https://wit.edu/sites/default/files/2026-02/Common%20Data%20Set%202025-2026%20(1).pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=158, intl_aid_avg=9677, intl_aid_year=null, merit_intl='Presidential Merit Scholarship (automatic); Early Action Scholarship', merit_intl_en='Presidential Merit Scholarship (automatic); Early Action Scholarship', merit_note='국제학생도 고교 성적을 바탕으로 merit scholarship을 받을 수 있고, 지원하면 Presidential Merit Scholarship 심사를 자동으로 받아요(평균 수혜액 연 $20,000–$25,000). Early Action 1·2로 지원하면 $1,500 Early Action Scholarship 대상이 돼요. 2026년 가을 입학생부터는 수가 제한된 International Grant(need-based)도 있는데, 합격 결정 전에 별도 신청서를 내야 해요.', merit_note_en='International students can receive merit scholarships and are automatically considered for the Presidential Merit Scholarship (average award $20,000-$25,000 per year); applying Early Action 1 or 2 also qualifies for a $1,500 Early Action Scholarship. Starting with Fall 2026 applicants, a limited number of need-based International Grants are available via a separate aid application due before the admission decision (Feb 1 for EA, Mar 1 for RD).', aid_source_url='https://wit.edu/admissions/undergraduate/international' where id=365;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','class_rank','gpa','standardized_tests']::text[], c7_source_url='https://www.wcu.edu/_files/learn/provost/2024-2025-CDS.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, merit_intl='WCU Scholarships via Scholarship Portal (application)', merit_intl_en='WCU Scholarships via Scholarship Portal (application)', merit_note='국제학생도 WCU에 입학 지원서를 낸 뒤 Scholarship Portal에서 WCU 장학금에 신청할 수 있어요(10월 1일 오픈, 학부 마감 2월 1일). 자동 심사가 아니라 별도 신청이 필요하고, 금액은 공식 페이지에 나와 있지 않으며 전액 장학금은 없다고 안내돼 있어요. 또 NC Promise 덕분에 국제학생 학부 등록금이 학기당 $3,500(기타 비용 별도)로 낮아요.', merit_note_en='After applying to WCU, international students can apply for WCU scholarships through the Scholarship Portal (opens October 1; undergraduate deadline February 1); consideration is not automatic, amounts are not published, and WCU states it does not offer full scholarships. Under the NC Promise Tuition Plan, international undergraduates pay reduced tuition of $3,500 per semester (other fees extra).', aid_source_url='https://www.wcu.edu/learn/office-of-global-engagement/international-students/costs-for-international-students.aspx' where id=366;
update public.schools set intl_aid_count=45, intl_aid_avg=27705, intl_aid_year='2024-25', merit_intl='Academic Merit Award (international students; min. 3.0 unweighted GPA)', merit_intl_en='Academic Merit Award (international students; min. 3.0 unweighted GPA)', merit_note='국제 신입생은 비가중 GPA 3.0 이상이면 Academic Merit Award 대상이고, SAT/ACT는 필수가 아니에요. 합격 후 공식 고교 성적표를 제출해 지원 서류가 완비되면 심사되며, 추가 장학금(TopDollar)은 매년 12월 12일까지 지원·합격한 학생이 우선 고려돼요. 공식 페이지에 금액은 나와 있지 않아요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen with at least a 3.0 unweighted GPA qualify for consideration for an Academic Merit Award; SAT/ACT is not required, but you need a complete application (admitted plus official high school transcript). Additional scholarships via TopDollar give priority to students who apply and are admitted by December 12; award amounts are not listed on the official page.', aid_source_url='https://www.wku.edu/international/international-scholarships.php' where id=367;
update public.schools set c7_very_important=array['rigor','gpa']::text[], c7_source_url='https://oie.wwu.edu/files/2026/02/CDS_2025-26.pdf', demonstrated_interest=true, intl_aid_count=72, intl_aid_avg=10328, intl_aid_year='2025-26', merit_intl='International Achievement Award (IAA; automatic, Western application only)', merit_intl_en='International Achievement Award (IAA; automatic, Western application only)', merit_note='국제학생 신입생은 입학 지원서로 International Achievement Award(IAA)를 자동 심사받고 별도 장학금 신청은 없어요. 비거주자 학비를 일부 깎아 주는 방식으로 최대 연 $10,000, 4년까지 받을 수 있고 GPA 3.0 이상이 필요해요. 단, Common App이 아닌 Western 자체 지원서로 우선 마감일까지 지원해야 대상이 돼요.', merit_note_en='International freshmen are automatically considered for the International Achievement Award (IAA), a partial non-resident tuition waiver for up to four years, with no separate scholarship application; WWU lists international merit awards of up to $10,000 per year and requires a 3.0+ GPA. The IAA is only available to students who apply through Western''s own application (not the Common App) by the priority deadline.', aid_source_url='https://admissions.wwu.edu/cost/international-scholarships' where id=368;
update public.schools set merit_intl='International Merit Scholarship', merit_intl_en='International Merit Scholarship', merit_note='F-1 비자로 입학하는 국제 신입생은 고교 성적을 바탕으로 International Merit Scholarship(연 $6,500–$13,500, 4년)을 받을 수 있어요. 6월 1일까지 합격해야 심사 대상이 되고, 유지하려면 GPA 2.75 이상과 기숙사 거주가 필요해요. 학교는 국제학생에게 전액 장학금은 주지 않는다고 안내해요.', merit_note_en='First-time full-time international students seeking F-1 status can receive the International Merit Scholarship ($6,500–$13,500 per year for 4 years) based on secondary school achievement. Students must be accepted by June 1 to be considered, and renewal requires a 2.75 GPA and living in campus housing. York states it does not offer full scholarships to international students.', aid_source_url='https://www.ycp.edu/cost-aid/scholarships-grants' where id=369;
